<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">NWER NYI</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUK</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Nsoo Teofailus,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 1:1</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Ane gbalee ebnyon nsol nyi ma lim go egahre ellong, nyi e kpo taame tv go etingitingi. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Bo nyono ana ane ba jolo go mbomannahb, ba nyehne nsol nyio go amahr tong-r, bo ji jolo alokeltum ba Alum Esowo.<verse eid="LUK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Tib eji me n tob seb nsol nyio kpee kahn nob nob ana jolo go mbomannahb, owo wahng ka n tiri re, nꞌnob re, me n tob nyon nsol nyio go ntooranti ka-a, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />eji a lꞌkahn re, nsol nyi bo tib-a no lohko li go etingitingi.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo jele Jon ji nwohngalahb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Ngare nyi Herod jolo ntul go Judea, nlimajom awohng jolo o, no bo jo lung-e re Sekaraya. Á woomo go ellong abalimajom ba Abija jolo ntubesi abo mahne mahne. Nkal ewe, bo jo lung-e re Elisabet ji lohngo go etꞌtohngo ji Eron. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bo ane abal abal jolo atingitingi ane go esamahr Esowo, ba jo bum atahm nya Jehova kpee nseenga nseenge. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Bo jelem mmon awohng awohng. Tibre Elisabet jolo ngum a nnenkal. Ngare nyio bobkul ane abal abal.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Efung abehng Sekaraya jo limi eltum njom alimi go etahk Esowo, tib jolo esennge ji ellong nꞌne. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ana eljini ni abalimajom jolo no, owo bo kehm-e yehke re á kak agun go insens, jo teebe go ekpꞌkpa Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Ane baka kpee jolo ga elatahk, jo kak ero ngare nyi insens jo teebe.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Owo enjel nyi Esowo kehm lohngo ba kpir-e. Enjel nyio yiimi go ejang eboblum bi edi njom jio ji insens jo teebe. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Eji Sekaraya nyehn-e no, ala kehm-e teele, á kehme elfahle. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Owo enjel nyio kehm-e tongo re, “Sekaraya, ka kpe fahl! Esowo ebwuk ero eba. Elisabet nkal ewa bahke jele mmon no nlum ka-a. A bahk-e gungu mbing re Jon. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />A bahke bele eyebatahng, fere jo geere. Ane gbalee, eltim bahke yebe bo, ń lꞌjel-e. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Tibre á bahke jolo njꞌjoka nne go esamahr bi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:11</char></note> Á nehm jo wo amahm, a nsol elwoko nyehko nyi kpo lim nne. Bomo ngare nyi á wob nnyehn go ala, Etingi Etohko bahk-e ruru go atahng. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Á bahke feere abon Israel gbalee ba ka Esowo, Ntul abo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:5-6</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Á bahk-e gboko mbang a etohko ji Elaija, a nsahm a nsahm enye,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 17:11-13</char></note> eji á lꞌsennge babnde ntim, bo fere jol ana abonse, fere sennge akpuuru ane ntim, bo fere bel elkahne ni atingitingi ane, fere toobo ane bum Esowo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Owo Sekaraya kehm bahbe enjel nyio re, “M bahke limi renan, kehm kahne, joare lohko li go etingitingi? Tibre me n kul, nkal ewame fvfo ebtob kul.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Enjel nyio kehm-e faange re, “Me wo li Gebriel ji kpo yiimi go esamahr bi Esowo. Esowo bi tum-m no re me m ba bung a na, fere tiing-a nnoobo etib bia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 1:14</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />A bahke gboko ekamme. A nehm ma kpe bung tete rehng efung bi ejum jia bahke jolo, tib eji a ki taame tv alum enyame nya bahke jolo go etingitingi, ngare nyio lꞌbiingi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ane ba jo sik Sekaraya jo kpo bo esi sehng, eji á ma laange ano go ekpꞌkpa Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Eji á lohngo go elatahk, á kpeem jo ma bung a bo. Owo bo kehm soro kahn re, yebnyehn nkpokosi ejum go ekpꞌkpa Esowo. Eji á ki ma jo bung go nnyo, á fere jo bung a bo go abo abo. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Eji afung nya á jo lim eltum go etahk Esowo ma mal, á kehm tahme kehnge.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Eji ma jol ano, Elisabet nkal ewe kehm sake ela, sa woomo ekpꞌkpa tete nnyahng elon. Á jo bungu re, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Anv, eji m ma fili Jehova ndon, owo á ma-m kak ebo mbang nyia, eji á lꞌlim-m, n jo lub ane.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etib bi enjel Gebriel tiingi Meri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Eji ma kang nnyahng erakera mi Elisabet sa ela, owo Esowo kehm tumu enjel Gebriel tv go ejahbe ajehng ji jolo go Galili, ji bo kpo lung re Nasaret. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Á ko etib ba a bi re á ba tiingi ngbahme anyehng nyi bo jo lung-e re Meri ji bo kala nꞌnoongo a ne. Nne awohng no bo jo lung-e re Josef ji lohng go etꞌtohngo ji ntul a Devid wo lame elbal a ne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 1:18</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Enjel nyio kehm ba kpiri Meri, kehm-e tongo re, “M ma-a kak nnyo, wo ji Esowo ma-a fuulu. Jehova li a na.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Owo ala kehm sahb tꞌteele Meri, eji á wuku etib bi enjel nyio tiing-e no. Á kehm kehme eltiiri bade ana nnyo akake mio lohngo no.<verse eid="LUK 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Enjel nyio kehm-e tongo re, “Meri, ka kpe fahl! Esowo ma-a fuulu. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />A bahke sake ela, jel nnenlum no a bahk-e gungu mbing re Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 1:21-23</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Á bahke jolo njꞌjoka nne. Bo bahke jo lung-e re Mmon no Esowo bi gbale sehng. Jehova bahk-e jehke go eti etul ji nde Devid. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Á bahke fili abon Jekob go njinanjini. Etul ebe, esꞌkohlo nehm bel.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Owo Meri kehm bahbe enjel nyio re, “Jia kehm jolo renan, eji n ki kpi nlum!”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Enjel nyio kehm-e faange re, “Etingi Etohko bahke jolo a na. Nsahm nyi Esowo bahk-a bulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 1:20</char></note> Owo bahke wahng ka mbarebara mmon no a bahke jele, bo bahke jo lung-e re Mmon no Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Nyehn Elisabet, nne a nnahb ewa, ji bo jo lung-e re ngum a nnenkal, yebsa ela bi á bahke jele nnenlum, nnyahng erakera mi a, jol eji á ma kꞌkul o. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Tibre Esowo, ejumjum limm, ji á kil jo ma lim.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Owo Meri kehm bungu re, “Me n li nlokeltum no Esowo. Nong, jol ana a bungu no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:38">Enjel nyio kehm soro tahm.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Meri je song nyehn Elisabet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Jol gaam kang, Meri kehm toobo ebjing, foomo tahm song rehng go ejahbe ajehng ji jolo go ejang awong nya Judea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Owo á kehm song yange go etahk Sekaraya, kehm song kak Elisabet nnyo.<verse eid="LUK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Eji Elisabet wuku nnyo mi Meri kak-e no, mmon no woomo Elisabet go ala kehm nvvdv. Etingi Etohko kehm ruru Elisabet go atahng, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />owo á kehm soro kehme elbungu wahre wahre re, “Wo wo, Esowo ma-a fuulu go ellong anebkal. Elfuulu li ka mmon no a bahke jele. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Jen ji wahnge elkohn nkpokosi ejum ana nyia ma lim re nnyehn ntul ewame ba nyehn-m? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Tibre n wuku kan nnyo mi a kak-m no, mmon no wob-m ga ala soro yuudu go eyebatahng. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Eyebatahng li a na, eji a ma taame tv etib bi Jehova tiing-a no. Tibre bahke lohko jol go etingitingi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Meri jo tehk Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Owo Meri kehm bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Eltim ename kpꞌtehke Jehova.<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Etohko ejame kpꞌgeere kak Esowo, ntꞌtahre ewame,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />eji á ma-m buumu, me ji li nlokeltum ewe no li reed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Bomo anv asongo ane kpee bahk-m jo lung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">nne no Esowo m-e fuulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 11:27-28</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Tibre Esowo bi gbale sehng ma-m rod,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">kpꞌlimi agburu nsol.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Mbing enye li saang.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ndon enye li ka ane ba kp-e fahle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">jol afi bo jini ngare anyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 10:34-45</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Á tanne ebo ebe, fere tib nsahm enye, kam aneb elgeere raade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">a ntir a ntir ebo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Á kpo radde ajꞌjok atul go bo a nti etul,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">fere mehl ane ba li rede rede wahre.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Ane ba njal ma yam bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">á kpo ka bo anoobo nsol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">bo li wohngo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">fere yake afang ane, bo song abo abo.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Esowo ebkak Israel, nlokeltum ewe, ebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">eji á ma buumu ndon enye,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />nyi li go njinanjini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">ana á bungu tong babnso ejahre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">fere tong Ebraham,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">a abon ebe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Meri kange ejum nnyahng era a Elisabet, kehm feere kehnge.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo jele Jon ji nwohngalahb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ngare kehm rehnge nyi Elisabet yahke jel. Á kehm jele nnenlum. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Eji aneb nkontahk ebe, a ane ebe wuku ana Jehova m-e tib egburu ndon enye, bo kehm-e tobo elgeere.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Eji mmon ma kang nfung enehkeni, bo kehm tahme re bo song yehk-e nrur. Owo bo kehm-e gungu mbing nyi nde re Sekaraya.<verse eid="LUK 1:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Nnyehn kehm tene re, “Eꞌee, bo bahk-e jo lung re Jon.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:60 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 1:13</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bo kehm-e faange re, “Nne ewa awohng awohng limm, no kpi mbing nyio!”<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Bo kehm bahbe nde go abo abo re, “Elkohn mbing anyi a bahke gungu mmon ewa?” <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sekaraya kehm bahbe re, bo ka-e nwer.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:63">Á kehm koko nyon re, “Mbing enye, bo bahke jo lung-e re Jon.” Ane kpee kehm kpoko bo esi.<verse eid="LUK 1:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Sekaraya kehm soro kpe kehme elbungu, fere jo tehk Esowo.<verse eid="LUK 1:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Kpee ane ba lene kohlo o kehm kehme elfahle. Eka jio kehm yeere go ejang bi ajahbe kpee nya jolo go awong nya Judea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Ane kpee ba wuku no, kehm rodo kak go bo a ntim, fere jo bahb re, “Anv, mmon noa bahke jolo elkohn nne awo?” Tibre bo nyehne ana nsahm nyi Esowo jolo a ne.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Sekaraya nyehne amahr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Owo Etingi Etohko kehm ba rur Sekaraya, nde Jon, á kehme amahr nyehn re,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Nong, wahr tehken Esowo bi Israel, bi li Ntul ewahre.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">Yebba re á ba kak ane ebe ebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">fere fak bo yake.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Á ma-r ka ntꞌtahre no kpi nsahm, no lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Devid, nlokeltum ewe.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ano wo Esowo bungu sehng go nnyo mi abarabare anyehnamahr ba jolo mahne mahne.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Á tongo re, á bahk-r tahre yehke go abo nya anebekv ebahre, fere yehk-r go abo nya ane kpee ba ma-r ko ekv,<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />fere tib babnso ejahre ndon enye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">tob buumu mbarebare enyam ebe bi á nyame no,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />eji á tiri no, fere tong Ebraham, nso ejahre re,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74-75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74-75" />á bahk-r yehke go abo nya anebekv ebahre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74-75">eji e lꞌjol ejahre ejahre ka ye ye, fere li eno go ege esamahr,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:74-75 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 4:16</char></note> jo lok-e,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:74-75 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:15</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74-75">kꞌfahl afung kpee nya e li go elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:74-75 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 4:18</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:74-75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Mmon ewame, bo bahk-a jo lung re, nnyehnamahr no Esowo bi gbale sehng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Tibre a bahke gboko Ntul mbang, song tuungu mbang enye bum-e,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:76 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:3</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />fere tong ane ebe re bo bahke bele eltahre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">tib eji Esowo bahke tahme ka bo go bo abiafem.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Tibre Esowo ebahre kpi egburu ndon nyi bahke lohngo go ero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Ellohngo ni bahke lohngo bahke jolo ana njul kpꞌyake tub-r,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />eji lꞌka ane ba jehk go ejannge ellennge, a ane ba nong go emel elkv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">fere jo tib-r mbang nyi elkoono.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mmon noo kehm gbale, fere tahne go etohko. Á jolo go elka emahng tete efung bi á lohngo gbuul, Israel kehm-e nyehne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:80 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ana bo jele Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ngare nyio nyi ntul Agostos kehm jehke ntahm re, bo fange njini kpee, kak abing ebo go nwer. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Eji bo gbo mbang fange ane, Sirinus wo jolo ntubesi go Siria.<verse eid="LUK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Nne awohng awohng kehm tahme go ege ejahbe re bo kak-e mbing go nwer. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Josef ji lene go Nasaret nyi Galili kehm tob tahm, song rehng go Betlehem ji Judea, ejahbe jio ji bo jele ntul a Devid. Tibre Josef lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Devid. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Á je ona re bo kak mbing enye go nwer, a Meri ji á tongo re á bahk-e koko, ye ji jolo ela.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 1:27</char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Eji bo jolo o Betlehem, ngare kehm biingi nyi Meri yahke ba eljele. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Owo á kehm jele ngbokambang a mmon ewe no nlum, kpenng-e abomo, fere rod-e, bum go ejum ji bo jo kak efong nsol alehke. Tibre eyake jolem go ekpꞌkpa elkang ka bo.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana babenjel song kpiri abaabebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Abaabebul jolo ejang ejahbe jio, ba jo kang go emahng, jo baabe ebul ebo atv. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Enjel nyi Esowo kehm lohngo ba kpiri bo. Ellub ni Esowo kehm yake ana njul tub bo. Bo kehm kehme elfahle tete.<verse eid="LUK 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Owo enjel nyio kehm tongo bo re, “Kana kpe fahl! Tibre n ko nnoobo etib ba a bi, bi kpi egburu eyebatahng ka ane kpee. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Tibre lela bobjel ntꞌtahre ka-n go ejahbe ji Devid, no li Kraist ji Ntul. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />A wo li elliingi ka-n. Ḿ bahke nyehne mmon elbili no bo m-e kpennge abomo, á nong go ejum ji bo kpo kak efong nsol alehke.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ellong enjel nyi ejahbetul Esowo gbalee kehm soro lohng ba kpiri enjel nyio, jo tehk Esowo re, <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Ellub jol a Esowo go ero. Elkoono jol a ane go njini, ba Esowo li a bo yebe yebe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Eji babenjel ma feere ebo fi go ejahbetul Esowo, abaabebul kehm bungu atemtem re, “Nong, wahr tahmen go Betlehem, song nyehnen ejum ji ma jol, ji Jehova ma-r tong.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Owo bo kehm soro tahm elwaare, song nyehn Meri, a Josef, fere nyehn mmon nong go ejum ji bo kpo kak efong nsol alehke. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Bo nyehne kan ano me, bo kehm tahme, jo yannge, jo tooro tong ane ana enjel tongo bo bada mmon noo. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Ane kpee ba wuku ana abaabebul tongo bo, kehm kpoko bo esi.<verse eid="LUK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Meri kehm kuuru nsol nyio kpee go ege eltim, fere jo tir bade. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Abaabebul bao kehm feere, jo ka Esowo ellub, fere jo tehk-e mbang mbang go nsol kpee nyi bo ma nyehn, fere wꞌwuk. Jolo na jol jang jang ana enjel tongo bo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo gungu Jisos mbing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Eji ma kang nfung enehkeni, nyi bo bahke mmon noo nrur yehke, owo bo kehm-e gungu mbing re Jisos, nyꞌnehm o nyi enjel tibi Meri, á kehm sake ela ebe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 1:31</char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo ko Jisos song rehng a ne go etahk Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Eji ngare biingi no nyi Meri bahke limi kpee, eji á lꞌkpe jol saang ana ntahm nyi Moses bungu no, owo Josef abola Meri kehm rodo mmon noo, tahm a ne go Jeusalem re bo song rod-e kak Jehova go ebo. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Ana wo bo nyono go ntahm nyi Jehova re, “Ngbokambang a mmon no nlum awohng awohng no lꞌjini, á bahke jolo ka Jehova.”<verse eid="LUK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Bo kehm limi njom ana ntahm Esowo bungu no re, “Ane bao bahke kake etomtom ebbal, tohko jol ano mbehl ebal.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:4</char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Nne jolo go Jeusalem, no bo jo lung-e re Simeon. Á jolo nnooba nne no jo fahl Esowo, fere jo sik nkakeltim no bahke ba kak Israel eltim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 15:43</char></note> Etingi Etohko jolo a ne. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Tibre Etingi Etohko lennge tong-e re, á nehm tiki waka kpo tete á nyehn Mesaya nyi Jehova bahke tumu.<verse eid="LUK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Etohko ji Esowo kehm-e yehke re á je go etahk Esowo. Eji Josef, a Meri, bo ko Jisos, mmon abo, song yange a ne go etahk Esowo re bo song lim-e ana ntahm bungu no, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />owo Simeon kehm taare mmon, fili go ebo, fere jo tehk Esowo re,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Ntul, woblim enyam eba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">anv, nong, nlokeltum ewa kehm yake njini nyia abo, song go eyebatahng,<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />tibre amahr enyame ebnyehn eltahre ena,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />ni a ma toobo bum go esamahr ane kpee.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Eltahre nia li ellennge ni bahke wahnge ane baka baka nyehn mbang enya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">ni bahke jolo ellub ni Israel, ane eba.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Eji nde, a nnyehn wuku ana Simeon bungu bada mmon noo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:33">kehm kpoko bo esi.<verse eid="LUK 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeon kehm biri elfuulu ni Esowo tv bo, kehm tongo Meri nnyehn re, “Mmon noa, Esowo bi m-e yehke. Ye wo bahke limi ane gbalee go Israel gbo, fere lim ane gbalee mehl yiimi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 2:15-16; Luk 23:39-43</char></note> Ye wo li elliingi ni Esowo ma tib, ni ane bahke jo bung ebi bade,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:12</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />eji ntir atahng nyi ane gbalee lꞌjol gbuul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 4:12-13</char></note> Wofono antahng eltim ena bahke jolo, are bo jahm-a ekahngkahng.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Nnenkal awohng tob jolo o, no bo jo lung-e re Ana. Á jolo nnyehnamahr. Nde, bo jo lung-e re Fanuel ji lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Aser. Ana sahb kꞌkul. Eji nlum ewe ko-e no, á ji elbal nnya esehma, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />nlum ewe kehm-e kpoko sa, á fere jol nkalebun. Ngare nyia a, yebkang nnya atahl ani a nnya ani. Á joom tiki lohng go etahk Esowo, á jo kake Esowo, jo bade elne njal, fere jo kak ero atv a njul. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Á kehm soro ba ngare nyꞌnehm o, ba kehme Esowo tehk, fere jo bung tong ane bao bada mmon noo, bao ba ji, jo sik elforo ni Jeusalem bahke foro.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo feere kehnge go Nasaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Eji bo ma lim ejum ajehng ajehng mal ana ntahm nyi Jehova bungu no, owo bo kehm feere kehnge go Nasaret, ejahbe ebo ji li go Galili. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mmon noo kehm gbale, fere tahne. Á gbale go elkahne. Elfuulu ni Esowo jolo a ne.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos jolo go etahk Esowo ngare nyi á jolo mmonse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Elya anehng anehng nde Jisos, a nnyehn jo je elkak Pasova go Jeusalem. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Eji Jisos ma kang ewubu a nnya ebal, bo kehm kpe je go Jeusalem ana bo jo kono eljeke elkak nio.<verse eid="LUK 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Eji afung elkak nio ma mal, owo bo kehm feere kehnge. Jisos sa go Jeusalem. Nde, a nnyehn kahnem. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bo jo tiri re, Jisos wob go ellong ane ba kpꞌkehnge. Eji bo ma jen efung kohro kohro, owo bo kehm-e kehme elsebe go ellong abonanyehn ebo, a atem ebo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Eji bo ki-e nyehn, bo kehm feere go Jeusalem, song seb-e gona.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Eji ma kang nfung era, owo bo kehm song nyehn-e go etahk Esowo, á jehk no a atꞌtibi kpꞌwuungu atung, fere jo bahb bo abahbe. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Ane kpee ba wuk-e no, kehm jo kpo bo esi tib go ege elkahne, a afaange nya á jo faange bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Nde, a nnyehn, kpo bo esi sehng, eji bo nyehn-e no. Owo nnyehn kehm-e tongo re, “Mmon ewame, jen ji wahnge a kehm limi ejum ana jia? Nso, a me, e ma-a seb na seb seb seb.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Owo á kehm faange bo re, “Jen ji wahnge ń jo seb-m? Ń nehme kahn re, m bahke tiki lim eltum ni Nsooa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 2:3-4; Mak 3:31-35</char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Bo kahnem esꞌsi ejum ji á jo bꞌbung tong bo.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Owo Jisos kehm tahme toono bo, bo feere kehnge go Nasaret, á song woomo bo go elwo. Nnyehn kuuru nsol nyio kpee go ege eltim. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Jisos kehm gbale go elkahne, fere gbal agbal nya ngubjing. Elkoro ni á jo kor Esowo, fere jo kor ane jo kpe gbal na.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jon ji nwohngalahb jo bung alum Esowo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mak 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jon 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Eji ma kang nnya elku nyi Taibirius jolo ntul a Rom, ngare nyio nyi Pontus Pailet jolo ntubesi ejahbe go Judea, Herod jo fili Galili, Filip mmonannyehn jo fili Iturea, fere jo fili Trakonitis, Lisanias jo fili Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Annas abola Kayafas jolo atubesi abalimajom.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:2">Ngare nyio nyi ellum Esowo song kpiri Jon ji jolo mmon a Sekaraya go elka emahng. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Jon kehm tahme, jo yannge go ajahbe nya li kohlo Jodan, jo bung alum Esowo re, “Yaangen mbang enyahne, wahn bel ewohngalahb, Esowo bahke tahme ka-n go egahne abiafem.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ana nnyehnamahr Aisaya nyono kak go nwer re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Nne noa, kpꞌrabe go elka emahng re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Tuungen mbang nyi Ntul bum-e!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Limen mbang tꞌtor nyi á bahke sehnge.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Bo bahke kake ndi go edamme ajehng ajehng, fere jol bale bale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">fere rene ewong ajehng ajehng gooro, fere jol bale bale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:12</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Ejum ji lꞌgalle, bo bahke limi, fere tor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Abang nya li akpuku akpuku, bo bahke fere gooro, jol gele gele.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Nne awohng awohng bahke nyehne eltahre ni Esowo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Ellong ane gbalee jo lꞌlohng, je goji Jon re á wohngo bo alahb. Jon kehm bungu tong bo re, “Wahn enyo bia,” nne awo tong-n re ḿ bahke foro go erakatahng ji Esowo ji kpꞌbake? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Jo limen eljini ni bahke jo tib re, wahn ebyaange mbang enyahne. Kana bom elbungu atemtem re, ‘Ebraham wo li nso ejahre.’ Tibre n kp-n tongo re, Esowo bahke ma ko atal nyaa, lim abon ka Ebraham.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:33,39</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />“Bobtoobo elfuk bum, ni bo bahke kiimi alohk nti. Eti ajehng ajehng ji tohko kab akab nya nno, bo bahke gbahke tub, rod kak agun.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Owo ane bao kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, ejum aji e bahke limi me?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Á kehm faange bo re, “Nne no lꞌbel nsubu ebal, nong, á yehke anyehng, ka nne no ki kpi. Nne no lꞌbel nsol alehke, nong, á tob lim ano.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Abakokatak kehm tob ba re bo ba bel ewohngalahb. Owo bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Ntꞌtibi, ejum aji e bahke limi?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Jon kehm faange bo re, “Kana kpe jo ko akpohko etak sehnge ana bo tong-n re wahn jo ko.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Egom nsoja nyindiki kehm-e tob bahb re, “Wahr bahke limi renan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Á kehm faange bo re, “Kana jo lim nne awohng awohng ejum go eko! Kana jo ka nne ebi mbol mbol! Nong, ana bo kp-n kpiki jo gbal-n.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Owo ane kehm kehme ekpu kunu, fere jo tir go bo a ntim bada Jon re, fundiki ye Mesaya wo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:19-28</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Owo Jon kehm bungu tong bo ane kpee re, “N kp-n wohngo alahb maka maka. Nne no kpꞌbake gbale sehnge me. Jol me n tohkem fꞌfuumu re me n fannge alehke akpaketa enye. Ye wo bahk-n wohngo alahb go Etingi Etohko, a agun. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Á fili edꞌda go ebo, kpꞌfebe arasi enye. Á bahke kpuku arasi enye, song kak go ege ekpꞌkpa, fere jahm awal go agun nya lꞌkꞌtiki lahme elahmelahme.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Nsol nyehko kpe jol tvv, nyi Jon kpe jo rehke bo, eji á jo tiingi ane bao nnoobo etib.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Á tob ka ntul a Herod ebi, tib eji á taare Herodias, nkal a Filip mmonannyehn, kpe lim abi nsol nyako budu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 6:17-18</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Herod kpe lim ebi jehko kpele, eji á bobo Jon kak ngbekobo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bele ewohngalahb</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mak 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Eji ane bao kpee ma bel ewohngalahb, Jisos kehm tob bel ewohngalahb. Eji á jo kak ero, ejahbetul kehm lennge. <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Etingi Etohko kehm badde go elfoongo ni ebbehl, ba jol a ne. Bo kehm wuku ellum go ejahbetul Esowo re, “Wo wo li akor-m mmon ewame, no kpo kor-m sꞌsehng.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:35</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nwer nyi etꞌtohngo ji Jisos lohngo no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Ngare nyio Jisos ebkang ejum eltahl a nnya ewubu. Ane jo tiri re, á jolo mmon a Josef,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 4:22</char></note> ji jolo mmon a Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli jolo mmon a Matat. Matat jol mmon a Livai. Livai jol mmon a Melki. Melki jol mmon a Jannai. Jannai jol mmon a Josef. <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Josef jol mmon a Matatias. Matatias jol mmon no Amos. Amos jol mmon a Nahum. Nahum jol mmon no Esli. Esli jol mmon a Naggai. <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Naggai jol mmon a Maat. Maat jol mmon a Matatias. Matatias jol mmon a Semein. Semein jol mmon a Josek. Josek jol mmon a Joda. <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Joda jol mmon a Joanan. Joanan jol mmon a Resa. Resa jol mmon a Serubabel. Serubabel jol mmon a Sealtiel. Sealtiel jol mmon a Neri. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri jol mmon a Melki. Melki jol mmon no Addi. Addi jol mmon a Kosam. Kosam jol mmon no Elmadam. Elmadam jol mmon no Er. <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er jol mmon a Josua. Josua jol mmon no Eliesa. Eliesa jol mmon a Jorim. Jorim jol mmon a Matat. Matat jol mmon a Livai. <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Livai jol mmon a Simeon. Simeon jol mmon a Juda. Juda jol mmon a Josef. Josef jol mmon a Jonam. Jonam jol mmon no Eliakim. <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakim jol mmon a Melea. Melea jol mmon a Menna. Menna jol mmon a Matata. Matata jol mmon a Natan. Natan jol mmon a Devid. <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Devid jol mmon a Jesi. Jesi jol mmon Obed. Obed jol mmon a Boas. Boas jol mmon a Sela. Sela jol mmon a Nason. <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nason jol mmon no Aminadab. Aminadab jol mmon no Admin. Admin jol mmon no Arni. Arni jol mmon a Hesron. Hesron jol mmon a Peres. Peres jol mmon a Juda. <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Juda jol mmon a Jekob. Jekob jol mmon no Aisik. Aisik jol mmon no Ebraham. Ebraham jol mmon a Tera. Tera jol mmon a Nahor. <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahor jol mmon a Serug. Serug jol mmon a Reu. Reu jol mmon a Peleg. Peleg jol mmon no Eber. Eber jol mmon a Sela. <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sela jol mmon a Kainan. Kainan jol mmon Arfasad. Arfasad jol mmon a Sem. Sem jol mmon a Noa. Noa jol mmon a Lamek. <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek jol mmon a Metusala. Metusala jol mmon no Enohk. Enohk jol mmon a Jared. Jared jol mmon no Mahalalel. Mahalalel jol mmon a Kainan. <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kainan jol mmon no Enos. Enos jol mmon a Set. Set jol mmon no Adam. Adam jol mmon Esowo.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Ana nnehm gare Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mak 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Eji Jisos lohngo go Jodan, jo kehnge, Etingi Etohko rur-e go ege atahng. Etingi Etohko kehm-e rodo tahm a ne go elka emahng. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Owo nnehm gar-e no nfung atahl abal. Afung nyao kpee á tikem li ejumjum. Eji afung nyao ma biingi, njal kehm-e yame.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Owo nnehm kehm-e tongo re, “A lꞌjol Mmon Esowo, tong eltal nia siingi ebred.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Nwer Esowo bungu re, ‘Abred nya nya sang wahnge nne kpo kpin. Á kpo tob bel elkpin go ellum Esowo anehng anehng.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:26-27</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Nnehm kehm-e rodo tahm a ne go nwahrewahre ewong, ko mmongare ana no nne bahke jehbe akpakamahr, tib-e ajahbe nya li go njini kpee, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />kehm-e tongo re, “M bahk-a kake nsahm kpee nyi a bahke jo fili ajahbe nyao, fere ka-a ellub ebo. Tibre bobyake kpee kak-m go ebo, m bahke fere faake ka nne no kor-m no. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />A lꞌsoro jꞌjamme alahng kak-m, nsol nyia kpee bahke fere jol nyꞌnya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Owo Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Nwer Esowo bungu re, ‘Kak Esowo Ntul ewa. Ye ntahngtahng wo a bahk-e loko.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:14-15</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Nnehm kehm-e koko tahm a ne go Jeusalem, song rod-e kunu go elkong etahk Esowo, kehm-e tongo re, “A lꞌfere jol Mmon Esowo, yehb gbo ndi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Tibre nwer Esowo bungu re, ‘Esowo bahke tongo enjel enye, bo baab-a.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Edi nwer Esowo jehko kpe bung re, ‘Bo bahk-a gbiiri go bo abo, eji a lꞌkꞌba jahre akpade go eltal.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Owo Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Nwer Esowo bungu re, ‘Ka gare Esowo Ntul ewa.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12:39</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Eji nnehm m-e gare mal, á kehm-e tohko yake mmongare ntiil.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bomo eltibi go Galili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mak 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Jisos kehm feere a nsahm Etingi Etohko, ba rehng go Galili. Owo elgahm ene kehm yeere ejang ejahbe jio kpee. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Á jo tibi go bo a ntahk ero. Ane kpee jo tehk-e tehk.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo tene Jisos go Nasaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mak 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Jisos kehm jeke go Nasaret, edi ji bo le-e no, á gbal. Efung Esabat á kehm jeke go etahk ero ana á jo kono ellimi. Á kehm mehle yiimi re á lung edi nwer Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Bo kehm-e kake nwer nyi nnyehnamahr Aisaya. Eji á ma lennge nwer nyio, á kehm song nyehn edi ji bo nyono re,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Etohko ji Jehova jia, kun-m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Á ma-m tum re me n song tiingi etib bi bahke wahnge aneb agbekobo for, awakamahr nyehn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Á ma-m tum re me n song tahre ane ba kpꞌnyehne erem yehke bo go afemfem nya bo wob no,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />fere tong ane re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:19">Elya eyebatahng ni Jehova ebrehng.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Eji á ma bulu nwer nyio, á kehm feere a nyi ka nlokeltum, kehm jehke. Ane kpee ba woomo go ekpꞌkpa ero jio jo seeng-e na seenge too.<verse eid="LUK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Owo á kehm kehme elbungu a bo re, “Edi nwer Esowo jia ebjol go etingitingi lela, eji ḿ ma wuk.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Owo ane kpee kehm-e kehme eltehke. Anoobo alum nya lohng-e go nnyo jo kpo bo esi sehng. Bo kehm bahbe re, “Anv, mmon a Josef sang aa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:42</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Á kehm tongo bo re, “Etingitingi, ḿ bahk-m tubu elgan nia re, ‘Nlimakahm, lim elna, wo nob me!’ Fere bung re, ‘Nsol nyi e ma wuk re, woblim go Kapenium, tob lim a fvfo go ega ejahbe!’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 4:13</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Owo Jisos kehm kpe bung re, “Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Nnyehnamahr awohng awohng limm, no bo kpo ko-e go ege ejahbe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:44</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Akalebun jolo gbalee go Israel ngare nyi Elaija, eji elahb ki kpe na go nnya era kunu ejang, owo egburu njal kehm bake go ndi nyio kpee. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Jol Esowo tumem Elaija tv nkalebun awohng awohng gona, sehngem nkalebun awohng no jolo go Sarefat ji Saidon wo, Esowo tumu Elaija tv-e.<verse eid="LUK 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />“Aneb abili gbalee ba jolo go Israel ngare nyi nnyehnamahr Elisa. Bo, nne awohng awohng nobem abili enye, sehngem Neman ji jolo nne a Siria wo wo nobo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12:21; Rom 9:30-31</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Eji ane ba woomo ekpꞌkpa ero jio wuku ano, atahng kehm rake bo tete. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Bo kehm-e tohngo yehke go ejahbe jio, song rehng a ne go nkpe ewong nyi bo si ejahbe jio kunu re bo gbul-e, á fooro go egbunggbung ewong ba gbo.<verse eid="LUK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Á fere jene na, ba sehng go elka ane tahm eje.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne no bele ebi etohko go ege atahng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mak 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Owo Jisos kehm tahme, song rehng go Kapenium ji li go Galili, song kehme ane tib efung Esabat. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Jo kpo bo esi tib go ege eltibi ni á jo tib bo. Tibre alum nya á jo bung, á jo bungu ana nne no kpi nsahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:28; Jon 7:46</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Nne jolo o ekpꞌkpa ero jio, no bele esabsab etohko go ege atahng. Á kehm rabe tiim re, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Yak-m! E li go nfem anyi awahr a na, Jisos ji Nasaret? A ba re wo ba ranng-ra? N kpꞌkahne nne no a li no. A li mbarebara nne Esowo!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Owo Jisos kehm-e nyame re, “Behl ewok, wo lohng-e song!” Ebi etohko jio kehm yehke nne noo tub ndi go elka ane bao, soro lohng-e. Ejumjum we á limem.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Kehm kehme nne awohng awohng esi kpo, bo kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Anv, elkohn alum anya a, nya á kpo bung go nsahm, tong asabsab atohko, bo jo lohng?”<verse eid="LUK 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Owo elgahm ni Jisos kehm yeere, rehng ejahbe ajehng ajehng ji jolo ejang bio.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi ane tvv, bo nob ayam ebo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mak 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Jisos kehm lohngo ekpꞌkpa ero jio, song rehng go etahk Saimon. Nnyehn nkal a Saimon, arumbum nyed-e sehng. Bo kehm-e gboongo ka-e. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Á kehm tahme song yiimi go ege a nkpe edilnong, kehm nyame arumbum nyao, nnenkal noo soro nob, kehm mehle tvtv, soro kehme bo loko.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Eji njul yahke ba ellahme, ane kpee ba bele aneb ayam, ba jo yam ajoobo ayam tvv, kehm koko bo, ba goji Jisos. Á kehm kunu bo abo, go nne awohng awohng, bo nob ane kpee. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Abi atohko tob lohngo ane gbalee, jo biingi tiim, fere jo bung re, “Wo wo li Mmon no Esowo!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 2:19</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Jisos jo nyame bo. Á joom taame re bo bung. Tibre bo jo kahne kpee re á li Mesaya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 8:29; Mak 3:11-12</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bungu alum Esowo go Galili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mak 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Efungfu behre behre Jisos kehm tahme ejahbe jio, song rehng go edi ji li soom.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:42">Ane kehm-e kehme elsebe. Eji bo nyehn-e no, bo kehm jo nok mbang anyehng anyehng, eji á lꞌkꞌtahm bo sa.<verse eid="LUK 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Owo á kehm tongo bo re, “M bahke tob tiingi nnoobo etib bi etul bi Esowo tong ajahbe nyako fvfo. Tibre ana wo wahnge Esowo tum-m no.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Owo á kehm tahme, jo song bung alum Esowo go ntahk ero nyi jolo go Judea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lungu agbokombang abatꞌtoono ebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mak 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Efung abehng eji Jisos yiimi go nkpe eto nyi Genesaret, ane kehm ba rur, jo fahd-e tv re bo wuk alum Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Owo á kehm nyehne agbang na abal go elga. Abasahre nsahre eblohng go agbang nyao, song kehme arim ebo faare. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Á kehm song yel egbang abehng bi jolo bi Saimon, kehm-e tongo re, á reenge egbang feere go elka alahb. Owo á kehm jehke go egbang, jo tib ane bao.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Eji á ma bung mal, owo á kehm tongo Saimon re, “Reenge egbang, song rehng edi ji kpꞌrahbe, wahn yake arim enyahne kak o, bob nsahre.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 21:6</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Owo Saimon kehm-e faange re, “Nsoo, wahr eblim eltum atv atv maa ana tete, jol ejumjum e tikem bob. Wo, eji a ma bung ano, m bahke yake erim ebame kak.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 11:1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Eji bo ma lim ano, bo kehm bobo nsahre gbalee, erim kehm kehme elyare. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Owo bo kehm soro kehme atem ba woomo go egbang behko mahk re bo ba tob bo. Bo kehm bake, ba yehke nsahre nyio, ruru agbang abal abal, fere jol are agbang yahke ter.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Eji Saimon Pita nyehne ano, á kehm gboko jamme Jisos alahng, kehm bungu re, “Ntul, jeere song, tibre me nne abiafem wo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 8:8-10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Tibre nkpokosi nyio jo kpo-e esi sehng, a ane bako kpee ba tob jolo a ne o, tib go elkohn nsahre nyi bo bobo no. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Ano wo fvfo, Jems a Jon ba jolo abon Sibidi, bo ji jo lim eltum ano a Pita, jo tob kpo bo esi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Owo Jisos kehm tongo Saimon re, “Ka kpe fahl! Bomo anv asongo, a bahke fere jo bim ane.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:47; Mak 16:15-16</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Eji bo ma tohng agbang ebo kunu egbuk, bo kehm tahme ejum ajehng ajehng sa, tahm toono Jisos.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nne abili, á nob</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mak 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Efung abehng eji Jisos jolo ejahbe ajehng, nne jolo ona, no abili saab-e na saabe go ngubjing. Á nyehne kan Jisos, á kehm gboko, kohk esamahr ebe go ndi, fere jo gboong-e re, “Ntul, lꞌfere kor-a, a li-m ma lim, n nob.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Jisos kehm soro tanne ebo ebe, koor-e, kehm bungu re, “Kor-m kor.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 2:4</char></note> Wobnob!” Tvtv o á kehm soro nob abili nyao. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Owo Jisos kehm-e rehke re, á kꞌtong nne ne, fere tong-e re, “Song, wo song kpiri nlimajom, fere tib-e elna, fere lim njom ana Moses tongo no, tib eji a ma nob, eji lꞌjol ejum ntianse ka bo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Tvtv o elgahm ni Jisos kpe yeere na budu. Nlong ane gbalee kehm jo kam, jo ba re bo jo wuk-e, fere jo nob ayam ebo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Jisos jo tahme, song rehng edi ji li soom, song kak ero.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi mbanne, á nob</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mak 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Efung abehng eji Jisos jo tib, Bab Farisi, a atꞌtibi ba atahm tob ji ona, ba lohngo go ejahbe ajehng ajehng ji li go Galili, a Judea, fere tob lohng go Jeusalem ba. Nsahm nyi Esowo jolo a Jisos ona re á ko lim ane, bo nob ayam ebo.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Ane kehm koko mbanne ba a ne, nyi bo sol-e go edilnong. Bo jo gare re bo yel a ne go ekpꞌkpa, song bum-e go alata Jisos. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Bo tingem mbang anyehng anyehng nyi bo bahke sehnge a ne tib ellong ane bao. Owo bo kehm wahre a ne go ero etahk, kehm song lahm elbulu, kehm tahre alehke nya bo kanne go edilnong jio tete ba rehng go elka ane bao, edi ji Jisos jolo no.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Eji Jisos nyehne ana bo ma taame tv-e, owo á kehm bungu re, “Mbi, abiafem enya, me n tahm ka-a.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Atꞌtibi ba atahm, a Bab Farisi kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Anv, ye elkohn nne awo, no kpꞌbungu abꞌbi alum ana nyaa tob Esowo? Nne awo bahke ma tahm ka nne go ege abiafem? Esowo ntahngtahng bi bahke ma tahm ka nne go ege abiafem!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Eji Jisos ma seb kahn ana bo jo tir, owo á kehm faange bo re, “Elkohn ntir anyi ń kpꞌtiri go egahna ntim? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Jen ji ga riidi, n lꞌtong nne noa re, ‘Abiafem enya me n tahm ka-a,’ afi n lꞌtong-e re, ‘Mehl yiimi, wo jen?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:38</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />M bahk-n tibi re, Mmon no nne kpi nsahm go njini nyia, nyi á bahke ma tahm ka nne go ege abiafem.” Owo á kehm tongo mbanne nyio re, “N kp-a tongo re, wo tahm, rod edilnong eja, song kehnge!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Tvtv o nne noo kehm soro mehl yiimi go esamahr ane bao, rod edilnong ji á noongo no, tahm eje kehnge, jo tehk Esowo asongo.<verse eid="LUK 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Ane bao kpee kpo bo esi area. Bo kehm kehme Esowo tehk afahlafahle, fere jo bung re, “Wahr ebnyehn akpokosi nsol lela.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lungu Livai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mak 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Eji ma jol ano, Jisos kehm tahme, song nyehn nkokatak no bo jo lung-e re Livai jehk go ekpꞌkpa etak. Á kehm-e tongo re, “Tahm toon-m!”<verse eid="LUK 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Livai kehm tahme ejum ajehng ajehng sa, tahm toon-e. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Owo Livai kehm limi egburu elkak go ege etahk ka Jisos. Abakokatak gbalee tob jolo o, a ane bako fvfo, jo li nsol abo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 15:1-2</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Bab Farisi, a atꞌtibi ba atahm ba woomo go ellong Farisis kehm kehme elmemme tob abatꞌtoono Jisos re, “Jen ji wahnge ń kpo li nsol alehke a abakokatak, go aneb abꞌbi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Ane ba li nob nob kpehme seb nlimakahm, sehngem ane ba kpꞌyame ba kpꞌsebe. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />M baam re me m ba lung anoobo ane, bo gbo ndon. M ba re me m ba lung abi ane.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 3:9-10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bada njal abade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-15">Mat 9:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-20">Mak 2:18-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Egom ane bandiki kehm ba bahb Jisos re, “Jen ji wahnge abatꞌtoono Jon, a ba Farisis kpo bade elbo njal nkpel a nkpele, fere jo kak ero, abatꞌtoono eba kpo li na nsol, fere jo wꞌwo?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Ḿ bahke limi renan, kehm tongo ane ba bo ma tiingi bo elkak elbal re bo ji njal ngare nyi nlumanne kpeke li a bo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ngare kpꞌbake nyi bo bahke yehke nlumanne go bo ellong tahm a ne. Ngare nyio nyi bo bahke kehme elbo njal bade.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:2-3; 14:23; 1 Kor 7:5</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eltibi ni mahne mahne lꞌli, eltibi ni Jisos lꞌli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:16-17">Mat 9:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:21-22">Mak 2:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Jisos kehm kpe tub bo elgan re, “Nnene limm, no bahke koko mmojang mbomo no nfenfe, song baade nkꞌkula mbomo. Á lꞌlim ano, edi ji bo ko mmojang mbomo no nfenfe baade, bahke kpe kv na budu. Ejang mbomo nfenfe nehm fuumu a nkꞌkula mbomo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />“Nnene limm fvfo, no bahke yaange amahm ma kpꞌfahle kak go nkꞌkohko eyahbe. Á lꞌlim ano, amahm mao ma kpꞌfahle bahke limi eyahbe jio bahnge, amahm sale, eyahbe rannge kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 8:13</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Amahm ma kpꞌfahle, bo bahke jo kak go eyahbe nfenfe. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Nnene limm, no kpo wo akꞌkulu amahm, amahm ma kpꞌfahle kehm-e kpe kor. Á bahke bungu re, ‘Akꞌkulu amahm ma ga nob.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 9:28-29</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Bade efung Esabat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mak 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Efung Esabat abehng eji Jisos jo jen go emahng ji bo bahme nkohl, owo abatꞌtoono ebe kehm jo laade nkohl, fere monngo amohk tv go arahn, jo li.<verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Owo egom Farisi jindiki kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌlimi ejum ji ntahm enyahre sahde re, nne kꞌjo lim efung Esabat?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Ń ka tiki lung bade ana Devid limi no ngare nyi njal yam-e no, a ane ebea? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Á yele ekpꞌkpa Esowo, song rod abred nya bo limi bum go esamahr Esowo li, fere tob ka ane ebe ba jolo a ne, bo li, nya ki fuumu re nne awohng awohng li, sehngem abalimajom ba ba jo li.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Owo Jisos kehm kpe tong bo re, “Mmon no nne tob li nfono Esabat.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne no ebo ebe lohngo no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mak 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Efung Esabat bi Jisos kpe je go etahk ero song tib, nne awohng jolo o, no eboblum ebe lohngo no.<verse eid="LUK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Atꞌtibi ba atahm, a Bab Farisi, bo jo baab-e,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 14:1</char></note> joare á bahke limi nne awohng awohng, á nob efung Esabat.<verse eid="LUK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Jisos kꞌkahn ntir atahng ebo, owo á kehm tongo nne no ebo ebe lohngo no re, “Ba, wo ba yiimi ana!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:8">Nne noo kehm mehle yiimi, jen song yiimi ona.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “N kp-n bahbe re, Anv, ntahm enyahre bungu re wahr jo lim jen efung Esabat, wahr jo kak na nne ebo, afi wahr jo rannge na? Wahr jo tahre elkpin nne, afi wahr jo rannge elkpin nne?”<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Eji á ma seenge bo, song jahm, owo á kehm tongo nne noo re, “Tanne ebo eba!” Á kehm limi ano. Ebo ebe kehm feere jol ana behko jang jang.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Atahng kehm rake bo tete, bo kehm kehme eltoobo bo bo, ji bo bahke limi Jisos.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yehke abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mak 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ngare nyio Jisos kehm tahme go ewong re á song kak ero. Owo á kange no, jo kak ero ka Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Eji efungfu ma se, á kehm lungu abatꞌtoono ebe tv elne, kehm jake ewubu ane abal, ba á jo lung bo re abatiingetib. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />A wo li ewubu ane abal ba á yehke no. Saimon ji Jisos ka-e mbing nyehko re Pita, a Andru mmonannyehn Pita, go Jems, Jon, Filip, Batolomi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matiu, Tomos, Jems ji mmon a Alfeus, a Saimon ji jo seb re ejahbe eje lohng go elwo ni aneb Rom, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />go Judas ji mmon a Jems, a Judas Iskariot ji gungu Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:64,70; Elt 1:13</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos jo tib, fere lim ane, bo nob ayam ebo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Eji Jisos jo badde a bo go ewong, á kehm ba yiimi edi ji li bale bale, a ellong abatꞌtoono ebe gbalee, a ellong ane tvv, ba lohngo go Judea kpee, fere lohng go Jeusalem, a ba lohng go nkpe agburu aya, ejang bi Taya, a Saidon. Bo ba re bo ba wuk-e, fere nob ayam ebo. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Ane ba asabsab atohko jo gbiingi bo, bo nobo ane kpee. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Ellong ane bao kpee jo sebe re, bo koor-e, tibre nsahm jo lohng-e lohng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 3:10; 5:27-28</char></note> Á fere lim bo, bo nob ane kpee.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eyebatahng, a ndon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Owo Jisos kehm tabe esamahr ebe seenge abatꞌtoono ebe, kehm bungu re,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:20">“Elfuulu li ka wahn akpak, tibre etul bi Esowo bꞌbahne bi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 19:27-28</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />“Elfuulu li ka wahn ji njal kp-n yame anv, tibre ḿ bahke wohngo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:35</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:21">“Elfuulu li ka wahn ji kpꞌlingi anv, tibre ḿ bahke wolo asol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 7:16-17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Elfuulu li ka wahn, ane lꞌko-n ekv tib go esi ji Mmon no nne, fere yab a nahne, jo su-n, fere jo bung re, wahn abi ane ba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 4:14-16</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />“Jo belen eyebatahng, nsol ana nyio lꞌlim, wahn fere jo siiki. Tibre egburu eltuuru enahne nia, nong-n go ejahbetul Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 3:13</char></note> Tibre nsol nyꞌnehm ona nyi babnde ebo jo lim abanyehnamahr Esowo.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Eyuu a nahne, wahn afang ane, tibre wahn ebbel ejum ekakeltim ejahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 5:1-3</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />“Eyuu a nahne, wahn ji kpꞌwohngo anv, tibre ḿ bahke jene njal njal.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:25">“Eyuu a nahne, wahn ji kpꞌwolo anv, tibre ḿ bahke jehke ndon ndon, fere jo ling.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Eyuu a nahne, ane kpee lꞌjo tehk-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 4:4</char></note> Tibre ano wo babnde ebo tob jo tehk akimfahnge abanyehnamahr.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana nnekv ewa bahke jo kor-a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5:38-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“N kp-n tongo wahn ji kpꞌwuungu atung re, Anebekv ebahne jo kor-n. Jo limen nnoobo ka ane ba kpo ko-n ekv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:20</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Jo biren nnoobo tv ane ba kpo su-n. Jo kaken ero ka ane ba kpo lim-n ebi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Nne no lꞌrum-a elkpal, tob sennge ejang behko ka-e fvfo, á kpe-a rum. Nne no lꞌtaare nsubu enya, á lꞌkpe ba ewobo eja taare, tob yake ka-e. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Jo ka nne awohng awohng ejum, no bahb-a no. Nne no lꞌtaare ejum eja, k-e tong re á feere a ji.”<verse eid="LUK 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />“Ejum ajehng ajehng ji ń kpꞌsebe re ane jo lim ka-n, wahn fvfo, tob jo limen ano ka bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:12</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Ane ba ń kpo kor bo, bo lꞌjo kor-n, eltuuru ani Esowo bahk-n tuuru? Tibre ane ba, aneb abiafem kpo kor bo, bo ba fvfo kpo tob kor aneb abiafem. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ń lꞌjo lim nnoobo ka ane ba kpo lim nnoobo ka-n, eltuuru ani ḿ bahke bele? Tibre aneb abiafem kpo tob lim ano. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Ń lꞌjo bong ane akpohko, ba ń tiri re bo bahke tob bong-n, eltuuru ani ḿ bahke bele? Tibre aneb abiafem kpo bong aneb abiafem, eji bo lꞌtob lim jang jang ka bo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />“Nong, anebekv ebahne jo kor-n, wahn jo lim nnoobo. Jo bongen ane akpohko, wahn kꞌjo kunu ekpu re bo feere a nya ka-n. Ń lꞌlim ano, eltuuru enahne bahke gbale. Owo ḿ bahke kehm jolo abon ba Esowo bi gbale sehng. Tibre Esowo kpo lim nnoobo ka ane ba kil jo kak saam, fere tob lim nnoobo ka abi ane.<verse eid="LUK 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />“Nong, ane jo fil-n ndon, ana Nso ejahne, ane kpo fil-e ndon.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana jo lam ane bako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Kana jo lam ane bako, Esowo wahn nehm tob lam. Kana jo tong ane re, bobli ebi, Esowo wahn nehm tob tong re, wahn ebli ebi. Jo tahmen ka ane, Esowo bahke tob tahm ka-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 6:14</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Jo kaan, Esowo bahk-n tob ka. Á bahke gare go ebam ji nno a nno, gbehke, fere so, kak, rur wꞌwohng, fere yaange kak egahne abam. Ana ń gare no ka, ano wo fvfo Esowo bahke tob gare ka-n.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 4:24</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Jisos kehm tob tub bo elgan re, “Anv, nwakamahr a nne bahke ma tib nwakamahr nyehko mbanga? Bo ane abal abal nehm song gbo yel go elbinga?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 15:14</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />“Nne no kpꞌkpili kpehme gbal sehnge ntꞌtibi ewe. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌkpili mal, á bahke jolo ana ntꞌtibi ewe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:24-25; Jon 15:20; Fil 1:29-30</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Jen ji wahnge a kpꞌseenge mmolsahk no wob mmonanne go elmahr, a kil eltiri bada nkporti nyi wob go ega elmahr? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />A bahke limi renan, kehm tongo mmonanne, re, ‘Nong, me n yehk-a mmolsahk no wob-a go elmahr,’ eji wofono antahng kil nyehne nkporti nyi wob-a go elmahr? Wobnob tane! Tohko gbo mbang yehke nkporti nyi wob go ega elmahr, eji a lꞌmal nyehn, yehke mmolsahk no wob mmonanne go elmahr.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 9:27</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eti, a akab akab enye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Tibre eti ji nno ajehng ajehng limm, ji kpo kab asabsab akab. Jol fvfo, esabsab eti ajehng ajehng limm, ji kpo kab anoobo akab. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Tibre eti ajehng ajehng, bo kpo liing-e go ege akab. Nnene limm, no kpo bong akab efig go asokonso, fere bong akab avain go egab.<verse eid="LUK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />“Nsol afang nyi wob nnooba nne go ege eltim, nyi nyi á kpo yehke, lohng a nyi. Abꞌbi nsol nya wob ebi nne go ege eltim, nya nya á kpo yehke, lohng a nya. Tibre ji ma rur nne go eltim, ji ji kpo lohng-e go nnyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana ane abal si ntahk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Jen ji wahnge ń kpo lung-m re, ‘Ntul, Ntul!’ Ń kil jo lim nsol nyi n kpo tong-n re wahn lim?<verse eid="LUK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />“Nne awohng awohng no lꞌba go egame, ba wuk alum enyame, fere jo lim,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 1:22-26</char></note> m bahk-n tibi elkohn nne no á li no. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Á li ana nne no si etahk. Á kpa rꞌrahbe tete rehng go ekpartal,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 17:11</char></note> kehm bumu nnahb ekahme enye o. Eji nnyel yele no, alahb jo gbul etahk jio, tikem ma gbehke egbehkegbehke, tibre nnahb ekahme nyio kuumu go ekpartal.<verse eid="LUK 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />“Nne no lꞌwuk alum enyame, fere ten go ellimi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 2:17</char></note> á li ana nne no si na si etahk eje kunu go ndi, kꞌbum nnahb ekahme. Eji alahb jo gbul etahk jio, kehm soro gbo kpee rꞌrere rꞌrere.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nlokeltum a nne a Rom, á nob</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Eji Jisos ma bung nsol nyia kpee mal, tong ane bao, á kehm tahme go Kapenium.<verse eid="LUK 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ntubesi a nsoja awohng jolo o, no bele nlokeltum no jo sahb kor-e kor. Nlokeltum ewe noo jo yame, are á bahke kpoko. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Eji ntubesi a nsoja noo wuku bada Jisos, á kehm tumu anebkul Jus bandiki re bo song gboong-e, á ba lim nlokeltum ewe nob.<verse eid="LUK 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Eji bo ba rehng goji Jisos, bo kehm sahb gboong-e gboongo re, “Ntubesi noo, fꞌfuumu re wo kak-e ebo. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Tibre ejahbe ejahre kpo kor-e sehng. Yebsi etahk ero ka-r.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 10:1-2</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Owo Jisos kehm tahme toono bo. Eji á ma kabbe etahk jio, ntubesi a nsoja noo kehm tumu ate ebe tv-e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Bo kehm-e song tong re, “Ntubesi re, wo kꞌkpe gbiingi elna mbol mbol, are ye fuumem re wo song yel ege ekpꞌkpa. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Jol á fuumem re á ba go ega.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 5:8</char></note> Are, wo lub bung ellum ellum, nlokeltum ewe bahke nobo. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Ntubesi re, á li nne no wob go elwo nne. Á tob kpi nsoja nyi tob wob-e go elwo. Á lꞌtong nne noko re, ‘Song!’ Tahm. Á lꞌtong nne noka re, ‘Ba!’ Á ba. Á lꞌtong nlokeltum ewe re, ‘Lim ejum jia!’ Á lim na lim.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Jisos, esi kehm-e kpoko, eji á wuku ano. Á kehm keebe, kehm bungu tong ellong ane ba jo toon-e re, “N kp-n tongo re, Jol go Israel n ka tiki nyehn nne no kpi elkohn egburu eltaame ana nia.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Eji ane ba ntubesi a nsoja noo tumu bo feere no, ba rehng ege etahk, bo ba nyehne nlokeltum noo ma lohko nob.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:47-54</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos nyahme njangkun anyehng go elkv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Etoono efung behko Jisos kehm tahme go ejahbe ji bo jo lung re Nain. Abatꞌtoono ebe gbalee, a ellong ane tvv ba toon-e no je.<verse eid="LUK 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Eji á ma kabbe eti mbu ji jolo ejahbe jio, ane ba solo nkvne kehm lohngo ejahbe jio abake. Nne no kpo no jolo mmon mmon awohng no nnenkal no jolo nkalebun. Ellong ane gbalee jolo a nnenkal noo o, ba lohngo ejahbe jio.<verse eid="LUK 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Eji Ntul a Jisos nyehn-e no, ndon kehm-e gbale go ege eltim tib nnenkal noo. Owo á kehm-e tongo re, “Ka kpe ling!” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Á kehm jeere, song kooro ekpa ji bo gbade nkvne. Aneblum ba sol-e no kehm yiimi. Jisos kehm bungu re, “Njangkun, n kp-a tongo re wo mehl!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 8:54; Jon 11:43-44</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Nne no kpo no kehm soro mehl ji, kehm kehme elbungu. Jisos kehm-e jabbe, kak nnyehn go ebo.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Owo nne awohng awohng kehm kehme elfahle, fere jo tehk Esowo re, “Egburu nnyehnamahr eblohng go egahre ellong.” Bo kpe bung re, “Esowo ebba re á ba tahre ane ebe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Eka jia bada Jisos kehm yeere go Judea kpee, a ajahbe nya jolo sennge Nain ka.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ane ba Jon ji nwohngalahb tumu no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Abatꞌtoono Jon kehm song tong-e nsol nyio kpee. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Jon kehm lungu abatꞌtoono ebe na abal, tum bo tv Ntul a Jisos re bo song bahb-e re, “Wo wo li nne no kpꞌbake, afi wahr ji sik nne nondiki?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Eji bo song kpiri Jisos, bo kehm-e tongo re, “Jon ji nwohngalahb wo ma-r tum tv-a re wahr ba bahb-a re, ‘Wo wo li nne no kpꞌbake, afi wahr ji sik nne nondiki?’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 1:7-8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Ngare nyio Jisos limi aneb ayam gbalee, bo nob go ajoobo ayam tvv, fere kam ane abi atohko yehke, tob lim awakamahr gbalee, bo nyehn.<verse eid="LUK 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Owo Jisos kehm faange ane ba Jon tumu no re, “Songen, wahn song tong Jon nsol nyi ḿ ma nyehn, fere wꞌwuk. Anv, awakamahr kpꞌnyehne, abanne ebtahm kpꞌjene, aneb abili kpꞌnobo, alakatung kpꞌwuku, akvne kpꞌnyahme go elkv. Akpak kpꞌwuku nnoobo etib.<verse eid="LUK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />“Elfuulu li ka nne no lꞌki-m sel gbo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Eji ane ba Jon tumu bo ma feere fi, owo Jisos kehm bomo elbungu bada Jon, tong ellong ane bao re, “Ń jo lohngo je elka emahng re wahn song nyehn jen? Eljele ni nfeb kpꞌlimi, kpꞌneenga? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Jen ji ń jo jꞌje re wahn song nyehn? Nne no liibi anoobo nsola? Etingitingi, elkohn ane ba kpo liibi ano, fere jo li ebno, bo kpo kono eljolo go ntahk atul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 1:6</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Anv, ejum aji ń jo je re wahn song nyehn? Nnyehnamahra?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:26">“Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, wahn ebnyehn nne no gbale sehnge nnyehnamahr. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Tibre Jon wo li nne no nwer Esowo bungu no bada ne re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“ ‘M bahke tumu ntiingetib ewame re</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">á gbo-a mbang, song tuungu mbang bum-a.’<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />“N kp-n tongo re, Nne awohng awohng limm, no ma jꞌjol go njini nyia no gbale sehnge Jon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 1:15</char></note> Wo, nne no sahb rꞌrede, no kun etul bi Esowo, á gbale sehnge ye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />“Ane kpee, a abakokatak ba wuk-e no, bo ba taame re, Esowo lohko li go etingitingi, tib eji bo ma bel ewohngalahb ji Jon.<verse eid="LUK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />“Bab Farisi, a atꞌtibi ba atahm tꞌten ji Esowo toobo re á lim ka bo, eji ki kor bo re bo bel ewohngalahb jio ji Jon.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />“Anv, m bahke koko ane ba li anv gara jen? Bo li renan? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bo li ana abonse ba ma lohng song ji go elatahkgur kpi mbene lim. Egom jindiki tong egom jehko re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">“ ‘Wahr ebwor afiri ka-n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">ḿ bahnem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Wahr ebling aling,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">wahn tobem ling fvfo.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Eji Jon ji nwohngalahb ba no, á joom li abred, fere jo wo amahm, ń jo tongo re, ‘Á kpi ebi etohko go ege atahng.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Wo anv, Mmon no nne ebba, kpꞌlehke, fere jo wꞌwo, ń fere jo bungu re, ‘Nyehnen nlehke ebno noa! Á li nwokamahm, a ntem no abakokatak, a ntem no aneb abꞌbi.’<verse eid="LUK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />“Nne lꞌkpur nsol nyi aneb elkahne kpo lim, owo á bahke tob kahn ana elkahne li no.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:15; Kol 2:3</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos jolo go etahk Saimon, nne a Farisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Nne a Farisi awohng kehm tiingi Jisos re á song li nsol a ne. Jisos kehm jeke go etahk nne a Farisi noo, song ji go ekpꞌkuru nsol alehke. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Nnenkal awohng jolo ejahbe jio, no jolo nne abiafem. Eji á sebe kahn re Jisos noa, kpꞌlehke nsol go etahk nne a Farisi noo, owo á kehm koko elom akehng tahm a ji, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />song yiimi go njahm a Jisos, edi ji Jisos bumu akpade. Á jo lꞌling, abonngo jo toongo wohngo Jisos go akpade. Owo á kehm koko alv esi enye dohk-e akpade, fere sod akpade enye, kehm yaange akehng mao, wohng-e go akpade.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Eji nne a Farisi no tiingi Jisos nyehne ano, á kehm bungu atahng atahng re, “Li re nne noa lohko li nnyehnamahr, kehn á jol kahne nne no nnenkal noo li no, no kp-e kooro abo, fere kahn elkohn elkpin ni á kpo lim, tibre á li nne abiafem.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Owo Jisos kehm bungu re, “Saimon, n kpi ejum ji n kp-a tongo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Á kehm faange re, “Aa, ntꞌtibi, tong-m me!”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Owo Jisos kehm bungu re, “Ane abal jolo go, ba bele nne no kpo bong ane akpohko mbong. Nne noko bel-e mbong a mpon atahl awubu, noko bel-e mbong a mpon eltahl. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Eji bo ki bel ejumjum ji bo bahke koko gal mbong nyio, á kehm yake ka bo. Tong-m, go ellong ane abal baa, nne awo, nne noo bahk-e jo ga kor?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Owo Saimon kehm faange re, “Me m bum re, nne no á ga yake ka-e wo.” Jisos kehm bungu tong-e re, “Wobfaange go nseenge.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Á kehm keebe seenge nnenkal noo, kehm bungu tong Saimon re, “Wobnyehn nnenkal noaa? Eji m ba yel go ega ekpꞌkpa, me a kaam alahb re men n ru akpade. Wo, ye ma-m ru akpade go ege abonngo, fere ko alv enye dohk-m. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />M-e a sodem nnyo. Jol ye ka tiki rahke akpade enyame go elsodo, eji n tiki yel a. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Akehng, m-e a kakem go esi, wo, ye ma-m wohngo akehng go akpade. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Owo wahnge n kp-a tongo re, Abiafem enye nya li gbalee, me n tahm ka-e, tibre á kpi egburu elkoro sehng.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 22:36-37</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Á kehm tongo nnenkal noo re, “Abiafem enya me n tahm ka-a.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 5:20-24</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Ane bako ba tob ji ekpꞌkuru nsol alehke jio kehm kehme elbungu atahng atahng re, “Ebga! Anv, ye nne awo no kpo tahm ka nne go ege abiafem?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo nnenkal noo re, “Song go eyebatahng! Eltaame ena ni ma-a tahre.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 10:9-10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Anebkal ba jo toono Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Eji ma jol ano, Jisos kehm jo jen yannge ajahbe ajahbe ajahbe, jo bung alum Esowo, fere jo tiingi nnoobo etib bi etul bi Esowo. Abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal, jolo a ne o, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />a anebkal bandiki ba á kame bo abi atohko yehke, fere lim bo nob ayam ebo. Meri ji bo jo lung-e re Meri ji lohng go Magdala tob woomo go ellong ane bao, ye ji á kam-e abi atohko na asehma yehke, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />go Joanna nkal a Kusa, Kusa ji jolo ntubesi no alokeltum ba jolo go nlaaga Herod, go Susanna, a anebkal gbalee bako ba jo kak Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe ebo go nsol nyi bo bele no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 15:40-41; Luk 16:9</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bada mbahmgbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mak 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Eji ellong ane gbalee kpi nlohngo nlohngo go ajahbe ajahbe ajahbe, ba kono edi ajehng goji Jisos, owo á kehm tubu bo elgan nia re,<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Nne jolo go, no tahme re á song wohngo amohk nti enye go ege egbe. Eji á jo wohngo, nyandiki fooro gbo go mbang. Ane ba kadde sehng. Nruk ba suudu mele.<verse eid="LUK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />“Nyandiki gbo noongo go ndi nyi jolo atal atal. Amohk nti nyao gulu elmahnge, fere kpo, waange, tibre ndi waange sehng.<verse eid="LUK 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />“Nyandiki gbo kuumu go elkob akpiri, mahng. Akpiri kehm gbale, bulu akohdo nti nyao.<verse eid="LUK 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />“Nyako gbo noongo go nnooba ndi, kehm mahnge, gbal, kab akab, etasok ajehng ajehng nkab atahl alon alon.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Eji Jisos ma bung ano, á kehm rabe re, “Nne no kpi atung, nong, á wuk!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lennge elgan nia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-23">Mat 13:10-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-20">Mak 4:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Abatꞌtoono Jisos kehm-e bahbe ana elgan nia lohngo no. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Bo ma-n ka elkahne nio ni nsol nyi li ka etul bi Esowo, nyi Esowo behre no. Egom ane bako kpo wuk ngaane ngaane, eji ‘bo lꞌseenge na seenge, kꞌnyehn, fere wuk na wuk, kꞌkahn ana lohngo no.’<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Ana wo elgan nia lohngo no. Amohk nti nyao, alum Esowo nya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:23</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />“Amohk nti nya gbo noongo go mbang lohngo ana ane ba kpo wuk alum Esowo. Nnehm ba yehke alum nyao go bo a ntim, eji bo lꞌkꞌtaame, fere bel eltahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 24:24-27; 2 Kor 3:14-16</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />“Amohk nti nya gbo noongo go ndi nyi li atal atal lohngo ana ane ba lꞌwuk alum Esowo. Bo ko go eyebatahng. Alohk bo nehm bel. Bo kpo toono Esowo mmongare ntiil. Elgaare lꞌba, bo yak-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 10:32-39</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />“Amohk nti nya gbo kuumu elkob akpiri lohngo ana ane ba ma wuk alum Esowo. Atꞌtiiri nya njini nyia, ekor afang, a ekor nsol nyi njini kpo lim, nsol nyi nyi kpo ra yel go bo a ntim, song bulu alum Esowo tv, akab nehm kul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tim 4:10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />“Amohk nti nya gbo noongo go nnooba ndi lohngo ana ane ba ma wuk alum Esowo, fere ko, kuuru go bo anoobo ntim nya enehm abehng abehng ki wob, soro asi, jo kab akab.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etꞌrekahng ji wob go nla ekpꞌkuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mak 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Nnene limm, no ma nyꞌnyaale etꞌrekahng, rod ejeere konngo, jol rod, kak go nla ekpꞌkuru. Á bahke rodo na, kunu go ejum ji bo kpo kunu etꞌrekahng, eji ane ba kpꞌyele ekpꞌkpa lꞌjo nyehn ellennge nio.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:15-16</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Tibre ejum ajehng ajehng limm, ji bo behre no, ji lꞌkꞌjol gbuul. Jol ejum ajehng ajehng limm, ji li go mbiiri, ji lꞌkꞌlohng gbuul, ane fere kahn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:26; Rom 2:16</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Jo kunen ekpu ana ń kpo wuk nsol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:47; Elt 7:51</char></note> Nne awohng awohng no kpi no, bo bahk-e kake na budu. Nne awohng awohng no ki kpi, jio ji á tiri no re á kpꞌkpi, bo bahk-e taare na.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:11-26</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnyehn Jisos, a abonanyehn Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mak 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nnyehn Jisos, a abonanyehn Jisos kehm bake. Bo tikem ma rehng goji Jisos tib ellong ane. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Owo ane bao kehm-e tongo re, “Nne, a abonane, bo baa, yim go elatahk kpꞌsebe re bo nyehn-a.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Ane ba lꞌwuk alum Esowo, fere jo lim, bo ba li babnnee, a abonanee.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos nyame nfeb, a ebuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mak 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Efung abehng Jisos kehm yele go egbang, a abatꞌtoono ebe, kehm tongo bo re, “Nong, wahr siiren rehng egbuk eto jehko.” Owo bo kehm soro tahm. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Eji bo jo fing asongo, Jisos kehm gboko ellu. Owo egburu nfeb kehm ba kehme ellimi go eto jio, alahb kehm kehme elkimi yel egbang, ba elruru. Bo jolo efin efin ngare nyio.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Owo abatꞌtoono ebe kehm ba kpir-e, kehm-e nyahme re, “Nsoo, nsoo, e kpꞌtane na ao!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Jisos kehm mehle yiimi, kehm nyame nfeb, a ebuku ji jo lim nsahm nsahm. Kehm rahke, edi naange soom. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Anv, eltaame enahne nꞌna me?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Owo bo kehm kehme elfahle, fere jo kpo bo esi. Bo kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Anv, ye elkohn nne awoe, no kpo bung tong nfeb, a ebuku, wuk-e?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nne no bele abi atohko, á nob</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mak 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Bo kehm song rehng go Gerasa ji jolo egbuk eto jehko. Galili egbuk jehka. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Eji Jisos wahre go egbuk, nne awohng lohngo go nla ejahbe, kehm ba wan-e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:27">Nne noo bele abi atohko ekidi eblab. Á jo jene ebun ebun. Á joom kang etahk, á jo kange edi ji alahm akvne jolo no. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Á nyehne kan Jisos a, á kehm rabe, gbo-e go alata, fere jo bung wahre wahre re, “E li nfem anyi awahr a na, Jisos ji Mmon Esowo bi gbale sehng? N kp-a gboongo re, wo ki-m kak erem.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 2:19</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Tibre Jisos tohko tong esabsab etohko jio re á lohng nne noo. Nkpel tvv etohko jio jo yehk-e. Jol eji ane jo kak-e kak agbekobo go abo, a akpade akpade, fere jo baab-e, á jo kiimi na agbekobo nyao, ebi etohko jio jo yehk-e kak go elka emahng.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Owo Jisos kehm-e bahbe re, “Mbing enya mee?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Á kehm faange re, “Egom.” Tibre abi atohko gbalee woom-e go atahng.<verse eid="LUK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Abi atohko nyao kehm gboongo Jisos re, á kꞌtong bo, bo je song yel go nrabbe elbing.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 20:1-3; 2 Pit 2:4</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ngare nyio ellong akuk gbalee jo li nsol ona go nkpe ewong. Abi atohko nyao kehm gboongo Jisos re á lub yake bo, bo song yel akuk nyao go atahng.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:32">Jisos kehm yake bo. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Owo abi atohko nyao kehm lohngo nne noo, song yel akuk go atahng. Akuk nyao kpee kehm beke, song fooro egbunggbung aya, yel alahb tan.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Eji ane ba jo baabe akuk nyao nyehne ano, bo kehm beke, song tooro go etahk, a abon ajahbe ba jolo o. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Ane bao kehm lohngo ba re bo ba nyehn ejum ji ma lim. Eji bo ba kpiri Jisos, bo kehm tob ba nyehn nne no abi atohko lohng-e no, jehk go alata nya Jisos sange sange. Á ma kak nsol go ngubjing kpee. Owo bo kehm kehme elfahle. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Ane ba nyehne ana ngbokesahl nyio ma nob, bo kehm song tooro tong ane bako.<verse eid="LUK 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ane kpee ba lene ejang bio bi Gerasa kehm gboongo Jisos re á tahm o song.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 6:24; 19:22</char></note> Tibre bo jo fahle sehng. Owo Jisos kehm song yel egbang re á feere kehnge.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Nne no abi atohko lohng-e no kehm gboongo Jisos re, “Nong, me n jol a na!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Jisos kehm-e tongo re á song,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 20:17</char></note> fere bung re, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Feere song kehnge, wo song tong ane ana ji Esowo ma lim ka-a.” Owo nne noo kehm tahme, song tooro tong ejahbe jio kpee bade egburu ejum ji Jisos ma lim ka-e.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmon a Jairus, a nnenkal no kooro Jisos ebo go ege a nsubu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mak 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Eji Jisos feere no, ba rehng egbuk eto jehka, ane kehm-e jo gbaame. Tibre bo ji, jo sik-e.<verse eid="LUK 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Owo nne awohng kehm lohngo ba, no bo jo lung-e re Jairus ji jolo ntubesi etahk ero, ba gbo jamme Jisos alahng, fere gboong-e re, á lub je go ege etahk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:42</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Tibre á bele mmon mmon awohng no nkal, no ma kang ewubu a nnya ebal. Á noongo go emel elkv.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Eji Jisos jo jen mbang mbang asongo, ellong ane jo fahd-e na fahd kak.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Nnenkal awohng jolo o, no alung jo lohng-e go nnahb go ewubu a nnya ebal. Á rannge akpohko nya á bele no kpee, ka abalimakahm. Jol nnene we tikem ma lim, á nob. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Owo á kehm jeere kohlo Jisos go njahm, fere koor-e go ege esꞌsili nsubu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 19:38</char></note> Tvtv o, alung eme kehm soro kimi.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Jisos kehm bahbe re, “Nne awo ma-m kooro a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Eji ane kpee ma ten, Pita kehm bungu re, “Nsoo, ellong ane ni kpꞌjene a na, ni ni kp-a sehme.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Owo Jisos kehm kpe bung re, “Nne ma-m kooro. Tibre me n kahn re, nsahm ma-m tele lohng.”<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Eji nnenkal noo sebe kahn re, á nehm ma biiri, á kehm lohngo kpꞌkahme abake, ba gbo jamm-e alahng, kehm tooro go esamahr ane kpee, ana ji wahnge á koor-e no, fere tong ana á soro nob ngare nyꞌnehm o.<verse eid="LUK 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Owo Jisos kehm bungu re, “Mmon ewame, eltaame ena ni ma-a lim, a ma nob. Song go eyebatahng!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 7:50</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Eji Jisos kpi mbungu mbungu, nne awohng kehm lohngo etahk ntubesi ero noo, ba tong-e re, “Mmon ewa ebkpo. Ka kpe gbiingi ntꞌtibi mbol mbol.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Eji Jisos wuku ano, owo á kehm-e faange re, “Ka kpe fahl, taame na taame!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 20:29</char></note> Á bahke nobo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Eji á ba rehng etahk jio, á taamem re nnene kpe yel ekpꞌkpa, sehngem Pita, Jon, a Jems, go nde mmon, a nnyehn, bo ba, á taame no bo yel.<verse eid="LUK 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Nne awohng awohng jo ji ndon ndon, fere jo ling.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:52">Owo Jisos kehm bungu re, “Kana kpe ling, mmon noa ka kpo, á kpꞌlale na.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bo kehm-e elwolo, tibre bo jo kahne kpee re, mmon noo ebkpo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 17:32</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Jisos kame kan ane bao yehke, á kehm jabbe mmon noo go ebo, kehm rabe re, “Mmon, mehl!”<verse eid="LUK 8:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Etohko mmon noo kehm soro feere ba yel-e, á soro mehl tvtv. Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, bo ka mmon noo nsol alehke, á li. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Nde, a nnyehn, kpo bo esi sehng. Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, bo kꞌtong nne awohng awohng ji ma lim.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos tumu abatꞌtoono ebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mak 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Jisos kehm lungu abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal, tv edi ajehng, fere ka bo nsahm nyi bo bahke jo kam ane abi atohko kpee yehke, fere jo lim ane, bo nob ayam ebo. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Owo á kehm tumu bo re, bo song tiingi ane etib bi etul bi Esowo, fere lim ane, bo nob ayam ebo. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Á kehm tongo bo re, “Eljen ni ḿ bahke tahme, kana rod ejum ajehng ajehng fili, ana ebti efilibo, a abam, a nsol alehke, a akpohko. Kana fili nsubu ebal ebal!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:35</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Etahk ajehng ajehng ji bo lꞌvvr-n, jolen o, tete wahn tahm ejahbe jio.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 16:15</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Ejahbe ajehng ajehng ji tohk-n vvrv, tahmen ejahbe jio, wahn kum ebtohko go egahne akpade. Ebtohko bio bi bahke jolo ana ntianse nyi bahke jo bung tob bo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:51</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Abatꞌtoono bao kehm tahme, jo yannge ajahbe ajahbe ajahbe, jo tiingi nnoobo etib, fere jo lim ane edi ajehng ajehng, bo nob ayam ebo.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana ala teele Herod</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mak 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Eji Herod ji jolo ntul no Galili wuku nsol kpee nyi jo lim, owo ala kehm jo teel-e, tibre ane bandiki jo bungu re, “Jon ji nwohngalahb ebnyahme go elkv.” <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Ane bandiki bungu re, “Elaija wo ma lohng ba.” Ane bandiki bungu re, “Nnyehnamahr awohng noko no jolo go nkꞌkula ngare wo ma feere ba jol go elkpin.”<verse eid="LUK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Herod bungu re, “Jon, m m-e kim esi, wo anv, nne awo n kpꞌkpeke wuk elkohn nsol ana nyia bada ne?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:9">Owo á kehm jo gare ana á bahke nyehne Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 23:8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos le ellong ane tvv (5,000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mak 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jon 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Eji abatiingetib ma feere, bo kehm ba tong Jisos ejum ajehng ajehng ji bo ma lim. Á kehm koko bo bo, tahm a bo go ejahbe ji bo jo lung re Betsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Eji ane wuku ano, owo bo kehm-e toono. Á kehm gbaame bo, fere bung a bo bade etul bi Esowo. Ane ba jo yam, á lim bo, bo nob.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Ngare nyi njul yahke ba ellahme, owo abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal kehm bake ba tong-e re, “Tong ane baa, bo song go ajahbe nya li kpidi kpidi, a abon ajahbe bako, eji bo lꞌting nsol alehke li, fere ting adi nyao bo bahke kange. Tibre tahm edi jia rehng go ajahbe ekidi kpꞌlabe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Wahnfono antahng kaan bo nsol alehke, bo li.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 21:15; Mat 24:45</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Bo kehm faange re, “E kpi abon abred na alon, kunu abon nsahre na abal ba ba. Anv, a kpꞌsebe re wahr tahm song gunu nsol alehke, ba ka elkohn ellong ane ana niaa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 16:14-15</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Tibre aneblum ba jolo o, jolo ejum ane atahltahl nkpel ewubbal atahl awubu (5,000).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Owo Jisos kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Nong, ane baa ji agꞌgabe agꞌgabe, ellong anehng anehng jo jol ane atahl abal ane awubu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm limi ano, ane bao kpee ji ndi.<verse eid="LUK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Owo Jisos kehm rodo abon abred bao na alon, kunu abon nsahre abal, kpiidi amahr enye go elbung, kak Esowo saam, bakke, ka abatꞌtoono ebe, eji bo lꞌsong bak ellong ane bao. Bo kehm song bak bo.<verse eid="LUK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Ane bao li kpee wohngo. Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm taare erik ji ane bao li no sa, ruru ewubu ejeere ebbal.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Pita bungu bada Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mak 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Efung abehng bi Jisos jo kak ero antahng, abatꞌtoono ebe kehm ba kpir-e. Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Anv, ane kpo bung renan bada name? Me n li elkohn nne awo?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bo kehm faange re, “Ane bandiki kpo bung re, wo Jon ji nwohngalahb wo. Ane bandiki re, wo Elaija wo. Ane bandiki re, nnyehnamahr awohng noko no jolo mahne mahne wo ma nyahme.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:14; 7:12,26-27,40-43</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Owo Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Anv, wahn kpo bung renan bada name? Me n li elkohn nne awo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Pita kehm faange re, “Wo li Mesaya nyi Esowo tum-a no.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Jisos kehm rehke bo, fere bung a bo tꞌtahne re, bo kꞌtong nnene.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bungu bade elkv ene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-38">Mak 8:30-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Owo Jisos kehm bungu tong abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Mmon no nne bahke nyehne erem gbꞌgbal. Anebkul nfam, atubesi abalimajom, a atꞌtibi ba atahm bahk-e tene, fere wul-e. Lꞌkang nfung era, á nyahme go elkv.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 18:31-34</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Owo á kehm bungu tong ane kpee re, “Nne no lꞌseb re á toon-m, nong á ten elne tv-m, fere rod ekros eje efung abehng abehng, jo toon-m. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Nne awohng awohng no kpꞌsebe re á tahre elkpin ene, á bahke tane na elkpin ene. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtane elkpin ene tib go egame esi, á bahke tahre na elkpin ene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 17:32-33; Jon 12:25</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Nsehng anyi nne bahke lehke, jol afi á gbo afang nya njini nyia kpee, fere tane elkpin ene, afi á yake elne ka go? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌbe ndon, ten-m, afi jolo alum enyame, fvfo, Mmon no nne bahke tob be-e ndon, á lꞌba go ege ellub, a ellub ni Nde, a abarebare enjel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 1:16</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Egom jindiki ji yim a, nehm kpo, tete bo nyehn etul bi Esowo go amahr.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:32</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yaange ngubjing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mak 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Bomo ngare nyi Jisos bungu alum nyao, eji ma kang nfung enehkeni, owo á kehm rodo Pita, Jon, a Jems, wahr a bo go ewong re á song kak ero.<verse eid="LUK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Eji á jo kak ero, esamahr ebe kehm yaange. Nsol nyi á kake no kehm bare, fere jo nyꞌnyane.<verse eid="LUK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Owo ane abal kehm soro lohng ba kehme elbungu a ne, noko jolo Moses, noko jol Elaija.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 12:27</char></note><figure style="fig" alt="Transfiguration of Jesus" file="WA03858b.tif" size="col" loc="Luk 9:30" ref="9:30">Ana Jisos yaange ngubjing</figure> <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bo ba go ellub ba bung a Jisos bade elkv ni á yahke ba elkpoko go Jeusalem, eji á lꞌgohro lim ji Esowo toobo no bum-e.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Wo gana, Bab Pita ebgbo ellu kpꞌlale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 14:37</char></note> Eji bo ma nyahme, bo kehm nyehne Jisos a ellub ene, fere nyehn ane abal ba yiimi a ne ona.<verse eid="LUK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Eji ane bao yahke tahm, owo Pita kehm tongo Jisos re, “Nsoo, nꞌnob re wahr jol a. Nong, wahr si nkpatahk era, behko bꞌba, behko bi Moses, behko bi Elaija.” Jol á kahnem ji á jo bꞌbung.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Eji á kpi mbungu mbungu, ekparesemsem kehm tahle, ba bulu bo. Bo kehm kehme elfahle, eji bo woomo go ekparesemsem.<verse eid="LUK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Bo kehm wuku ellum go atahng ekparesemsem re, “A wo li akor-m mmon ewame, jo wuken ye!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 3:22</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Eji ellum nio ma mal, bo nyehne Jisos ntahngtahng. Bo belle na belle. Ngare nyio bo tikem tong nne awohng awohng ejum ajehng ajehng ji bo nyehne no.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi mmonse no bele ebi etohko, á nob</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mak 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Etoono efung behko eji bo ma badde go ewong, ellong ane tvv kehm ba kpiri Jisos.<verse eid="LUK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Nne awohng go ellong ane bao kehm rabe re, “Ntꞌtibi, n kpa gboongo! Nyehn mmon ewame ana! Ye ntahngtahng wo n kpi-e no. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Ebi etohko kpo yehk-e. Ngare anyehng anyehng nyi á lꞌyehk-e, á soro biingi tvtv, fere sok-e, tete nfahl jo tub-e nnyo, fere jo jahr-e. Kpo riidi kehm-e yake abo. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Me n gboongo abatꞌtoono eba re bo kam-e yehke. Bo maam lim.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Owo Jisos kehm faange re, “Jen ji wahnge wahn ane ba li anv kil taame? Ń kpo fere soodo! Anv, m bahke kange renan a nahne, fere jo tib-n, ń kehm kahne? Ko mmon ewa ba a ne!”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Eji mmon noo jo jen abake, ebi etohko jio kehm-e soro yehke tub go ndi, á soro gbo ngboko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:42">Owo Jisos kehm nyame esabsab etohko jio, fere lim mmon noo, á nob, fere yak-e ka nde.<verse eid="LUK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ane kpee kehm kpoko bo esi, eji bo nyehne egburu nsahm nyi Esowo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Ana Jisos kpe bung bade elkv ene</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mak 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Eji kpi nkpoko nkpoko ane bao kpee esi bade ejum ajehng ajehng ji Jisos ma lim, owo á kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Wuken alum nyaa, wahn kak go egahna ntim! Tibre Mmon no nne, bo yahk-e ba elyake kak ane go abo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Bo kahnem ana alum nyao lohngo no. Tibre á lenngem bo, eji bo lꞌkꞌkahn ana lohngo no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 18:34; Mak 4:13; Jon 8:27; 10:6</char></note> Bo jo fꞌfahl a ye bahb ana alum nyao lohngo no.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne awo ga gbal?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mak 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Abatꞌtoono Jisos kehm kehme nfaabe lim bada nne no ga gbal go bo ellong.<verse eid="LUK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Eji Jisos sebe kahn ji bo jo tir go bo a ntim, owo á kehm koko mmonse, á ba yiimi kohl-e, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />kehm tongo bo re, “Nne awohng awohng no lꞌko mmonse ana noa tib go egama mbing, á ko me. Nne no lꞌko me, á ko nne no tum-m no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:40</char></note> Tibre nne no lꞌga rede go egahne ellong, ye wo li njꞌjoka nne.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne awo li nne ewahne?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mak 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Jon kehm bungu re, “Nsoo, wahr ebnyehn nne no kpꞌkame ane abi atohko yehke go ega mbing. E m-e sahde, tibre wa á kpehme toono ana wahr.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Owo Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Kana ye kpe sahde, tibre nne no tohk-n ko ekv, ye nne ewahne wo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 1:15-18; Jon 10:16</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ejahbe ji tene Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Eji afung nya bo bahke rodo Jisos tahm a ne go ejahbetul Esowo ma kabbe, á kehm bobo eltim ene re á tahm go Jeusalem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:8; Luk 13:33</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Á kehm tumu ane, bo gbo-e mbang, song rehng go ejahbe Samaria ajehng re bo song toobo nsol bum-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:4</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ane ba jolo ona we koom, tibre bo kahne kpee re, á jo tahme go Jeusalem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:9</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Eji abatꞌtoono ebe Jems, a Jon nyehne ano, owo bo kehm bahbe re, “Ntul, anv, a kpꞌsebe re wahr biri agun lohng go ejahbetul Esowo tv boa, ana Elaija limi noa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:14</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Owo Jisos kehm keebe, kehm nyame bo re, “Anv, ń nehme kahn elkohn etohko ji ń kpi noa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:44</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />“Tibre Mmon no nne baam re á ba rannge elkpin ane, á ba na re ane bel eltahre.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:17; 12:47</char></note> Owo bo kehm sehnge, song rehng ejahbe jehko.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nong, akvne kpa akvne kak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Eji bo jo jen go mbang asongo, nne awohng kehm tongo Jisos re, “M bahk-a toono, je edi ajehng ajehng ji a fi no.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Owo Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Akpangang kpi abing, nruk kpi ntahk. Wo, Mmon no nne, edi ellohko esi ajehng ajehng á kpimm.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 2:11</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo nne noko re, “Tahm toon-m!” Á kehm-e faange re, “Nsoo, nong me n tohko gbo mbang song kpa nsoo kak.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Nong, akvne kpa akvne ebo kak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:60 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:1; Kol 3:1-2</char></note> Wo, song, wo song tiingi etib bio bi etul bi Esowo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Owo nne noko kehm kpe bung re, “Ntul, m bahk-a toono. Nong, me n tohko gbo mbang song tong ane ebame re me n fio.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Owo Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Nne awohng awohng no ma rod elu eje, bom egbe abahme, fere jo keebe go njahm, á kpeem fuumu re á kuumu etul bi Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 17:32</char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yehke ane atahl ara ane awubu tum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Eji ma jol ano, owo Jisos kehm yehke ane atahl ara ane awubu bako, tum bo ane abal abal re,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 6:7</char></note> bo gbo-e mbang song rehng ejahbe ajehng ajehng, a edi ajehng ajehng ji yefono antahng yahke ba eljeke.<verse eid="LUK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Tib á tongo bo re, “Egbe ji elkpake jia gbalee. Abalimeltum li ntiil. Owo fvfo nobo re wahn gboongo nfono egbe, á tum abalimeltum tv go ege egbe, bo song kpa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:35-38</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Songen, n kp-n tumu ana abon ejoro re wahn song go ellong agabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 8:32</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Kana fili akpohko, a abam!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:35</char></note> Kana kak akpaketa! Kana yange, kak nne awohng awohng nnyo go mbang!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 4:5</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />“Etahk ajehng ajehng ji ń lꞌyange, jo kaken aneb etahk bao nnyo re, ‘Nong, elkoono jol etahk jia!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Nne lꞌfere jol o, no kpꞌsebe elkoono, elkoono enahne bahke jolo a ne, tohko jol ano elkoono enahne bahke feere ba tob-n. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Jolen etahk jꞌnehm ona, wahn jo li, fere jo wo ejum ajehng ajehng ji bo lꞌka-n. Tibre nlokeltum fꞌfuumu re á bel eltuuru ene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 9:9-15</char></note> Kana jo yaange ntahk nyindiki jol!<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />“Ejahbe ajehng ajehng ji ń lꞌje, bo lꞌvvr-n, jo liin ejum ajehng ajehng ji bo ka-n no. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Limen aneb ayam, bo nob ejahbe jio, wahn fere tong ane bao re, ‘Etul bi Esowo ma-n kabbe.’<verse eid="LUK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />“Ejahbe ajehng ajehng ji ń lꞌje, bo tohk-n vvrv, tahmen song go afak nya li ejahbe jio, wahn jo bung re, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Ebtohko bi ejahbe ejahne bi ma-r laake go egahre akpade, e kpꞌkumu tv-n. Ejum jia ji nobo re wahn kahn ji li re, Etul bi Esowo ebkabbe.’<verse eid="LUK 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />“N kp-n tongo re, Efung elam bio, elam nehm ga bib a anebe Sodom ana bahke bibi a ejahbe jio.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Eyuu a nahne, wahn anebe Korasin! Eyuu a nahne, wahn anebe Betsaida! Li re Taya abola Saidon nyehne akpokosi ana nya ḿ ma nyehn, kehn bobgbo ndon wuku wuku, kak agbajake nsol, fere ji go atong.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:21-23</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Efung elam bio, elam nehm ga bib a aneb Taya, a Saidon ana bahke bibi a nahne!<verse eid="LUK 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />“Wahn anebe Kapenium, bo ma-n mehl wahre rehng go ejahbetul Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 8:5-10</char></note> Bo bahke fere rod-n, ro kak go ellulagun.<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />“Nne no lꞌwuk-n, á wuku me. Nne no lꞌten-n, á tene me. Nne no lꞌten me, á tene nne no tum-m no.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:40</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana ane atahl ara ane awubu bao feere no kehnge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ane atahl ara ane awubu bao feere kehnge go eyebatahng, fere jo bung re, “Ntul jol abi atohko wob-r na go elwo tib go ega mbing.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Me n nyehn nnehm ma fooro go ejahbetul Esowo gbo ana emangedu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:31</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />M ma-n ka nsahm nyi ḿ bahke jo jade enyo, a enang go akpade, fere ka-n nsahm nyi gbale sehnge nsahm kpee nyi Nnekv kpi no. Ejumjum limm, ji bahk-n jo lim go mbang anyehng anyehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 16:18</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Kana jo geere tib abi atohko wob-n go elwo. Jo geeren, tibre abing enyahne, bobnyon go ejahbetul Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 3:5</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana eyebatahng gbale Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Ngare nyio Jisos kehm bele eyebatahng go etohko, kehm bungu re, “N kp-a tehke Nsoo, wo ji li Ntul no ejahbetul Esowo, a ndi, tibre a behre nsol nyia re akahnkahn ane, a anebe ngbere kꞌnyehn, a ma fere lennge ka abonbili. O nsoo, ano wo kor-a no go ega eltim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 1:27-29</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Nsoo ebyake ejum ajehng ajehng kak-m go ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 28:18</char></note> Nnene nehme kahn nne no Mmon li no, sehngem Nsoo ntahngtahng wo kpꞌkahne. Nnene nehme tob kahn nne no Nsoo li no, sehngem Mmon wo kpꞌkahne, a nne no Mmon bahke lennge Nsoo ka-e.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Jisos kehm keebe, kehm bungu tong abatꞌtoono ebe ngare nyi bo jolo bo bo re, “Elfuulu li ka ane ba kpꞌnyehne nsol nyi wahn kpꞌnyehne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:1-4</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Tibre n kp-n tongo re, Abanyehnamahr gbalee, a atul jo sebe re bo nyehn ji ń kpꞌnyehne, jol bo nyehnem. Bo jo sebe re bo wuk ji ń kpꞌwuku, jol bo tikem wuk.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:10-12</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bada nne a Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Ntꞌtibi no atahm awohng kehm lohngo ba re á ba gare Jisos. Owo á kehm bungu re, “Ntꞌtibi, m bahke limi renan, kehm bele elkpin ni li go njinanjini?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Jisos kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, jen ji bo nyono go atahm? Jen ji a kpo lꞌlung?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Owo á kehm faange re, “Esowo Ntul ewa bahke jo kor-a eltim eltim ena, etohko etohko eja, eko eko eja, a ntir a ntir enya. Nne ebjing ewa jo kor-a ana ebjing eba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 13:8-10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Wobfaange go nseenge. Jo lim ano, a bahke bele elkpin.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ntꞌtibi noo sebe re á tib re, ye etingi nne ji. Owo á kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Nne awo li nne ebjing ewame?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Nne awohng lohngo go Jeusalem, jo tahm go Jeriko. Eji á jo tahm, á kehm song kpiri awajv. Bo kehm-e yehke nsol nyi á kake no, fere dv-e, tab-e tub, á sa noongo o ana nkvne.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />“Wo ana, ejum jo jol, nlimajom awohng jo sehnge mbang nyio. Eji á ba nyehn nne noo nong no, á kehm gbake eje, sehng nkpe a mbang nyehko tahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12:7</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />“Ano wo fvfo nne no kpo lim eltum go etahk Esowo kehm tob ba rehng edi jio, ba nyehn nne noo, tob gbake eje, sehng nkpe a mbang nyehko tahm eje.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />“Nne a Samaria awohng no jo tahm eljen, kehm tob ba rehng eji nne noo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:9; 8:48</char></note> Eji á nyehn-e no, ndon kehm-e gbale go eltim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 9:36</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Á kehm jeere, song kpir-e, fere kak-e akehng go alok, a alahb avain, gba-e, kehm-e rodo kunu go ege a nnyam, tahm a ne, song rehng go etahk ajehng. Owo á bohng-e no. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Etoono efung behko, á kehm yehke nsiring ewubu, ka nfontahk noo, kehm bungu re, ‘Jo kpur-e. Akpohko anyehng anyehng nya a lꞌkpe rannge budu, n lꞌba, m bahke feere a nya ka-a.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 5:2-4; Ell 22:12</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />“Anv, ane ara baa, nne awo a tiri re, á jolo nne ebjing a nne no awajv dv-e no?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Owo ntꞌtibi no atahm noo kehm faange re, “Nne no á fil-e ndon wo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Song, wo tob song lim ano!”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mata abola Meri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Eji Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe jo jen go mbang asongo, á kehm song rehng ejahbe ajehng.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:38">Owo nnenkal awohng no bo jo lung-e re Mata kehm-e vvrv, kak go etahk. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Mata bele mmonannyehn no bo jo lung-e re Meri, ji jii kohlo Ntul a Jisos, jo wuungu atung go ege alum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:1; 12:2-3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Mata jo dehke na dehke, eji á jo lam nsol ka bo, tib eltum gbale sehng. Owo á kehm bake, ba tong Jisos re, “Ntul, anv wa nehme lub, eji n kpꞌloko eltum nia antahng, Meri kil-m ebo kaka? Tong-e, á ba kak-m ebo!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Owo Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Mata, a kpꞌtiiri nsol gbalee nyi kp-a gbiingi go eltim. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ejum ajehng ji li ji tahne tahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 6:33; Rom 14:17</char></note> Meri wo ma yehke ji ga nob, ji bo lꞌki-e ma tiki taare.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Bade ero akake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:8-13">Mat 6:8-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Efung abehng Jisos jolo edi ajehng, jo kak ero. Eji á ma kak mal, ntꞌtoono ewe awohng kehm bungu tong-e re, “Ntul, tib-r ana e bahke jo kak ero, ana Jon tibi abatꞌtoono ebe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Ń lꞌkehme ero kak, jo bungen re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Nsoo, nong, mbing enya jol saang!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Yake etul eba ba!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Jo ka-r nsol alehke nyi lꞌbiingi a nahre go efung efung.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Jo tahm ka-r go egahre abiafem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Tibre wahrfono antahng kpo tob tahm ka nne awohng awohng no lim-r abiafem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Ka lim, e yel go elgaare!”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Li re nne awohng ewahne bahke jeke, song kpiri nte ewe nlum atv, kehm-e tongo re, ‘Mbi, bong-m abon abred na ara, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />tibre nte ewame awohng eblohng ba eljen go egame etahk. Ejum alehke ajehng ajehng n kpimm, ji m bahk-e kake.’<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />“Fono, nne no wob ekpꞌkpa bahke faange re, ‘Ka ma kpe gbiinga, mbutahk li ta taa, abon ebame nong a name ga edilnonga, n nehm ma mehl ba ka-aa?’<verse eid="LUK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />“N kp-n tongo re, jol afi á tahmem ba ka-e tib eji á li nte ewe, á bahke tahme ba ka-e ana á kpꞌsebe tib go elgbiingi ni á kp-e gbiingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 18:1-8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Owo wahnge n kp-n tongo re, wahn bahb, ḿ bahke bele. Seben, ḿ bahke nyehne. Kahden, bo bahke lennge mbu ka-n. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌbahb, á bahke bele. Nne no lꞌseb, á bahke nyehne. Nne no lꞌkahd, bo bahke lennge mbu ka-e.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />“Li re nne awohng ewahne li nde nne, mmon ewe lꞌbahb-e re á ka-e ebred, anv, á bahk-e kake eltala? Afi á lꞌbahb-e re á ka-e nsahre, á bahke bobo nnyo ka-e? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Afi á lꞌbahb-e re á ka-e ejenkok, á bahk-e kake nnang? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Anv, wahn ji li na abi ane, ń lꞌmal ka abon ebahne nsol nyi nno, lꞌlim renan Nsoo no li go ejahbetul lꞌkꞌka ane ba bahb-e no Etingi Etohko?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 11:24</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos, a ntul a nnehm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mak 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Jisos kehm kame nne no jolo nkamme ebi etohko yehke. Eji ebi etohko jio ma lohng nne noo, nne noo kehm kehme elbungu. Owo kehm kpoko ellong ane bao esi.<verse eid="LUK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Egom jindiki kehm kehme elbungu re, “Á kpo kam ane abi atohko yehke tib go nsahm nyi Belsebul ntul a nnehm ka-e no.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Egom jehko jo sebe re bo gar-e. Owo bo kehm-e tongo re á tib elliingi ni bahke lohngo go ejahbetul Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 8:11</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Jisos kꞌkahn ntir atahng abo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 2:25</char></note> owo á kehm tongo bo re, “Ejahbe ajehng ajehng ji lꞌyab, jol ebo ebo, bahke rannge na, afi fere jol nlaaga, nlaaga nyio bahke tane. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Anv, ejahbetul ji nnehm lꞌyab, ejahbetul eje bahke limi renan kehm yiimi? Tibre wahn kpo bung re, n kpo kam ane abi atohko yehke go nsahm nyi ntul a nnehm. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Lꞌjol re n kpo kam ane abi atohko yehke go nsahm nyi ntul a nnehm, anv, nsahm anyi abon ebahne kpo ko, jo kam bo yehke? Owo wahnge bo bahke jolo ane ba bahk-n lame.<verse eid="LUK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />“Wo, lꞌfere jol re n kpꞌkame ane abi atohko yehke go nsahm nyi Esowo, lohngo re etul bi Esowo bi ma badde ba tob-n. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Etahntahn nne lꞌfili ntahme go ebo, jo baabe etahk eje, ejum ajehng ajehng eje nehm ran esi. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Etahntahn nne ji tahne sehng-e lꞌba, ba nok a ne, fere ga-e, á bahk-e taare ntahme enye nyi á kpo tir re, nyi nyi bahk-e kake ebo, fere kpu nsol enye tahm a nyi song bak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 2:15</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Nne no ki li ka me, ye nnekv ewame wo. Nne no tohk-m tob elkpuku bum edi ajehng, á kpꞌfare na faade.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana esabsab etohko kpo feere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Eji esabsab etohko ma lohng nne, á kpo song yannge go adi nya kpꞌwaange,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:38-39</char></note> jo seb edi ji á bahke reke ekv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 5:12</char></note> Á tohko ting edi ajehng ajehng, á bahke bungu re, ‘M bahke feere go egame etahk ji n tahme sa.’<verse eid="LUK 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />“Á lꞌfeere ba, ba nyehn, etahk jio bo ma feenge, fere tuungu ejum ajehng ajehng bum go nseenge. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Owo á bahke feere song ko atohko nyako na asehma nya sabe sehnge yefono. Bo feere ba lene o. Nne noo bahke kpe sab na sehng ana wuku wuku á jolo no.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 2:20; Jon 5:14</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnenkal no tehke Meri nnyehn Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Eji Jisos ma bung ano, nnenkal awohng go ellong ane bao kehm bungu re, “Elfuulu li a nnenkal no jel-a no, fere yab-a.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Elfuulu ga li ka ane ba wuku alum Esowo, fere jo lim.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 8:21</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana ane bahbe Jisos re á lim nkpokosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Eji ellong ane jo kpe ba budu, Jisos kehm kehme elbungu re, “Ane ba li anv, abi ane ba. Bo kpꞌsebe re bo nyehn nkpokosi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 1:22</char></note> Nkpokosi anyehng anyehng limm, nyi bo bahke nyehne, sehngem nkpokosi ana nyi Jona nyi bo bahke nyehne. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ana Jona jolo elliingi ka aneb Ninive, ano wo fvfo Mmon no nne bahke tob jol elliingi ka ane ba li anv.<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />“Go efung elam bio, ntul a nnenkal no Seba bahke mehle yiimi, ka ane ba li anv ebi. Tibre á lohngo nlaabambang ejahbe, ba goji Solomon re á ba wuk elkahne ene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 8:11</char></note> Wo anv, ejum jia, ji gbale sehnge Solomon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 1:7</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />“Go efung elam bio, anebe Ninive bahke mehle yiimi, ka ane ba li anv ebi. Tibre bo gbꞌgbo ndon go bo abiafem, eji bo wuku alum Esowo nya Jona bungu no. Nyehnen, a wo li ejum ji gbale sehnge Jona.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ellennge ni ngubjing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Nnene limm, no ma nyꞌnyaale etꞌrekahng, fere rod song behr, jol rod ejeere konngo. Á bahke rodo na, kunu go ejum ji bo kpo kunu etꞌrekahng, eji ane ba kpꞌyele ekpꞌkpa lꞌjo nyehn.<verse eid="LUK 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />“Elmahr ena li ana etꞌrekahng ka ngubjing enya. Elmahr ena lꞌjol saang, ngubjing enya kpee bahke jolo ellennge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:47</char></note> Elmahr ena lꞌfere jol abꞌbi, ngubjing enya kpee bahke gboko ejannge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 8:21</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />“Jo kunu ekpu, eji ellennge ni wob-a go atahng lꞌkꞌfere gbo ejannge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:8-10</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ngubjing enya kpee lꞌjol ellennge, kꞌbel nkpohko anyehng anyehng nyi kpi ejannge, owo ngubjing enya bahke jolo ellennge ellennge kpee ana etꞌrekahng kpꞌyake tub-a.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:10-21; 8:12</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos jo wa Bab Farisi eyuu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mak 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Eji Jisos kpi mbungu mbungu, nne a Farisi awohng kehm-e tongo re á song li nsol a ne. Owo á kehm yele ekpꞌkpa, song ji go ekpꞌkuru nsol alehke.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 7:36; 14:1</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Nne a Farisi noo kehm-e kpoko esi, eji á nyehne re, Jisos ruum akidi, kehm kehme nsol li.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 15:2</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Owo Ntul a Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Wahn Farisis, ń kpo ru njahm a nkob, a njahm ekpingi. Go atahng, abꞌbi nya ma rur, a nsol ejv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 17:20-21</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Wahn agboolo nya! Ye ji limi njahm elatahk sang tob lim atahnga? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Yaren akpak ka nsol nyi wob go egahne akob, a nkpingi, ejum ajehng ajehng ejahne bahke bare.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:8-9</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Eyuu a nahne, wahn Farisis! Wahn kpo ka eltahme go asahkesahke nsol ana nkambe, a alamaje, a anyane nyako kpee, fere jo gbake elam, a elkoro ni Esowo bum go nkpe. Limen nsol ebal ebal! Kana gbake ejum ajehng, bum go nkpe!<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Eyuu a nahne, wahn Farisis! Go egahne ekpꞌkpa ero, kpo kor-n re wahn jo ji go mbuksong. Go are, kpo kor-n re ane jo gong na, kak-n nnyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 20:46</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />“Eyuu a nahne! Ń li ana alahm nya bo kil nyehne, ane kpꞌkadde sehng, jol bo nehme kahn re, bobfere jol ane ba ki kpe li saang.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Owo ntꞌtibi atahm na awohng kehm-e faange re, “Ntꞌtibi, alum nya a kpꞌbungu a, a kp-r suku nao!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Eyuu a nahne, wahn atꞌtibi ba atahm fvfo! Ń kpo si ane elsol ni nnen ni kpo riidi elsolo, jol wahnfono antahng, ń kpehme tohko gꞌgare elmehle.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“Eyuu a nahne! Wahn ba li ane ba kake alahm nya anyehnamahr Esowo go nsement, ba babnso ejahne wulu no. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Eji ḿ ma lim ano, ebtib re, wahn ebtaame tv ji babnso ejahne limi no. Tibre bo ba wulu bo. Wahn ma rod alahm ebo kpꞌkake nsement.<verse eid="LUK 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />“Owo wahnge Elkahne ni Esowo bungu re, ‘M bahke tumu abanyehnamahr, fere tum abatiingetib tv bo. Bandiki, bo bahke wulu bo. Bandiki, bo bahke nohko bo,’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />eji alung ma abanyehnamahr kpee ba bo wulu no, bomo ngare nyi njini bomo no lꞌtuunu ane ba li anv,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 7:52</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />bomo goji Ebel tete ba rehng goji Sekaraya ji bo wul-e go elka elka ni edi njom alimi, a etahk Esowo. Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Ane ba li anv, Esowo bahke bo bahb bada nsol nyia kpee.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Eyuu a nahne, wahn atꞌtibi ba atahm? Wahn ba ma rod egbokoro jio ji etahk elkahne. Wahnfono yelem. Ń kpo kpan ane ba jol yele.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Eji Jisos ma tahm edi jio, owo atꞌtibi ba atahm, a Bab Farisi kehm-e kehme alum jamme, fere jo bahb-e abahbe gbalee bada nsol tvv, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />fere jo baab-e go ege alum nnyo, eji bo lꞌbob-e.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Ayist nya Bab Farisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Eji ellong ane gbalee ma ba rur edi ajehng, bo ruru sehng, fere jo kadde atem go akpade, owo Jisos kehm gboko mbang tong abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Jo gberen ayist nyao nya Farisis, nya li alum abal abal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 16:6,12</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Ejumjum limm, ji bo bulu no, ji bo lꞌkꞌlennge. Ejumjum limm, ji bo behre no, ji lꞌkꞌjol gbuul. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ejum ajehng ajehng ji ḿ bungu go ejannge, bo bahke wuku ngara njul. Ji ḿ bungu awꞌwa go nkimi, bo bahke kuumu go aro ntahk, tooro wahre wahre.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne awo fuumu re nne fahl-e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ate ebame wahn, n kp-n tongo re, Kana jo fahl ane ba kpo wul ngubjing, ba lꞌkꞌma kpe lim ejumjum budu. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />M bahk-n tibi nne no fuumu re wahn fahl-e. Jo fahlen ye jio ji kpi nsahm nyi á bahke ma ro nne kak ellulagun ngare nyi ngubjing ma kpo. N kp-n tongo re, ye wo nobo re wahn fahl-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 20:10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Nne li ma gunu nruk elon go are, ka mpene ebal. Jol tvtv ona, abehng abehng limm, bi Esowo m-e yini. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Alv enyahne nya li go egahne esi, Esowo ebfange kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 21:18</char></note> Owo nobo re wahn kꞌjo fahl. Tibre wahn ba ga gbal sehnge nruk, jol afi bo ruru renan.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bada ntianse ayiimi ka Jisos go esamahr ane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“N kp-n tongo re, Nne awohng awohng no lꞌyiim-m ntianse go esamahr ane, Mmon no nne bahk-e tob yiimi ntianse go esamahr enjel nyi Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Nne no lꞌten-m go esamahr ane, Mmon no nne bahke tob ten-e fvfo go esamahr enjel nyi Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌbung ellum tob Mmon no nne, á bahke ma bel eltahmeka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:7-9</char></note> Nne no lꞌbung ebi tob Etingi Etohko, á nehm bel eltahmeka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:16-17; Jon 16:7-9</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Bo lꞌko-n, tahm a nahne go ntahk ero, afi jolo go esamahr atubesi, afi bo fere kak-n esub, kana jo tiiri bade ana ḿ bahke faange, jol kana jo tiiri ana ḿ bahke bungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Tibre Etingi Etohko bahk-n tibi ngare nyio ji ḿ bahke bungu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bade egboolo efange nne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Nne awohng go ellong ane bao kehm bungu tong Jisos re, “Ntꞌtibi, ba tong mmonannee, wahr baange nsol nyi e li elkv me!”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Owo Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Mbi, nnene limm, no tong-m re me n jo lam alam, fere jo bak-n nsol nyi ḿ ma li elkv.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Á kehm bungu tong bo ane kpee re, “Jo kunen ekpu, wahn jo gbere elnahne, eji ń lꞌkꞌjo baare amahr enyahne go nsol ane re wahn jo bel na bel bel bel budu. Tibre nsol gbalee nyi nne kpi no sang li elkpin ene.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 6:9-10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Owo á kehm tubu bo elgan re, “Efange nne ajehng jolo gona, ji egbe eje sahb lꞌlak. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Á kehm bahbe elne re, ‘Anv, m bahke limi renan? Ebuungu ejame gbalem, ji m bahke lake eblu ebame.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Owo á kehm bungu re, ‘Ana wo m bahke limi. M bahke kpe nyange ebuungu ejame. Owo m bahke lake eblu ebame, a nsol nyehko gona kpee. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Owo m bahke kehm bungu tong elname re, Me n li efa sehng. M bahke jehke, re ekv, bel elkpin, jo li na li li li, fere jo wo, bel eyebatahng. Tibre me m bel nsol gbalee nyi bahk-m biingi go nnya tvv.’<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />“Esowo kehm-e tongo re, ‘Wo egboolo jia, lela atv bo bahke bake, ba ko elkpin ena. Nsol nyi a ma kuuru bum elna, nne nondiki wo bahke ba ting ko.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 9:27</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />“Ano wo tob li ka nne no lꞌkpu nsol afang luk elne, no ki gbo afang nya Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 6:17-19</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esowo kpꞌkahne ji nne kpꞌsebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Jisos kehm bungu tong abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Ana wo wahnge n kp-n tongo re, wahn kꞌjo tiiri bada nsol alehke nyi ḿ bahke jo li, a nsol nyi ḿ bahke jo kak go egahna ngubjing. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Elkpin ni ga gbal sehnge nsol alehke. Ngubjing ga gbal sehnge abomo.<verse eid="LUK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />“Nyehnen nruk! Bo kpehme bahm. Bo kpehme kpa. Abuungu, bo kpimm, jol bo kpehme kak go ayake. Esowo bi kpo le bo. Anv, wahn sang ga gbal sehnge nruka? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nne awo ewahne no bahke kpe ma budu abon nnya go ege elkpin, eji á kpꞌtiiri ana? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Eji ń lꞌkꞌma lim mmonsꞌsohko ejum ana noo, jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌtiiri bada nsol nyehko?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />“Nyehnen ana atꞌtul nkpad kpo gbal go emahng! Bo kpehme nyennge, lim eltum. Bo kpehme jamme nsol, kak elbo. Wo, n kp-n tongo re, jol Solomon go ege ellub, á liibem ana etꞌtuul ajehng go ellong atꞌtuul nyao. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ana Esowo kpo liibi ajele nya li go emahng, nya kpo kpin lela lela, behna bo jahm fi, jen ji wahnge á lꞌki-n tob liibi, wahn ji kpꞌkahn taame ntiil?<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Ano wo fvfo nobo re wahn kꞌjo sahb sꞌseb nsol nyi ḿ bahke jo li, fere jo wo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 6:6-9</char></note> Kana jo tiiri! <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Tibre ane baka baka ba ki nyi Esowo ba kpo lim ano. Nso ejahne kpꞌkahne re, ń kpꞌsebe nsol nyia. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ga nob re wahn gbo mbang seb etul bi Esowo. Nsol nyehko kpee á bahk-n budu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 3:2</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afang nya ejahbetul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Kana kpe fahl, wahn mmoblong ejoro! Tibre koro Nso ejahne re wahn tob ji go eti etul eje.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:29-30</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />“Gungen nsol nyi ń kpi no, wahn rod akpohko ka akpak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 18:22</char></note> Belen abon abam akpohko ba lꞌkꞌtiki kul, wahn fere gbo afang nya ejahbetul Esowo, nya lꞌki-n mal go abo, nya li edi ji nwajv anyehng anyehng lꞌkꞌma rehng, etan lꞌkꞌma wo. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Tibre edi ji nsol afang enya li no, owo eltim ena bahke jolo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 3:20</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alokeltum ba kpꞌsiki nde ebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Tooben ebjing, wahn gbaange agbaange go egahne ebun!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:13</char></note> Taben av atꞌrekahng enyahne wahre!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 25:1-13</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Jolen ana ane ba kpꞌsiki nde ebo re á kehnge elkak elbal ba, eji á lꞌfeere ba kahd, bo lꞌlennge ka-e.<verse eid="LUK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />“Elfuulu li ka alokeltum ba lꞌkꞌlal ngare nyi nde ebo bahke bake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:3</char></note> Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, á bahke tongo bo re bo ji ekpꞌkuru nsol alehke. Á bahke gbaange egbaange eje, fere jo loko bo. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Á li ma ba nlum atv. Á li ma ba nkpese efungfu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:38">“Elfuulu li ka alokeltum bao ba, á lꞌba nyehn bo, bo ma toobo ebjing. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Jia ji nobo re wahn kahn. Tibre nfontahk kahne kahn ngare nyi nwajv kpꞌbake, kehn á jol baabe etahk eje, kꞌtaame nwajv lahm etahk eje yel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 5:2</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />“Wahn fvfo, tooben ebjing, tibre Mmon no nne bahke bake ngare nyi ń kil tiri re á kpꞌbake.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkakesehk a nlokeltum, a ebi nlokeltum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Pita kehm-e bahbe re, “Ntul, elgan nia, a tubu tong wahra, afi nne awohng awohng?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Owo Ntul a Jisos kehm faange re, “Li ka ekahnkahn nlokeltum no kpi ekakesehk, no nde bahke yake alokeltum bako, kak go ege ebo re á jo le bo ngare.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 5:2-4; Elt 20:28</char></note> Nne awo li elkohn nlokeltum ana noa? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Eyebatahng bahke jolo a nlokeltum noo, no nde lꞌba, á bahke ba kpir-e, á kpꞌlimi ano. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, á bahke yake nsol enye kpee kak-e go ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 25:21</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />“Nlokeltum noo lꞌfere bung go ege eltim re, ‘Nsoo eblaange elbake,’ á lꞌbom alokeltum bako go eldohko, fere jo li, jo wo, fere jo buumu, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />owo nde nlokeltum noo bahke bake efung bi á kil ekpu kunu re á bahke bake, ngare nyi á kil elkahne. Nde noo bahk-e boomo, kiimi akv akv akv, fere tuur-e eltuuru nꞌnehm ana ni á bahke tuuru ane ba ki taame tv-e.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Nlokeltum no kahne ji nde sebe re á lim, kꞌtoobo ebjing, fere lim, bo bahk-e sahb dꞌdv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 4:17; Jon 9:41</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />“Nlokeltum no ki kahn ji nde sebe re á lim, á lꞌfere lim nsol nyi fuumu re bo dv-e, ye, bo we nehm ga dv.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:48">“Nne awohng awohng no bo m-e ka nsol gbalee, bo bahke sebe nsol gbalee go ege abo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:7</char></note> Nne no bo ma yake nsol gbalee kak-e go ebo, ye wo, bo bahke koko gbalee go ege.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 25:20,22</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos kpo lim ane yab</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“M ba re me m ba kono agun go njini. Kor-m kor re, kehn agun nyao bom ellulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 2:3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ewohngalahb jia, ji m bahke tohko bel, ji ji ma-m gba area. Bahke jolo anaana tete mal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:27</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Anv, ń kpꞌtiri re, eji m ba njini nyia, n ko elkoono ba a nia? N kp-n tongo re, elkoono sang wahnge m ba no. M ba, eji ane lꞌyab.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:18; Jon 7:43; 9:16</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Bomo anv asongo ane alon lꞌjol nlaaga anyehng, abal bahke yabe jol ebo ebo, ane ara bako jol ebo ebo. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Nde nne bahke woomo njahm nyehko, mmon ewe woomo njahm nyehka. Nnyehn nne bahke woomo njahm nyehko, mmon ewe woomo njahm nyehka. Nnyehn nne bahke woomo njahm nyehko, nkal a mmon woomo njahm nyehka.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana nne bahke kahne ngare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Jisos kehm tob bung tong ellong ane bao re, “Ń lꞌnyehn ekparesemsem ma tahl go erede nfam kpꞌbake, ń kpo bung tvtv re, ‘Elahb yahke ba elnake.’ Lohko na fvfo. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Nfeb lꞌkehme ellimi nyi lohng go elka emahng, ń kpo bung re, ‘Ewannge yahke ba.’ Lohko ba fvfo.<verse eid="LUK 12:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />“Wahn aneb alum abal abal ba! Ń kpo mal seenge elbung abola ndi, fere kahn ana ji bahke jolo. Jen ji wahnge ń lꞌkꞌma kahn ngare nyi li anv?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:42,44; Elt 17:30; 1 Tes 5:1; 1 Jon 2:18</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Jen ji wahnge wahnfono antahng kil ebtiki kahn ji kpꞌnobo? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Nnekv ewa lꞌfere ko-a, tahm a na go esub, nok, eji a lꞌtoobo a ne ngare nyi ń kpeke li go mbang, eji á lꞌki-a tohng, tahm a na goji nlamalam, nlamalam faak-a, kak mbehresi go ebo, mbehresi ko-a song kak ngbekobo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />N kpa tongo re, a nehm tiki lohng ona, tete a gohro gal mbong enya kpee mal, jol ederi ajehng ajehng nehm sa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:25-26; 18:34; 2 Tes 1:9</char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yaangen mbang enyahne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ngare nyio ane jolo o, ba tongo Jisos bade ana Pailet wulu aneb Galili, eji bo jo lim njom ka Esowo.<verse eid="LUK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Anv, ń kpꞌtiri re, anebe Galili bao ba ga jol aneb abiafem sehnge anebe Galili bako kpeea, tib eji bo nyehne erem bioa?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:28; Jon 9:2</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Eꞌee! N kp-n tongo re, ń tohko yaange mbang enyahne, ḿ bahke tob kpo kpee ana ane bao.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:14</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />“Anv, elku ane ara ba kpo go Siloam, eji enyong gbo bulu bo mee? Anv, ń kpꞌtiri re, bo ba ga jol abi ane sehnge ane bako kpee ba lene go Jerusalema? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Eꞌee! N kp-n tongo re, ń tohko yaange mbang enyahne, ḿ bahke tob kpo kpee ana ane bao.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bade eti ji ki kab akab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Jisos kehm tubu bo elgan nia re, “Nne awohng bele eti ji bo kpo lung re efig go ege etahngga. Á kehm bake ba seb akab. Á tingem nkab anyehng anyehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 21:19</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Owo á kehm tongo nne no jo lim eltum go etahngga jio re, ‘Nyehnee, nnya era nyia, nyi n kpo ba, ba kpur akab go eti jia, jol n ka tiki bel. Gbahk eti jia tub, tibre yim na yim a mbol mbol.’<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />“Owo á kehm-e faange re, ‘Nsoo, nong tohko kpe jol elya nia ni ni. M bahke kpake kpee sennge, fere kak akpake elu, a ajele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 3:9</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Owo e bahke nyehne, joare bahke kabe akab. Tohko fere kab, wo kehm gbahke tub.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 21:24; Rom 11:25; Mat 24:32</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nnenkal, á nob efung Esabat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Efung Esabat abehng Jisos jo tibi go etahk ero ajehng. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Nnenkal awohng jolo o, no bele ebi etohko ji bum-e eyam, bi ma kang elku a nnya era. Nnenkal noo fehde na fehd, á joom kpe ma tanne etannetanne.<verse eid="LUK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Eji Jisos nyehn-e no, á kehm-e lungu tv elne, kehm-e tongo re, “Nnenkal, ngubjing enya ebfannge!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Jisos kehm-e kunu abo, nnenkal noo soro tanne tvtv, fere jo tehk Esowo.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ntubesi etahk ero noo, atahng kehm-e rake, tib eji Jisos ma lim nne, á ma nob efung Esabat. Á kehm kehme ane tong re, “Li nfung erakera nyi ane bahke jo lim eltum. Jo baan afung nyao, wahn jo ba nob ayam enyahne, go efung Esabat sang.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Owo Ntul a Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Wahn aneb alum abal abal ba! Wahn ane kpee, wahn sang kpo fannge efong ebahne, a ebvankang ebahne go ntahk nyi bo kpo wooma, tahm a bo go alahb efung Esabata?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 14:5</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Nyehnen nnenkal noa no li mmon no Ebraham, no nnehm gba-e no go elku a nnya era. Nobem re á for go eyam bia efung Esabata?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 3:4; Kol 2:16</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Alum nya Jisos faange no kehm riki anebekv ebe ndon, bo ane kpee.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:17">Wo, ellong ane bako kpee jo bele na eyebatahng tib go agburu nsol nya á ma lim.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bada mmohk asia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mak 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Owo Jisos kehm bungu re, “Anv, etul bi Esowo li renan? M bahke koko gara jen? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Li ana mmohk asia nyi nne rodo, song bahm go ege etahngga. Kehm gbale egburu elrahn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:24</char></note> Nruk kehm bake, ba si ntahk ebo ona.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:4; Elt 20:29-30</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bade ayist</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Jisos kehm kpe bung re, “Anv, m bahke koko etul bi Esowo gara jen? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Li ana ayist,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 16:6,12</char></note> nya nnenkal ko song behr go ebam aflawa na ebra, tete semme kpee,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 2:18--3:6</char></note> fere tung.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nfiidifiida mbutahk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Eji Jisos jo tahm go Jeusalem, á jo sehnge go ajahbe ajahbe, fere jo tib ane.<verse eid="LUK 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Nne awohng kehm-e bahbe re, “Nsoo, anv, abon amohk ane abik abik ba bahke bele eltahra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Jo noken, eji ń lꞌsehng go nfiidifiida mbutahk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 3:12; Jon 10:7</char></note> Tibre n kp-n tongo re, ane gbalee bahke gare re bo sehng yel, bo nehm ma sehng.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />“Nfontahk lꞌsi mꞌmehl, bam mbu, ḿ bahke yiimi go mbutahk, jo kahd, fere jo bung re, ‘Nsoo, lenng-r mbu!’ Owo á bahk-n kehm faange re, ‘N nehme kahn edi ji ń lohng no ba.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 25:11-12</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />“Owo ḿ bahke kehme elbungu re, ‘E jo li nsol a na, fere jo wo. A jo tibi go egahre ejahbe.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:39</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />“Á bahke bungu re, ‘N kp-n tongo re, N nehme kan edi ji ń lohng no ba. Wahn abi ane baa, tahm-m wahn go esamahr!’<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />“Go elatahk wo ḿ bahke jo ling, fere jo kono amahn go esi, ń lꞌnyehn Ebraham, Aisik, Jekob, a abanyehnamahr kpee go ejahbetul Esowo, wahnfono antahng fere sa elatahk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 8:11-12</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Ane bahke lohngo go ejang njini abehng abehng ba ji, jo li nsol go ejahbetul Esowo.<verse eid="LUK 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />“Egom jindiki ji kahle njahm bahke fere gbo mbang. Egom jindiki ji gbo mbang fere kahle njahm.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 11:25-26</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jeusalem jo kor Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Ngare nyꞌnehm ona aneb Farisi bandiki kehm ba kpiri Jisos, kehm-e tongo re, “Lohng a, song! Tibre Herod kpꞌsebe re á wul-a.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 3:6; Luk 12:1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Songen, wahn song tong ekpangang jio re, ‘N kpꞌkame ane abi atohko yehke, fere lim ane, bo nob ayam ebo. N kpꞌlimi lela, lim behna, lꞌbiingi nfung era, n gohro lim mal.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:4; 2 Tim 4:7</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />M bahke tahme eljen ename asongo lela tete rehng behna, a etoono efung behko. Tibre nnyehnamahr, bo bahk-e tiki wul go Jeusalem, edi jindiki sang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 2:14-15</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="A hen sitting on the chicks" file="lb00061c.tif" size="col" loc="Luk 13:34" ref="13:34">Ana nkok kpo walle abon</figure>“Wahn Jeusalem, ń kpo wul abanyehnamahr, fere tuubu ane ba Esowo tumu tv-n atal. Nkpel tvv n jo gare re me n lung-n tv elname ana nkok abon kpo lung abon ebe, fere walle bo. Wahn korem elbake!<verse eid="LUK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />“Anv, etahk ejahne bahke sake nehme nehme.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 21:20-24</char></note> Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, me ń nehm kpe tiki nyehn tete ḿ bung re, ‘Elfuulu li a nne no kpꞌbake go mbing nyi Ntul.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nne eyam, á nob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Efung Esabat abehng Jisos kehm tahme song li nsol go etahk ntubesi a nne a Farisi awohng. Owo bo jo baab-e.<verse eid="LUK 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Nne awohng no gbo eyam ebyeenge kehm bake goji Jisos.<verse eid="LUK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Owo Jisos kehm bahbe atꞌtibi ba atahm, a Bab Farisi re, “Anv, ntahm enyahre tꞌtaame re nne jo lim ane, bo nob efung Esabata, afi?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 3:4; Gal 5:22-23</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Bo kehm belle.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:4">Owo Jisos kehm rodo nne eyam noo, lim-e, á nob, fere yak-e, á song. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Anv, nne awo ewahne no mmon ewe, afi nfong enye bahke gboko yel elbing alahb ni kpꞌrahbe, á kꞌsong yehk-e efung Esabata?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12:11; Luk 13:15</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Jol bo we maam faange ejumjum.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alum nya Jisos bungu tong ane ba bo tob tiingi bo elkak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Jisos nyehne kan ana ane ba bo tob tiingi bo elkak fvfo ma song yehke adi nji nya li wahre wahre,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:6</char></note> owo á kehm tubu bo elgan re, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Nne lꞌtiing-a elkak elbal, ka song ji edi nji ji li wahre wahre. Fundiki nne no ga gbal sehnge wo, nfono elkak tꞌtob tiing-e fvfo. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Lꞌjol ano, nne no tiingi wahn ane abal abal bahke bake, ba tong-a re, ‘Tahm ka nne noa, á ji!’ Ndon bahk-a kehme elfili re wo fere song ji go nredereda nji.<verse eid="LUK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />“Bo lꞌtiing-a elkak, song ji go nredereda nji, eji nfono elkak lꞌba, á bahke ba tong-a re, ‘Mbi, mehl, wo ba ji ga nwahrewahra nji.’ Owo a bahke bele ellub go esamahr ane kpee ba jehk a na go ekpꞌkuru jio.<verse eid="LUK 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />“Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌrod elne bum wahre wahre, bo bahk-e rede na. Nne no lꞌrede elne, bo bahk-e rodo, bum wahre wahre.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 18:14; Fil 2:8-9</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alum nya Jisos tongo nne no tiing-e no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Owo Jisos kehm tob bung a nne no tiing-e no re, “A lꞌtiingi ane re bo ba li nsol, afi jolo elkak, ka jo tiingi ate eba, jol abonane, jol nnahb enya, a aneb nkontahk eba ba li afang ane. Tibre bo fvfo bo bahk-a tob tiingi. A lꞌlim ano, wobbel eltuuru ena tvtv go ejum ji a limi no. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ga nob re a lꞌtiingi ane elkak, wo jo tiingi akpak, a abanne, a awakamahr. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />A bahke bele elfuulu, tibre bo nehm ma tob lim ka-a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 6:34-35</char></note> Esowo bi bahke limi ka-a efung bio bi atingi ane bahke nyahme go elkv.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:29</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bade egburu elkak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Eji nne awohng no woomo go ellong ane ba tob ji ekpꞌkuru jio a Jisos wuku ano, owo á kehm-e tongo re,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:15">“Elfuulu li ka nne no bahke lehke nsol go ejahbetul Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 22:2</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Nne awohng jolo go, no limi egburu elkak, tiingi ane gbalee. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Eji afung elkak ma rehng, á kehm tumu nlokeltum ewe re á song tong ane ba á tiingi bo re bo ba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:36; 7:37</char></note> Tibre bobtoobo ejum ajehng ajehng bum.<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />“Bo ane kpee kehm kehme ellaange kunu go nsol. Ngbokambang a nne kehm tongo nlokeltum noo re, ‘N gunu nfong ewubu, n yahke tahm song wuungu bo. Lub wuk ana n kp-a gboongo titi.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Owo nne noko kehm kpe bung re, ‘N gunu edi egbe. M bahke tahme song nyehn. Lub wuk ana n kp-a gboongo titi.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Nne noko kehm tob kpe bung re, ‘Me n ko nkal, owo wahnge n lꞌkꞌma ba.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 4:19</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Nlokeltum noo kehm feere song tong nde.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:21">“Nfono elkak noo, atahng kehm-e rake. Á kehm tongo nlokeltum ewe re, ‘Foomo song go afak ejahbe, wo song ko akpak, fere ko abanne, a awakamahr ba a bo.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:11-12</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />“Eji nlokeltum noo je feere, á kehm ba tong nde re, ‘Nsoo, ana a bungu no, me n lim. Eyake jia, kpeke li, ji ane bahke kpe ji.’<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />“Nde kehm tongo nlokeltum noo re, ‘Song go abang ebud, a abang ekulugbe, wo jo fanne ane, eji bo lꞌba, ba yel, ane lꞌrur go egame ekpꞌkpa.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Tibre n kp-n tongo re, Nne awohng awohng go ellong ane ba bo tiingi bo nehm tiki li elkak ename.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 13:28</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne awo li etingitingi ntꞌtoona Jisos?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Ellong ane gbalee jo jene a Jisos. Owo á kehm keebe, kehm tongo bo re, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Nne awohng awohng no lꞌba go egame, á nehm ma jol ntꞌtoono ewame, tohko jol re á ko nde ekv, a nnyehn, a nkal ewe, a abon ebe, a abonanyehn, a elkpin ene fvfo. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Nne no tohko sol ekros eje, tahm toon-m, á nehm ma jol ntꞌtoono ewame. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Nne awohng ewahne lꞌseb re á si enyong, á bahke tohko gbo mbang ji, gabe ana bahk-e kimi ekun, joare akpohko enye bahk-e biingi, á si kpee mal. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Á tohko lim ano, fundiki á bahke bumu nnahb ekahme nyi nyi, á nehm kpe ma soro asi. Ane kpee ba lꞌnyehn, bo bahk-e kehme elnyoko re, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />‘Nne noa ana bomo etahk go elsehke, á kpeem ma gohro si mal.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:20-21; 10:22; 1 Kor 1:8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Ntul no kpi nsoja atahltahl nkpel eltahl, no yahke tahm re á song nok ebta a ntul noko no kpꞌbake re á ba nok a ne, no kpi nsoja atahltahl nkpel atahl abal, á bahke tohko gbo mbang ji kpee, toobo, joare á li ma yiimi, nok a ntul noko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 2:16; 19:11-16</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Joare á nehm ma yiimi a ne, á bahke tumu ane tv ntul noko, eji á kpeke li go fee re bo song bahb-e ji á bahk-e kake, bo kehm koono.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 3:13; Mat 5:25</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />“Ano wo fvfo, nne awohng awohng ewahne no tohko yake ejum ajehng ajehng ji á kpi no, á lꞌkꞌma jol ntꞌtoono ewame.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Akang kpꞌyebe. Elyebe akang lꞌlohng, a bahke limi renan, akang kehm kpe yebe?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:13; Mak 9:50</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Jol nehm nob ka ndi, jol nehm nob re nne ko kak go abangenahb nti. Ane kpo sale na elkohn akang nio wohng go. Nne no kpi atung, nong, á wuk.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Njoro nyi tane no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Abakokatak, a aneb abiafem jo jeere kohlo Jisos, eji bo lꞌjo wuk-e.<verse eid="LUK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bab Farisi, a atꞌtibi ba atahm jo memme re, “Nne noa kpo ko aneb abiafem, fere jo li nsol a bo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 5:30-32</char></note><verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Owo wahnge Jisos kehm tubu bo elgan re, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Anv, nne ewahne awohng lꞌbel ejoro atahl alon, anyehng lꞌtan, á nehm tahm ejoro behko sa go elka emahng, song seb nyi tane no tete á nyehn-ea?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:10</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Á lꞌnyehn-e, á bahk-e rodo, kunu go ebahk, fere jo geere.<verse eid="LUK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />“Á lꞌba rehng etahk, á bahke lungu ate ebe, a aneb nkontahk ebe, fere tong bo re, ‘Tob-m wahn elgeere, tibre me n nyehn njoro enyame nyi tane no.’<verse eid="LUK 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />“N kp-n tongo re, Eyebatahng bahke ga gbal go ejahbetul Esowo, nne abiafem awohng lꞌgbo ndon,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:8</char></note> sehnge atingitingi ane gbalee ba kil sebe re bo gbo ndon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:9; 21:32</char></note><verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsiring nyi tane no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Li re nnenkal kpi nsiring ewubu, anyehng kehm ba tan-e, anv, á nehm nyaale etꞌrekahng, fere feenge ekpꞌkpa, jo seb bem bem bem tete á nyehna?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:10; Ell 3:1-2; Hib 3:13</char></note><verse eid="LUK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />“Á lꞌnyehn, á bahke lungu ate ebe, a aneb nkontahk ebe, tong bo re, ‘Ba tob-m wahn elgeere, tibre me n fere nyehn nsiring nyi tan-m no.’<verse eid="LUK 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />“N kp-n tongo re, Ano wo fvfo enjel nyi Esowo kpo bel eyebatahng, nne abiafem awohng lꞌgbo ndon.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 3:10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmon elwur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Owo Jisos kehm bungu re, “Nne awohng jolo go, no bele abon ba nlum na abal. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Nkalla kehm tongo nde re, ‘Nsoo, ka-m ejang nsol nyi bahke jolo nyꞌnyame.’ Owo nde noo kehm bake abon ebe na abal nsol enye.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />“Gaam kang, mmonkalla noo kehm kpuku nsol kpee nyi á bele no, tahm go nlaabambang ejahbe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 21:18</char></note> Owo á song li akpohko enye go mbang elwur kpee mal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 6:19</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Eji á ma fad akpohko enye kpee mal, owo njal kehm bake go ejahbe jio, jol nyi nse sang. Á kehm sake abo abo.<verse eid="LUK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />“Á kehm tahme, song wu laake nfono ejahbe awohng. Á kehm-e tumu re á song, jo song baabe akuk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:20-21</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Jol-e koro re, á jo li nsol nyi akuk kpo li. Jol nnene jolem no jo ka-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 2:2</char></note><verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />“Eji á ma fere gbo ntir, owo á kehm bungu re, ‘Ane kpee ba nsoo kpo lak bo eltum, bo kpi nsol alehke gbalee, jol sehnge ana nyi bo kpꞌsebe. Wo, me n jehk ana, kpꞌkpoko njal. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />M bahke tahme, song kpiri nsoo, fere tong-e re, Nsoo, me n lim abiafem bade Esowo, fere tob lim bada na.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 7:10</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Me n kpeem fuumu re bo jo lung-m re mmon ewa. Tob lak-m, me n tob jol nlimeltum ewa.’<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />“Owo á kehm mehle, feere goji nde. Jol á gaam kabbe go etahk nde, nde kehm-e nyehne. Ndon kehm-e fili, á kehm beke, song bing-e, fere sod-e nnyo.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />“Owo mmon noo kehm-e tongo re, ‘Nsoo, me n lim abiafem bade Esowo, fere lim bada na. N kpeem fuumu re bo jo lung-m re mmon ewa.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />“Nde kehm lungu alokeltum ebe, kehm tongo bo re, ‘Song koon ekpawobo ji nno a nno ba a ji, wahn ba kak-e. Tob kaken ye ebil go ebo, wahn fere kak-e akpaketa go akpade. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Song koon mmon a nfong no sahb jꞌjok, wahn ba wul, wahr limen elkak, fere bel eyebatahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 3:20</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Tibre mmon ewame noa kpꞌkpo, wo anv, yebfere jol go elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:4-5</char></note> Á tꞌtan. Anv a, m m-e nyehn.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:24">“Owo bo kehm soro bom elkak nio go ellimi.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Ngbokambang a mmon jolo go egbe. Eji á jo kehnge abake, ba kabbe go nkpe etahk, á kehm wuku ase nya bo jo kub, fere jo bahn. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Á kehm lungu nlokeltum awohng, kehm-e bahbe re, ‘Ase nyao lohngo rejen?’<verse eid="LUK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />“Owo á kehm-e faange re, ‘Mmonanne wo ma feere kehnge. Nso ma wul mmon a nfong no joko jok. Tibre yebfere bel mmon ewe nob nob. Ejumjum we limem.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Eji á ma wuk ano, atahng kehm-e rake. Á kehm tene elyele go ekpꞌkpa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 15:2</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:28">“Owo nde kehm lohngo ba gboong-e.<verse eid="LUK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />“Á kehm faange nde re, ‘Nnya tvv nyi m ma-a loko. Ngare anyehng anyehng n kpo lim ajehng ajehng ji a tong-m no. Jol me, a ka kꞌka mbul re me n ko lim elkak ka ate ebame. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Wo anv, eji mmon ewa noa ma ba, no ma rannge akpohko enya eji á jo noongo abajenasꞌsa, ye wo, a ma wul mmon a nfong no joko jok ka-e.’<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />“Owo nde kehm-e faange re, ‘Mmon ewame, wo li a name ngare anyehng anyehng. Nsol kpee nyi li nyꞌnyame, tob li nyꞌnya fvfo. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Fꞌfuumu re wahr lim elkak, fere bel eyebatahng. Tibre mmonanne noa kpꞌkpo, anv, yebfere jol go elkpin. Á tꞌtan, anv a, m m-e nyehn.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Nkimfahnga nlokeltum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Jisos kehm kpe bung tong abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Efange nne ajehng jolo gona, ji bele nlokeltum. Ane kehm song tong-e re, nlokeltum noo kpꞌfade akpohko enye.<verse eid="LUK 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />“Owo nde noo kehm-e lungu, kehm-e bahbe re, ‘Jen ji wahnge n kpꞌwuku nsol ana nyia bada na? Ko awer ba a nya, nya a kpo nyon nsol enyame nyi n yake kak-a go ebo. Tibre a nehm kpe tiki jol nlokeltum ewame.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />“Owo nlokeltum noo kehm bungu go ege eltim re, ‘Anv, m bahke limi renan, eji nsoo yahk-m yehke go egame eltum? Eko n gaam kpi, ji m bahke jo bahm egbe. Ndon kp-m fili re me n jo gboongo na nsol. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Anv, me n kahn ji m bahke limi, eji n lꞌbel ane ba bahk-m koko, n lene tob bo ngare nyi nsoo ma-m yehke go eltum.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Owo á kehm lungu ane kpee, ba bele nde abong, kehm tongo ngbokambang re, ‘A kpi nsoo mbong rejen?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Á kehm faange re, ‘Nsang akehng atahl alon.’ Nlokeltum noo kehm-e tongo re, ‘Rod nwer a mbong enya, wo ji elwaare, nyon nsang atahl abal a nsang ewubu.’<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />“Owo á kehm bahbe noko re, ‘Anv, wo, mbong enya li rejen?’ Á kehm-e faange re, ‘Ebam nkohl atahl alon.’ Nlokeltum noo kehm-e tongo re, ‘Rod nwer a mbong enya, wo nyon ebam atahl ani.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Owo nde kehm tehke nkimfahnga nlokeltum ewe noo, tib go elwake ni á ma wake. Tibre abon ba njini nyia ba kpꞌgaka wake go bo a ntum sehnge abon ba ellennge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:15-17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />“N kp-n tongo re, Roden afang nya ki li nyanyahne, wahn ko lim etem, eji afang lꞌmal, bo lꞌko-n kak go ntahk nyi li go njinanjini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 14:14; Mat 6:20; 19:21</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Nne no lꞌbel ekakesehk go mmojum no nse, á tob kpi ekakesehk go egburu ejum. Nne no kil ma lim mmojum no nse go etingitingi, á kpehme ma tob lim egburu ejum go etingitingi.<verse eid="LUK 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />“Eji ń ki ma lim nsol nyi njini nyia go ekakesehk, bahke limi renan, bo kehm yake atingitingi afang kak-n go egahne abo? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Eji ń ki bel ekakesehk go nsol nyi ki li nyꞌnyahne, nne awo me, no bahk-n kake ji bahke jolo jꞌjahne?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:16-17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Nlokeltum awohng awohng limm, no bahke ma loko nde na ebal. Noko, á bahk-e koko ekv, noko jo kor-e. Tohko jol ano á bahke lake nde noko, fere jo daange noko. Ń nehm ma loko Esowo, fere jo loko akpohko.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ajoobo alum nya Jisos bungu no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mak 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Eji Bab Farisi wuku nsol nyio, bo kehm-e kehme elnyoko, tibre akpohko jo koro bo sehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:14</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Wahn li ane ba kpo tib elnahne go esamahr ane re, wahn li atingitingi ane. Wo, Esowo kpꞌkahne ntim enyahne. Tibre nsol nyi ane kpo tehk, nyi nyi li nsol eltehb go esamahr Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 1:27-29</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Atahm nya Moses, a alum nya abanyehnamahr nyono no jolo ka ngare nyio nyi mahne mahne tete ba rehng ngare nyi Jon ji nwohngalahb. Bomo ngare nyio, owo bo kehme eltiingi nnoobo etib bi li bade etul bi Esowo. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌlim go nsahm, á bahke ma kuumu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 15:21-28; Luk 18:3-8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />“Elbung abola ndi tohkem rꞌriidi re tan. Jol nrꞌrohka ntahm anyehng anyehng nehm tiki range.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 13:31</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Nne awohng awohng no lꞌten nkal ewe, fere ko noko, yeblim erehbe. Nne no lꞌbaange nnenkal no nlum ewe m-e yehke elbal, eblim erehbe.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efange nne, a Lasaros</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Efange nne ajehng jolo gona, ji jo liibi nsol nyi jo sahb kꞌkim ekun, fere jo lim egburu elkak efung abehng abehng.<verse eid="LUK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />“Nne awohng tob jolo ona, no bo jo lung-e re Lasaros, ji jolo nkpak. Ngubjing enye jolo alok alok. Á jo kono eljehke go mbutahk efange nne jio. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Á jo sebe re á jo kpiimi akahb elang li, nya jo fooro ekpꞌkuru efange nne jio gbo, eji á lꞌwohngo. Ebv jo lohngo ba lahb-e alok. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Toono o nkpak nyio ba kpo. Babenjel kehm ba sol-e, song bum-e, á ji kohlo Ebraham.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:22">“Efange nne jio kehm tob kpo. Bo kpa-e kak. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Eji á woomo go ellulagun, jo nyehn erem, á kehm tabe esamahr ebe, kehm nyehne Ebraham go fee, fere nyehn Lasaros jehk kohl-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 25:42,45-46; Hib 9:27</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Owo á kehm rabe re, ‘Nso Ebraham, nong, me n fil-a ndon! Lub tum Lasaros, á song behde ebnyohkobo ebe go alahb, ba behd-m go ebliki, eji ebliki ebame lꞌlub naang-m. Tibre n kpꞌnyehne erem sehng go agun nyaa.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 20:10; 21:8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Owo Ebraham kehm-e faange re, ‘Mmon ewame, buumu re, ngare nyi a jolo go elkpin, a bele anoobo nsol, Lasaros bele asabsab nsol. Wo anv, bo m-e kak eltim, wo noa, kpi erem nyehn. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Wo gana, elka elka ni wahr a nahne, egburu edamme jia, ji nnene lꞌkꞌma sehng ga egahre, ba rehng go egahne, fvfo ji nnene lꞌkꞌtob ma sehng go egahne, ba rehng ga egahre.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />“Owo efange nne jio kehm bungu re, ‘Nsoo, n kp-a gboongo re, wo lub tum Lasaros tv go etahk nsoo, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />eji á lꞌsong rehke abonanee. Tibre n kpi abonanee na alon, tohko jol ano, bo bahke tob ba, ba nyehn erem ebnohko edi jia.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Owo Ebraham kehm faange re, ‘Bo kpi awer nya Moses, a nya abanyehnamahr, nong, bo jo wuk.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:46</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />“Efange nne jio kehm tene re, ‘Eꞌee nso Ebraham, nne lꞌlohng akvne, fere song kpiri bo, bo bahke gboko ndon.’<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />“Ebraham kehm-e tongo re, ‘Bo tohko fere wuk alum nya Moses, a nya anyehnamahr, afi nne nyahme na go elkv, bo nehm taame.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:44-46; Mat 28:11-14</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Bade abiafem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mak 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Jisos kehm bungu tong abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Nsol nyi kpo lim nne gbo yel abiafem bahke tiki ba. Eyuu a nne no bahke wahnge re ba! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ga nob re bo kahn-e eltal go emel, tub-e kak alahb, sehnge re á lim mmonse awohng go ellong abonse baa, á gbo yel abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 14:21</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />“Jo gberen elnahne!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Mmonanne lꞌlim abiafem, jo rehk-e. Á lꞌgbo ndon, tahm ka-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 18:15-17</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Á lꞌsood-a nkpel esehma efung abehng, fere ba gboong-a nkpel esehma re, ‘Ndon ma-m fili!’ tahm ka-e.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bade eltaame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Owo abatiingetib kehm tongo Ntul a Jisos re, “Lim eltaame enahre gbal!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 8:10; 15:28</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Ntul a Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Li re ń kpi eltaame ni se ana mmohk asia, kehn ń li ma bung tong etaamenti bia re, ‘Mehl, wo song yiimi go aya!’ kehn bahk-n wuku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:4</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ji li ka nlokeltum re á lim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Li re nne awohng ewahne kpi nlokeltum no kpo bahm egbe, tohko jol ano á kpo baabe ebul. Á lꞌkehnge egbe ba, nde kpo tong-e tong rea, ‘Ba elwaare, wo ba ji ekpꞌkuru li nsola?’<verse eid="LUK 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />“Eꞌee! Á bahk-e tongo na re, ‘Song lam nsol ka-m, wo fere toobo ebjing bi a bahk-m loko ngare nyi n kpi nsol li. N lꞌli mal, wo kehm tob li.’<verse eid="LUK 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />“Anv, á bahke kake nlokeltum ewe nnyo go nsol nyi á tong-e re á lima?<verse eid="LUK 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />“Wahn fvfo, ń lꞌlim nsol kpee nyi bo tong-n re wahn lim, jo bungen re, ‘Wahr alokeltum baka baka ba. Wahr eblim ji li ka-r re wahr lim.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 9:16</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi aneb abili na awubu, bo nob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Eji Jisos je go Jeusalem, á sehnge go Samaria, a Galili.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:51; 13:22</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Eji á rehnge go ejahbe ajehng, aneb abili na awubu kehm ba wan-e. Bo yiimi go fee, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />kehm rabe re, “Jisos nso ejahre, nong, wahr fil-a ndon!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Eji Jisos nyehne bo, á kehm tongo bo re, “Songen, wahn song kpiri abalimajom, fere tib bo elnahne.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Eji bo jo jen asongo, bo kehme elnobo.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Nne awohng go bo ellong, eji á nyehne re yeblohko nob, á kehm feere abake, jo tehk Esowo wahre wahre, <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />kehm ba gbo go alata nya Jisos, kehm-e kake saam. Nne noo jolo nne a Samaria.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:9,39-41</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Owo Jisos kehm bungu re, “Anv, ane awubu sang nobo noa? Ane asehmwubu bako bana? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Nnene feerem ba re á ba tehk Esowoa, sehngem njenne nyia nyi nyi feere noa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 3:17; Ell 15:3-4</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Owo á kehm-e tongo re, “Mehl, wo song, eltaame ena eblim, wobnob.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elbake ni etul bi Esowo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Egom Farisi jindiki kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Ngare anyi etul bi Esowo bahke bake!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:20">Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Etul bi Esowo nehm ba go mbang nyi ane bahke nyehne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 18:36</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Nne awohng awohng limm, no bahke bungu re, ‘Nyehn, bi gana!’ Jol, ‘Nyehn, bi gona!’ Tibre etul bi Esowo bia, wob-n go atahng.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Owo á kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Ngare kpꞌbake nyi ḿ bahke sebe re efung abehng bi Mmon no nne kpir-n, jol wahn nehm kpiri. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bo bahk-n jo tong re, ‘Nyehnen gona!’ Ane bako bahk-n jo tong re, ‘Nyehnen ga!’ Kana lohng je ona! Jol kana toono bo! <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Ana emangedu kpo lim, lennge go elbung, rehng ejang abehng abehng, ano wo fvfo Mmon no nne bahke jolo go ege efung. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Á bahke gboko mbang nyehn erem gbalee. Ane ba li anv bahk-e tene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:22</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />“Ana jolo ngare nyio nyi Noa, ano wo fvfo bahke tob jol afung nyao nya Mmon no nne. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Ngare nyio ane jo li, fere jo wꞌwo. Aneblum jo ko akal, anebkal jo bal alum, tete rehng efung bio bi Noa yele go egbang. Owo nnyel kehm yele, ba wul bo kpee.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />“Bahke jolo ana jolo ngare nyio nyi Lot. Bo jo li, fere jo wꞌwo, jo gunu, fere jo gꞌgungu, jo bahm ebgbe, fere jo si ntahk. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Efung bi Lot lohngo go Sodom, agun, a asalfa kehm kehme elnake go ejahbetul Esowo, ba wul bo kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 5:3</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />“Ano wo bahke tob jol fvfo efung bi bo bahke lennge Mmon no nne tib. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Efung bio, nne no lꞌkuumu go ege ero etahk, á lꞌbadde, á kꞌtohko kpe ji, yel go ege ekpꞌkpa, song rod nsol enye. Ano wo fvfo tob li ka nne no li go ege egbe, á nehm tohko kpe feere go ege etahk.<verse eid="LUK 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />“Buumen nkal a Lot! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌgare re á tahre elkpin ene, á bahke tane na elkpin ene. Nne no lꞌtane elkpin ene, á bahke tahre na elkpin ene.<verse eid="LUK 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />“N kp-n tongo re, atv mao ane abal bahke noongo go edilnong ajehng, noko, bo bahk-e rodo tahm a ne, noko sa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Anebkal abal bahke jo gok nsol, noko, bo bahk-e rodo tahm a ne, noko sa. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Aneblum abal bahke jolo go egbe, noko, bo bahk-e rodo tahm a ne, noko sa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Owo abatꞌtoono ebe kehm-e bahbe re, “Nsoo, gan wo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Edi ji ekpakv ejum li no, owo ntere kpo song rur.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:21; Ell 16:14-16; 19:17-21</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bada nkalebun, a nlamalam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Jisos kehm tubu bo elgan, eji á lꞌtib bo ana bo bahke jo kak ero ngare anyehng anyehng, kꞌjo yini ekpu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 4:2; 1 Tes 5:17</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Á bungu re, “Nlamalam awohng jolo go ejahbe ajehng, no ki jo fahl Esowo. Ane we joom lub.<verse eid="LUK 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />“Nkalebun awohng tob jolo ejahbe jio, no gbake jo je go ege, jo song tong-e re, ‘Lam elam ejame nob nob, ji n kpi a nnekv ewame.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 7:25-30</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />“Á kehm tene. Kpe kang kan a, á kehm fere bung go ege eltim re, ‘Jol eji n kil jo fꞌfahl Esowo, ane kil jo lub-m, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />tib eji nkalebun noa kp-m gbiingi sꞌsehng, m bahke lame elam eje nob nob, tohko jol ano á bahk-m gboro tib go elbake ni á kpo ba ngare anyehng anyehng.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 11:7-8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ntul a Jisos kehm bungu re, “Wuken ana ebi nlamalam noo bungu no. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Anv, Esowo nehm tob lam elam ji nno ka ane ba á yehke no, ba kpo gboong-e atv a njula? Anv, á bahke tohko laange, kehm kake bo eboa?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 10:13</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />N kp-n tongo re, á bahke lame elam ji nno elwaare ka bo. Anv, Mmon no nne lꞌba, á bahke nyehne ane ba kpꞌtaame go njini nyiaa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bada nne a Farisi, a nkokatak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Jisos tob tubu elgan nia, tong ane ba jo bum elbo re, bo ba li go etingitingi, fere jo daange ane bako.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 10:3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Á bungu re, “Ane abal je go etahk Esowo re bo song kak ero. Noko jolo nne a Farisi, noko jol nkokatak.<verse eid="LUK 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />“Nne a Farisi kehm yiimi eje eje, jo kak ero re, ‘O Esowo, m ma-a kak saam, tibre n limm ana ane ba kpo v ejv, ba kil jo lim nsol go etingitingi. N limm ana ane ba kpo lim erehbe. M ma-a kak saam, tibre n limm ana nkokatak noo ona. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />N kpo bade elname njal nkpel ebal go erahde. N kpo ka eltahme go ejum ajehng ajehng ji n lꞌbel.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:23</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Nkokatak yiimi eje go fee. Jol á tabem esamahr ebe, seenge go elbung. Á kohko na esi eje go ndi, kehm bungu re, ‘Esowo, nong, me n fil-a ndon, me nne abiafem wo.’<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />“N kp-n tongo re, Nkokatak noa wo li eno go esamahr Esowo, kehm kehnge go etahk, nne a Farisi sang. Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌmehl elne wahre, bo bahk-e rede na. Nne no lꞌrede elne, bo bahk-e mehle na wahre.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:8-9</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos fuulu abon ba nse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mak 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Ane bandiki kehm koko abon ba nse, ba goji Jisos re á kooro bo abo. Eji abatꞌtoono Jisos nyehne ano, bo kehm nyame bo. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Owo Jisos kehm lungu bo tv elne, kehm bungu re, “Nongen, abon ba nse jo ba ga egame. Kana jo sahde bo! Tibre etul bi Esowo li ka nkohn nyia.<verse eid="LUK 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />“Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, nne awohng awohng no tohko ko etul bi Esowo ana mmon no nse, á nehm tiki li.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 18:3</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efange nne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mak 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Ntubesi awohng kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Nnooba ntꞌtibi, m bahke limi renan, kehm bele elkpin ni li go njinanjini?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Jen ji wahnge a kehm-m lꞌlung re nnooba nne fono? Nnene limm, no li nnooba nne, sehngem Esowo ntahngtahng bi li nnooba nne. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />A kpꞌkahne atahm nya bungu re, ‘Ka jo lim erehbe! Ka jo wul nne! Ka jo v ejv! Ka jo yiimi ntianse efahnge! Jo kak nso, a nne!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Owo nne noo kehm faange re, “Atahm nyaa kpee m bomo elbumu ngare nyi n kpeke li ntiil.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Eji Jisos wuku ano, á kehm bungu re, “Ebsa ejum ajehng ji a bahke gohro lim. Song gungu nsol kpee nyi a kpi no, wo ko akpohko nyao song ka akpak, owo a bahke bele afang go ejahbetul Esowo, wo fere tahm toon-m.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 6:20</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Eji á wuku ano, á kehm kehme elguunu, tibre á fange sehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 6:9-10,17; Jems 2:5</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Jisos nyehne kan re á kpꞌguunu, á kehm bungu re, “Bahke riidi sehng re afang ane kehm lehke etul bi Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Re efange nne kehm yele ejahbetul Esowo, ekamel bahke sehnge go mbang a nga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Ane ba wuku no kehm bahbe re, “Anv, nne awo me, no bahke kehm bele eltahre?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Owo Jisos kehm faange re, “Ji nne kil ma lim, goji Esowo riidem.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Pita kehm bungu re, “Nyehn, ana e ma tahm ntahk enyahre sa, kp-a toono.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Nnene limm, no ma tahm etahk eje sa, jol nkal ewe, jol abonanyehn, jol babnde, a abon ebe tib go esi ji etul bi Esowo, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />no lꞌkꞌbel na gbalee budu eying jia ji anv, fere bel elkpin ni li go njinanjini eying ji kpꞌbake.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:30</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos gohro bung bade elkv ene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mak 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Owo Jisos kehm rodo abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal, tahm a bo go nkpohko, kehm song tong bo re, “Anv, e yahke tahm go Jeusalem. Go wo ejum ajehng ajehng ji abanyehnamahr Esowo nyono no bada Mmon no nne, bahke lohko lim ano go etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:51</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Tibre bo bahk-e yake, kak ane ba ki li Jus go ebo. Bo bahk-e nyoko, fere son-e, fere so atel wohng-e. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bo bahk-e dohko, fere wul-e. Lꞌkang nfung era, á nyahme go elkv.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:22,44; Jon 2:19-21</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Abatꞌtoono ebe wukem ejum ajehng ajehng ji á bungu no. Lenngem bo, tibre bo bꞌbehr bo alum nyao.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 9:32</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nwakamahr, á nyehn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mak 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Jisos kehm jene song kabbe go Jeriko. Nwakamahr anyehng ji o nkpe a mbang, jo gboongo nsol. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Eji á wuku ellong ane kpꞌsehnge, á kehm bahbe re, “Nenan ana?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bo kehm-e tongo re, “Jisos ji Nasaret wo kpꞌsehnge.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Owo á kehm soro rabe re, “Jisos mmon no Devid, nong, me n lub fil-a ndon!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Ane ba jolo esꞌsong kehm-e nyame re á rahke ewok. Á kehm kpe tuungu na, rabe wahre wahre re, “Mmon no Devid, nong, me n fil-a ndon!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 15:25</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Jisos kehm yiimi, kehm tongo bo re, bo ko-e ba. Eji á ba rehng kabbe Jisos, owo Jisos kehm-e bahbe re, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Anv, a kpꞌsebe re me n lim jen ka-a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Á kehm faange re, “Nsoo, n kpꞌsebe re me n lub nyehn.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Owo Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Fere jo nyehn anv! Eltaame ena ebwahng, wobnob.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 17:19</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Tvtv ona á kehm soro nyehn, fere tahm toon-e, jo ka Esowo ellub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 8:15</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:43">Eji ane bako kpee nyehne ano, bo kehm kehme Esowo tehk.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Jisos abola Sakeus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Jisos kehm rehnge go Jeriko, sehng asongo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Nne awohng jolo o, no bo jo lung-e re Sakeus. Á jolo ntubesi abakokatak, fere fꞌfang. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Á jo sebe re á nyehn ana Jisos li no. We á joom nyehn, tib ellong ane gbale o sehng, ga fvfo á jolo nkpehrekahba nne. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Owo á kehm beke, gbo bo mbang, song wahr ekuntaake, eji á lꞌnyehn-e. Tibre Jisos jo ba elsehnge go mbang nyio.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Eji Jisos ba rehng edi jio, á kehm kpuru ero, kehm-e tongo re, “Sakeus, badde elwaare, tibre lela m bahke kange go ega etahk.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Owo á kehm badde elwaare, ba vvr-e go eyebatahng.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Bo nyehne kan ano, bo kehm kehme elmemme ane kpee re, “Nne noa ebtahm re á song kang a nne no li na nne abiafem.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 15:2</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Sakeus kehm mehle yiimi, kehm bungu tong Ntul a Jisos re, “Nsoo, m bahke yange nsol enyame, yehke ejang ka akpak. Nne awohng awohng no n nehm-e go ejum ajehng ajehng, m bahk-e gale nkpel eni budu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Owo Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Lela eltahre ebba go etahk jia, tib eji á tob li mmon no Ebraham.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 13:16</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Tibre Mmon no nne ba re á ba seb, fere tahre jio ji ma tan.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 1:15</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bada ntul no tahme nlaabambang ejahbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Eji ane bao wuku nsol nyio, Jisos kehm tubu bo elgan. Tibre ngare nyio yebkabbe go Jeusalem, ane bao jo fere tir re, etul bi Esowo bahke soro ba tvtv. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Owo wahng ka á kehm bungu re,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:12">“Mmon a ntul awohng jolo go, no tahme nlaabambang ejahbe re á song li etul feere.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:3,28</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Re á kehm tahme, á lungu alokeltum ebe, ane awubu, ka bo mpon ewubu ewubu, kehm tongo bo re, ‘Roden akpohko nyaa, wahn jen are tete me n feere ba.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 16:15; Elt 1:8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />“Ejahbe eje ko-e ekv, owo bo kehm tiingi etib tv-e re, bo nehme seb re á ba jol ntul abo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:11</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Eji á ma song li etul feere, á kehm ba lung alokeltum ebe, ba á ka bo akpohko re bo ba, eji á lꞌkahn ana bo ma li nsehng go are ma bo ma jen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />“Ngbokambang a nlokeltum kehm bake, ba yiimi go ege esamahr, kehm bungu re, ‘Nsoo, mpon ewubu enya nyi a ka-m no eblim mpon atahl alon.’<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />“Owo á kehm-e tongo re, ‘Woblim sehng, nnooba nlokeltum. Tib eji a ma bel ekakesehk go mmonsꞌsohka mmojum, a bahke jo fili ejahbe na ebwubu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />“Etoono nlokeltum noko kehm kpe lohng ba, ba bung re, ‘Nsoo, mpon ewubu enya nyi a ka-m no eblim mpon atahl abal a mpon ewubu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />“Owo á kehm-e tongo re, ‘A bahke jo fili ejahbe na eblon.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Noko kehm kpe lohng ba, ba bung re, ‘Nsoo, nyehn mpon ewubu enya ga! N kake go egame afiafong, song bum go. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />N jo fahl-a fahl. Tibre a li ebibbib nne sehng. A kpo rod nsol nyi ki li wo bumu no. A kpo kpa nsol nyi a ki bahm.’<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />“Á kehm-e tongo re, ‘Wo ebꞌbi nlokeltum noa, m bahke koko alum nnyo enya lam-a. A kꞌkahn re, me ebibbib nne ji. N kpo rod nsol nyi n ki bum, fere kpa nsol nyi n ki bahm. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Jen ji wahnge a ki ka njenare akpohko enyame, kehn eji m ma feere ba, n jol ba ko, fere ko nsehng budu?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Owo á kehm bungu tong ane ba yiimi ona re, ‘Taaren ye mpon ewubu nyio, wahn faake a nyi ka nne no kpi mpon atahl alon.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 6:1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />“Bo kehm-e tongo re, ‘Nsoo, á kpi mpon atahl alono!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Á kehm faange re, ‘N kp-n tongo re, nne awohng awohng no lꞌbel, bo bahk-e kake na budu. Nne no ki kpi, jol ji á kpi no, bo bahk-e taare.<verse eid="LUK 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />“ ‘Anebekv ebame bao ba kil sebe re me m ba jol ntul abo, song koon bo ba, wahn ba wul bo go egame esamahr.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yele go Jeusalem a egburu ellub</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mak 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jon 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Eji Jisos ma bung ano, á kehm soro asi asongo go Jeusalem.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Eji á ba rehng kohlo go Betfage, a Betani, ajahbe nya li go nnahb ewong ji bo kpo lung re Oliv, á kehm yehke abatꞌtoono ebe na abal tum. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Re á kehm tumu bo, á tongo bo re,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:30">“Songen go ejahbe ji li go egahna mbuksong. Ń lꞌsong rehng ejahbe jio, eji ń fi no, ḿ bahke nyehne mmon a mbvankang no bo kal-e kꞌkuumu, no bo tohk-e go eti. Fanngen ye, wahn ko-e ba a ne! <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌbahb-n re, ‘Jen ji wahnge ń kp-e fannge?’ faangen ye re, ‘Ntul wo kp-e sebe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Ane ba Jisos tumu bo kehm lohko je, lohko song nyehn ana Jisos tongo bo.<verse eid="LUK 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Eji bo jo fannge mmon a mbvankang noo, owo afono mbvankang nyio kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌfannge mbvankang nyio?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Owo bo kehm faange re, “Ntul wo kp-e sebe.”<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Bo kehm koko mbvankang nyio tahm a nyi goji Jisos, fere yehke nsol nyi bo kake no, yal mbvankang nyio go njahm, fere mehl Jisos jehke.<verse eid="LUK 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Eji mbvankang jo jen a ne asongo, bo kehme abomo ebo yal go mbang. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Eji á jo badde go ewong jio asongo, ngare nyi á ma kabbe go Jeusalem, ellong abatꞌtoono ebe gbalee kehm kehme elgeere, fere jo tehk Esowo wahre wahre tib go agburu akpokosi nya bo ma nyehn.<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bo jo bungu re, “Elfuulu li a ntul no kpꞌbake go mbing nyi Jehova. Elkoono jol go ejahbetul Esowo, ellub jol go ero!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 2:14</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Egom Farisi jindiki ji woomo go ellong ane bao kehm-e tongo re, “Ntꞌtibi, nyam abatꞌtoono eba!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Jisos kehm faange re, “N kp-n tongo re, Ane baa lꞌbelle, atal bahke kehme elrabe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:9; 1 Pit 2:5</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lingi Jeusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Eji bo ba rehng kohlo go Jeusalem, eji á ma nyehn yefono ejahbe, á kehm kehme ellingi re,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 23:28</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />“N kpꞌsebe re wahn lub kahn lela ejum ji bahke koko elkoono ba a ni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 16:33</char></note> wo anv, ń nehme ma nyehn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:15</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Tibre afung nyao bahk-n kpiri, nya anebekv ebahne bahke bake, ba senng-n kak, fere kohk-n tv. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bo bahke rannge ejahbe ejahne kpee, a ane kpee ba lene o. Jol eltal anehng anehng nehm kpe jol ni bahke sake kuumu a ntem egahne ejahbe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 21:6</char></note> Tibre ń kahnem ngare nyi Esowo ba re á ba tahr-n.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos je go etahk Esowo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mak 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jon 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Jisos kehm yange go etahk Esowo, song kehme ane bao kam, ba ji o, jo gungu nsol, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />fere tong bo re, “Bo nyono go nwer Esowo re, Esowo bungu re, ‘Etahk ejame bahke jolo etahk ero akake.’ Wahn ebfere rod bum ana ebehre awajv.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 3:16-17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Jisos jo tibi efung abehng abehng go etahk Esowo. Atubesi abalimajom, atꞌtibi ba atahm, a atubesi ane jo sebe re bo wul-e. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Jol bo tikem kahn mbang ana nyi bo bahke limi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:53</char></note> Tibre ane kpee jo wuung-e atung sehng, eji ellum ene anehng anehng lꞌkꞌgbo ndi.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bada nsahm nyi Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mak 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Efung abehng eji Jisos jo tib ane go etahk Esowo, fere jo tiingi bo nnoobo etib, owo atubesi abalimajom, a atꞌtibi ba atahm, a anebkul nfam kehm lohngo ba, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />ba bahb-e re, “Tong-r, nsahm anyi a kpi no, nyi wahnge a kpo lim nsol ana nyia?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 6:19</char></note> Nne awo ka-a ka nsahm nyꞌnehm a?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Owo á kehm faange bo re, “Me fvfo, m bahk-n tob bahb mbahbe. Tong-m wahn, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />anv, ewohngalahb ji Jon lohng go ejahbetul Esowoa, afi lohng goji ane?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Bo kehm kehme eltoobo atemtem re, “E lꞌtong re, ‘Lohng go ejahbetul Esowo,’ á bahke bungu re, ‘Jen ji wahnge ń ki taame tv Jon?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />E lꞌfere tong re, ‘Lohng goji ane,’ ane kpee bahk-r atal tuubu.” Tibre bo jo sahb kꞌkahn re, Jon jolo nnyehnamahr Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 3:15</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Owo wahnge bo kehm faange re, bo nehme kahn edi ji lohng no ba.<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Jisos kehm tob tong bo re, “Ano wo fvfo n lꞌki-n tob tong nsahm nyi n kpi no, nyi wahnge n kpo lim nsol nyia.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bade abayaame etahngga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mak 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Jisos kehm tubu elgan nia tong ane re,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:9">“Nne awohng jolo go, no bahme avain go ege etahngga, fere rod yaame ane, kehm tahme eje song rehng go ejahbe jehko, kang go ekidi lꞌlab. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Ngare biingi kan a me, á kehm tumu nlokeltum ewe tv ane ba á yaame bo etahngga eje re bo song bong akab nti nyandiki go etahngga ba ka-e. Abayaame etahngga bao fere dv-e na, kam-e, á feere abo abo.<verse eid="LUK 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />“Owo á kehm kpe tum nlokeltum noko. Ye fvfo, bo tob dv-e ano, fere son-e, kam-e, á feere abo abo. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Á kehm kpe bulu, kpe tum noko. Noa ana, bo bom-e elok, fere kam-e yake go.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:34</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />“Owo nfono etahngga noo kehm bungu re, ‘Anv, m bahke limi renan abee? M bahke gohro tum akor-m mmon ewame. Fundiki á bahke bo lub.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:4</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />“Eji abayaame etahngga bao nyehn-e no, bo kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, ‘Ye wo li nlehkelkv, nong, wahr wulen ye, eji etahngga jia lꞌfere jol jꞌjahre.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 2:22</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Owo bo kehm-e yehke go etahngga jio, song wul-e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Anv, jen ji nfono etahngga noo bahke bo lim? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Á bahke bake ba wul abayaame etahngga bao, fere faake etahngga jio ka ane bandiki.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 22:7-9</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Eji ane bao wuku ano, bo kehm bungu re, “Esowo kꞌtaame!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Owo Jisos kehm seenge bo too, kehm bungu re, “Anv, edi nwer Esowo jia lohngo renan, ji bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“ ‘Eltal ni asehketahk tene no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">ni ni ma fere jol nnahb ekahme?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 2:4,6</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌgbo go eltal nio, á bahke banne. Eltal nio lꞌfere gbo na, nyede nne, bahk-e wade na wade.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bade etak atahbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mak 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Atꞌtibi ba atahm, a atubesi abalimajom gare re bo bob Jisos ngare nyꞌnehm ona. Tibre bo jo kahne re, á tubu elgan nio bada bo. Fvfo, bo jo fꞌfahl ane. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Owo bo kehm-e kehme elbaabe, fere tum ane ba bo ka bo ngu, bo song kehme awak lim, are bo atingitingi ane ba, eji bo lꞌbob-e go ege alum nnyo, fere yak-e kak ntubesi ejahbe go ebo, eji á lꞌlam-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 11:54</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Ntꞌtibi, e kpꞌkahne re, wo kpo bung, fere tib go nseenga nseenge. Wo kpehme rang nnene. A kpo lohko tib mbang nyi Esowo go etingitingi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Anv, atahm enyahre tꞌtaame ka-r re wahr jo tahb etak ka ntul a Roma, afi taamem?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Jisos kꞌkahn awak ebo. Owo á kehm tongo bo re, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />bo tib-e nsiring, kehm fere bahb bo re, “Anv, esi jia ji nyehne ji? Mbing nyia nyi nyehne nyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Bo kehm-e faange re, “Nyi ntul a Rom nyi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Á kehm tongo bo re, “Kaan ntul a Rom ji li ka-e, wahn ka Esowo ji li ka Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 13:1-7</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Bo we maam tiki bob go ellum anehng anehng go esamahr ane. Owo bo kehm belle, tib eji nfaange enye jo kpo bo esi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bade elnyahme go elkv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mak 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Egom Sadusi jindiki kehm lohngo ba goji Jisos. Bo ba li ane ba kpo bung re, “Elnyahme go elkv limm.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 23:8</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Bo kehm-e tongo re, “Ntꞌtibi, Moses nyono ntahm ka-r re, ‘Nne lꞌkpo, nkal ewe sa, eji á ki jel mmon awohng awohng, mmonannyehn nkvne bahke koko nnenkal noo, jel abon ka mmonannyehn no ma kpo.’<verse eid="LUK 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />“Jolo abonanyehn na asehma. Ngbokambang kehm koko nkal. Mmon awohng awohng á jelem, á kpo. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Etoono kehm tob ko nnenkal nonehm o, kehm kpoko. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Noko gona kehm kpe ko nnenkal nonehm o. Ano wo jolo a ane asehma bao kpee. Mmon awohng awohng bo jelem, kehm kpoko. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Esꞌkohro, nnenkal noo gohro kpo. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Go efung bi ane lꞌnyahme go elkv, á bahke jolo nkal a nyehne? Tibre bo ane asehma kpee ko-e ana nkal abo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Ane ba li eying jia ji anv kpo ko akal, anebkal bal alum. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ane ba fuumu re bo nyahme go elkv, fere jol go eying ji kpꞌbake nehm kpe jo ko akal, anebkal nehm kpe jo bal alum. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bo nehm kpe jo kpo, tibre bobjol ana babenjel. Eji bo ma nyahme go elkv, bobfere jol abon ba Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 3:1-2</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Elnyahme go elkv nia. Jol Moses tib-r tib, eji á nyono bade eti jio ji jo lul. Owo á lungu Jehova re, ‘Esowo bio bi Ebraham, a bi Aisik, a bi Jekob.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Á limm Esowo bi akvne, á li Esowo bi ane ba li go elkpin. Tibre bo kpꞌkpini ka ye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:30; 16:23</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Atꞌtibi ba atahm bandiki kehm faange re, “Ntꞌtibi, a bungu go nseenge.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Bo kpeem sahb bahb Jisos mbahbe anyehng anyehng.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bada Mesaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mak 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Anv, jen ji wahnge bo kpo bung re, Mesaya mmon a Devid wo? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Tibre yefono Devid bungu go nwer a Saams re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“ ‘Jehova tongo ntul ewame re, Ji go egame ejang eboblum,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />tete me n lim anebekv eba etikunakpade eja.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Eji Devid lung-e re, ‘Ntul ewame’, anv, á kehm jolo mmon ewe renan?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 5:5; 22:16</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos rehke ane bade atꞌtibi ba atahm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mak 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Jisos kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe go esamahr ane kpee re, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Jo gberen atꞌtibi ba atahm, ba kpo kor bo re bo jo kak akpawobo yannge. Kpo kor bo re, ane jo gong, kak bo nnyo go are. Go ekpꞌkpa ero, afi jolo go nkak, kpo kor bo re bo jo ji adi nji nya ajꞌjok ane kpo ji. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bo kpo taare akalebun ntahk ebo, fere jo kak alaabe aro go nnyo a nnyo. Elam ji bo bahke gbale sehng.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:48; Jems 3:1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Ayare nya nkalebun ka no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mak 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Jisos kehm tabe esamahr ebe, kehm nyehne afang ane kpꞌkake akpohko ayare ebo go elkohl akpohko ni jolo go etahk Esowo. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Á kehm tob nyehn nkpak a nkalebun kpꞌkake ederi ebbal. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Owo á kehm bungu re, “Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Nkpak a nkalebun noa wo ga ka sehnge bo ane kpee. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Egom jehko jo ka gbalee, jo sa bo gbalee go. Ye ji li nkpak kaa kpee ji á bele no, ji kehn á jol ma ko, gunu nsol alehke.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 8:1-3</char></note><verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erem, a afemfem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-14">Mat 24:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-13">Mak 13:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Egom ebo jindiki jo bungu bade etahk Esowo, ana bo liibi no go anoobo atal, a nsol nyi bo ko akpohko ayare gunu. Owo Jisos kehm bungu re, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Bada nsol nyi ń kpꞌnyehne a, ngare kpꞌbake nyi eltal anehng anehng lꞌkꞌkpe sa kuumu a ntem. Bo bahke wake kpee wohng ndi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:43-44</char></note><verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Ntꞌtibi, anv, jia bahke limi ngare anyi? Ellingi ani bahke tibi re, yahke ba ellimi?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Owo Jisos kehm faange re, “Jo kunen ekpu, eji bo lꞌki-n nehm. Tibre ane gbalee bahke bake go egama mbing, fere jo bung re, ‘Me wo a!’ fere bung re, ‘Ngare ebkabbe!’ Kana jo toono bo! <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Ń lꞌwuk bada nta, fere wuk bade ana ane bahke kehme asi tab, fere jo ten atubesi ebo, kana jo fahl! Nsol nyio bahke tohko gbo mbang lim. Fvfo, lohngem re, esꞌkohro ji ma kabbe o.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Jisos kehm kpe tong bo re, “Ejahbe ajehng ajehng bahke noko a njahm ejahbe nyehko. Ajahbe bahke jo nok atemtem. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Adi nyandiki, ndi bahke jo gbehke sehng. Njal bahke jolo, a ayam nya bahke jo sehnge ane. Amenngemennge nsol, a agburu nliingi bahke jo tib go elbung.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />“Re nsol nyia kpee kehm limi, bo bahke jo bob-n, fere jo nohk-n, jo ko-n tahm a nahne go ntahk ero, fere jo kak-n go ngbekobo. Bo bahk-n jo ko tahm a nahne, song yiimi go esamahr atul, a atubesi tib go egama mbing.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:11</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Jia ji bahk-n limi, eji ń lꞌyiimi ntianse ka-m.<verse eid="LUK 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />“Nong, ntim enyahne jo tahn-n, eji ń lꞌkꞌjo tiiri ana ḿ bahke faange, ngare kehm rehnge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:19</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Tibre m bahk-n kake alum nya ḿ bahke bungu, fere ka-n elkahne, eji anebekv ebahne lꞌkꞌma faange, fere jo ten. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Jol babnso ejahne, a abonane ebahne, a nnahb enyahne, a ate ebahne bahk-n jabbe ka. Egom ejahne jindiki, bo bahke wulu na bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 16:1-3; Ell 2:10,13</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Ane kpee bahk-n koko ekv tib go egama mbing. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Jol ellv esi enahne anehng anehng limm, ni bahke tane. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ń lꞌjo kpuumu, ḿ bahke tahre atohko enyahne.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo bahke rannge Jeusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mak 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Ń lꞌnyehn nlong nsoja ma ba sennge Jeusalem kak, owo ḿ bahke kahne re, bahke gulu elrannge. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Nong, ane ba li go Judea be song go awong ngare nyio, ane ba li go Jeusalem tahm ejahbe jio song. Ane ba li go bo ebgbe, nong, bo kꞌkpe feere ba go Jeusalem. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Tibre afung nyao nya li afung elbongo, eji nsol kpee nyi bo nyono go nwer Esowo lꞌlohko jol go etingitingi.<verse eid="LUK 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Eyuu a anebkal ba bahke jolo ela, a ane ba bahke jo yab abon ngare nyio. Ndon bahke gbale sehng ejahbe jio. Erakatahng ji Esowo bahke gboko kuumu ane bao. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bo bahke wulu bo go ekahngkahng. Egom jehko, bo bahke bobo bo, tahm abo, bo song jol aneb agbekobo go ejahbe ajehng ajehng ji li go njini. Ane baka baka bahke jo kadde Jeusalem go akpade akpade tete ngare abo biingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 11:25; Ell 11:2</char></note><verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elbake ni Mmon no nne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mak 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Nliingi bahke jo tib go njul, fere jo tib go ebareka, a alonlo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 6:12-13</char></note> Ane ba li go njini, ala bahke jo teele bo, eko fere jo tan bo. Bo nehm jo kahn ji bo bahke limi tib go ewahl ji agburu aya, a ebuku bahke jo wahl. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Ane bahke jo gbo elkv tib elfahle, eji bo kpꞌsiki nsol nyi kpꞌbake go njini kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 6:15-16</char></note> Tibre atahm nya kpi elbung bahke range. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Owo bo bahke nyehne Mmon no nne kpꞌbake go ekparesemsem, a nsahm, a egburu ellub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 19:11-16</char></note><verse eid="LUK 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />“Nsol nyio lꞌkehme ellimi, kpiiden asamahr enyahne go ero, wahn tab asi enyahne wahre, tibre eltahre enahne kpꞌkabbe abake.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 4:16-17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bade efig</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mak 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Jisos kehm tubu bo elgan re, “Kpuren eti ji bo kpo lung re efig,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 13:6-9; Mat 21:19</char></note> a nti nyehko kpee. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Ń lꞌsoro nyꞌnyehn eji ma kehme elnyono, ḿ bahke kahne re, nnale yahke ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Mbang nyꞌnehm nyi, ń lꞌtob nyehn nsol nyio kpee kpꞌlimi, ḿ bahke kahne fvfo re, etul bi Esowo ebkabbe. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Ane ba bahke jolo go elkpin ngare nyio nehm kpo tete nsol nyio kpee lim. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Elbung abola ndi bahke tane, alum enyame nehm tiki tan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 16:17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo kunen ekpu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Jo baaben elnahne, goji nkak alimi, a amahm awoko a atꞌtiiri nya elkpin nia lꞌki-n gbal go egahna ntim, eji efung bio lꞌki-n gbede na.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 4:19; Mat 6:31-33</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Tibre efung bio bahke gbede ane kpee ba li go njini, ana ntahmfuk nyi bo kpo saade konngo nsahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 5:3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Jo baaben ngare kpe kpe, wahn jo kak ero, eji ń lꞌbel eko ji ḿ bahke foro go nsol nyio kpee nyi bahke limi, wahn fere yiimi go esamahr bi Mmon no nne.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 13:33</char></note><verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Efung abehng abehng Jisos jo tibi go etahk Esowo. Atv lꞌbehde, á jo kono eljeke song kang go ewong ji bo kpo lung re Oliv. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Efungfu atv atv ane kpee jo lohngo ba go etahk Esowo re bo ba wuk-e.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Ana bo jo lam kak Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mak 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jon 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Eji elkak ni bo jo li abred nya bo kil jo kak ayist ma kabbe, ni bo kpo lung re Pasova, <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />owo atubesi abalimajom, a atꞌtibi ba atahm jo seb mbang ana nyi bo bahke wulu Jisos. Fvfo, bo jo fꞌfahl ane.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Judas taame re á bahke gungu Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mak 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Ngare nyio nnehm kehm yele Judas ji bo jo lung-e re Iskariot, ji woomo go ellong abatꞌtoono Jisos, ewubu ane abal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:2,27</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Owo Judas kehm tahme song kpiri atubesi abalimajom, a atubesi ane ba jo baabe etahk Esowo, fere toobo a bo ana á bahke jabbe Jisos ka bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Atahng yebe bo sehng, owo bo kehm taame re, bo bahk-e kake akpohko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 6:9</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Judas kehm taame, kehm kehme mbang seb nyi á bahke jabbe Jisos ka bo, eji ane bako ki li.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos toobo ebjing bi elkak nio</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:17-25">Mat 16:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mak 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jon 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Owo efung kehm ba rehng bi elkak ni abred nya ki kpi ayist, bi bo jo wul abon ejoro ba Pasova. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Jisos kehm tongo Pita abola Jon re bo song toobo edi bum bo, ji bo bahke lehke elkak Pasova. Owo á kehm tumu bo tv.<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Re bo kehm tahme, bo tohk-e bahb re, “Gan wo a kpꞌsebe re wahr song toobo bum?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Owo á kehm faange bo re, “Wuungen atung! Ń lꞌyel go nla ejahbe, ḿ bahke wane nne no solo etulahb.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:30; Mat 17:27</char></note> Toonen ye, song go etahk ji á bahke yange, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />wahn tong nfontahk re, ‘Ntꞌtibi kp-a bahbe re, Gan wo ekpꞌkpa li no, ji m bahke jehke, li elkak Pasova, a abatꞌtoono ebame?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Á bahk-n tibi egburu ekpꞌkpa ajehng ji li go ero enyong ji bo ma jehke nti. Owo ḿ bahke toobo nsol kpee bum.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bo kehm lohko tahm, lohko song nyehn ejum ajehng ajehng ana Jisos tongo bo, kehm toobo nsol elkak Pasova bum.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsol alehke nyi elbuumu Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mak 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Eji ngare biingi no, á kehm song ji go ekpꞌkuru, a abatiingetib ebe. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Owo á kehm tongo bo re, “Jo kor-m sehng re me n li elkak Pasova nia a nahne, kehm nyehne erem. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Tibre n kp-n tongo re, N nehm kpe tiki li elkak nia, tete n li etingitingi elkak a nahne go ejahbetul Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 13:29</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Owo á kehm rodo nkob, kak Esowo saam, kehm bungu re, “Koon, wahn wo, wahn ane kpee. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Tibre n kp-n tongo re, Bomo anv asongo n nehm kpe tiki wo alahb avain tete etul bi Esowo ba.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Owo á kehm rodo ebred, kak Esowo saam, fere bakke, ka bo, kehm bungu re, “A wo li ngubjing enyame, nyi bo kp-n kake. Jo limen ana, eji ń lꞌjo buum-m.”<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Eji bo ma li nsol mal, go mbang nyꞌnehm nyi á tob ka bo nkob, fere bung re, “Nkob nyia nyi li egbanngalung ji nfenfe tib go alung emame ma kpꞌfabe ka-n.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Nyehnen, nne no kp-m gungu, á jehk a name ana go ekpꞌkuru.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:21-30</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Tibre Mmon no nne bahke kpoko ana Esowo toobo no. Eyuu a nne no kp-e gungu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 18:7</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Owo bo kehm kehme elbahbe atemtem re, “Nne awo go egahre ellong no bahke limi elkohn ejum ana jia?”<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne awo ga gbal?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:25-28">Mat 20:25-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-45">Mak 10:42-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Owo nfaabe kehm gboko abatꞌtoono Jisos bada nne no bo bahk-e bumu ana nne no ga gbal go bo ellong.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:46-48</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Atul ba njini nyia kpꞌkpi nsahm nyi bo kpo fili ane ebo. Atubesi ane, bo kpo lung bo re, ‘Akubi!’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ano sang bahke jolo go egahne. Ga nob re nne no ga gbal go egahne ellong jol ana mmonse. Ntubesi bahke jolo ana nlokeltum. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Anv, nne awo ga gbal, nne no jehk go ekpꞌkuru, afi nne no kp-e loko wo? No jehk go ekpꞌkuru sang ga gbal? Eji n li a nahne, n li ana nlꞌloko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 15:8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Wahn ba li ane ba ma jol a name kpee go egame elgaare.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:16</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Ana nsoo ma-m ka ejahbe re me n fili, ano wo fvfo m ma-n tob ka, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />eji ń lꞌjo li nsol ekpꞌkuru ajehng a name go egame ejahbetul, fere ji go nti etul, jo lam ewubu etꞌtohngo ebbal bi Israel.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos nyehne amahr bade ana Pita bahk-e tene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mak 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jon 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Ntul a Jisos kehm bungu re, “Saimon, nnehm sebe re á ko nsahm nyi á bahk-n febe ana bo kpo febe arasi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 2:11; 1 Pit 5:8; Ell 2:10</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Me n kak ero ka-a, eji a lꞌkꞌgbo go egama mbang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:9,15</char></note> Ngare nyi a ma fere gbo ndon, jo kak abonane eko!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 21:15-17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Owo Pita kehm-e faange re, “Ntul, me n toobo ebjing re me n je ngbekobo a na, jol afi elkv ni, m bahke kpoko a na.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Pita, n kp-a tongo re, Lela a bahke gbaame nkpel era re, me a nehme kahn, nkok kehm kuku.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gungu mbomo ema, wo gunu ekahngkahng!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Ngare nyi n tum-n no, eji ń ki fili abon abam akpohko, fere fili abam efilibo, a akpaketa, ejum jia ji rin-n noa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Bo kehm faange re, “Ejumjum wahr rinem.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:1-6</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Anv, nne no lꞌbel mmombam akpohko, afi á bele ebam efilibo, nong, á fili. Nong, nne no ki kpi ekahngkahng gungu mbomo eme, song gunu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 13:10; Ef 6:17</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Tibre n kp-n tongo re, Edi nwer Esowo ji bungu re, ‘Bo m-e fange kak go ellong abi ane’, bahke lohko jol go etingitingi. Tibre ji bo nyono bada name bahke lohko jol go etingitingi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Owo abatꞌtoono ebe kehm bungu re, “Ntul, nyehn akahngkahng na abal a!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 9:32</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Á kehm faange bo re, “Ebgbal.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 14:41</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kake ero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mak 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Jisos kehm lohngo tahm go ewong ji bo kpo lung re Oliv, ana á jo kono ellimi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 21:37</char></note> Abatꞌtoono ebe tahm toon-e. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Eji á song rehng edi jio, á kehm tongo bo re, “Jo kaken ero, eji ń lꞌkꞌyel go elgaare.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Á kehm jeere song rehng go esꞌsong ekidi labe ana nne bahke roko eltal song rehng. Owo á kehm jamme alahng, kehm kehme ero kak re, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Nsoo, lꞌkor-a, fak-m nkob erem nyia! Ana koro me sang, ana koro wo wo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Owo enjel kehm soro lohng go ejahbetul Esowo ba kak-e eko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 1:13; Hib 1:14</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Eji ala jo sahb teel-e teele, á kehm nyennge, jo kak ero. Nwuuru nyi á wuuru no, nyi jo toongo wohngo ndi jolo ana agburu atoongo alung.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Eji á mehle go edi ji á jo kak ero, á kehm feere goji abatꞌtoono ebe, song kpiri bo, bo kpꞌlale, tib ndon nyi jo fili bo.<verse eid="LUK 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Owo á kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌlale? Tahmen, wahn kak ero, eji ń lꞌkꞌyel go elgaare.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo bobo Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mak 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jon 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Eji á kpi mbungu mbungu, ellong ane kehm soro lohng abake. Nne no bo jo lung-e re Judas ji woomo go ellong abatꞌtoono Jisos, ewubu ane abal, ye wo jo tib bo mbang. Eji bo ma rehng goji Jisos, Judas kehm jeere kohlo Jisos re á sod-e nnyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Owo Jisos kehm-e bahbe re, “Judas, anv, a bahke jabbe Mmon no nne ka go nnyo asoda?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Eji abatꞌtoono Jisos nyehne ji yahke lim, owo bo kehm bahbe re, “Ntul, wahr ko akahngkahng enyahre, song nok a boa?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Nne awohng go bo ellong kehm fohko ekahngkahng ebe, kpale nju nyi ntubesi abalimajom etung eboblum.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Owo Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Ka kpe lim ano!” Á kehm rodo etung nne noo, feere a bi lak-e, á nob.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Jisos kehm bahbe atubesi abalimajom, a atubesi ane ba jo baabe etahk Esowo, a anebkul nfam ba ba re bo ba bob-e re, “Ń lohngo a akahngkahng, a atahmtahm atahmtahm ana ń kpꞌbake a nwajv boba? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />N jo jolo a nahne go etahk Esowo efung abehng abehng, me ń lakem abo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 21:37; Jon 7:30</char></note> A wo li ngare enyahne, a nyi atubesi ba ejannge.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:20; 14:30-31; Ef 6:12; Kol 1:13</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Pita tene Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mak 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jon 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Owo bo kehm bobo Jisos tahm a ne go etahk ntubesi abalimajom. Jisos jo jene ekv, Pita jen ekv. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Bo kono agun go nlaaga nyio, ji sennge kak. Pita kehm tob song ji o a bo.<verse eid="LUK 22:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Eji nlokeltum no jolo nnenkal nyehne Pita jehk go agun, owo á kehm-e seenge too, kehm bungu re, “Nne noa fvfo tob jolo a ne!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Owo Pita kehm gbaame re, “Nnenkal, me we n nehme kahn.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Eji ma kpe ji mmongare ntiil, nne noko kehm-e tob nyehn, kehm bungu re, “A tob wob go bo ellong.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Owo Pita kehm tene re, “Eꞌee mbi, me sang.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 2:11-12</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Eji ma kpe ji ejum awa anyehng, nne noko kehm kpe bung tꞌtahne re, “Etingitingi, nne noa tob jolo a ne fvfo, tibre ye nne a Galili wo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Owo Pita kehm faange re, “Mbi, n nehme kahn ji a kpꞌbꞌbung.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Tvtv ona eji á kpi mbungu mbungu, nkok kehm soro kuk.<verse eid="LUK 22:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Ntul a Jisos kehm soro keebe, seenge Pita.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:61 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tim 2:13</char></note> Owo Pita kehm buumu ellum ni Ntul a Jisos bungu no tong-e re, “Re nkok kehm kuku lela, a bahk-m tene nkpel era.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:61 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:34</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Pita kehm soro lohng ona, song kehme ellingi ndon ndon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 7:10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo jo nyok Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mak 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Ane ba jabbe Jisos kehm-e kehme elnyoko, fere jo dv-e. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bo tob gba-e mbomo go esamahr, kehm-e bahbe re, “Nyehn amahr me! Anv, nne awo ma-a rum?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Bo kpe bung alum nyako gbalee, nya bo jo su-e.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yiimi go esamahr elam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mak 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Jon 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Eji efungfu ma se, anebkul Jus, atubesi abalimajom, a atꞌtibi ba atahm kehm ba kono edi ajehng, kehm koko Jisos ba a ne go bo elam, kehm-e tongo re, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />“Tong-r, joare wo wo li Mesaya!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:67 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:24-25</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Owo Jisos kehm faange bo re, “N lꞌtong-n anv, ń nehm taame. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />N lꞌfere bahb-n na, ń nehm faange.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 11:29-33</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Bomo anv asongo, Mmon no nne bahke jehke go eboblum Esowo bi gbale sehng.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bo ane kpee kehm bahbe re, “Anv, wo wo li Mmon no Esowoa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Me wo, ḿ bungu nseenge.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Owo bo kehm bungu re, “Anv, e bahke kpe seb ntiansea? Wahrfono antahng ebwuk go ege a nnyo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yiimi go esamahr Pailet, nne a Rom no jo fili Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mak 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jon 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ellong ane bao kpee kehm tahme, ko Jisos song rehng a ne goji Pailet. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Owo bo kehm-e kehme ebi ka re, “E sebe kahn re, nne noa kpi ane ebahre rannge, fere jo sahd-r re wahr kꞌkpe tahb etak ka Ntul a Rom,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 20:22-26</char></note> fere jo bung re, ye wo li Kraist ji li ntul.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 19:15</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Owo Pailet kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, wo wo li ntul no Jusa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Me wo, a bungu nseenge.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pailet kehm tongo atubesi abalimajom, a ellong ane bao re, “Ebi ajehng ajehng n nyehnem ji nne noa ma lim.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Bo kehm kpe nyennge na, jo bung re, “Á kpo lim ntim ane jo jokko go ege eltibi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 11:47-48; Elt 17:6</char></note> Á bomo go Galili, á ma yannge go Judea kpee, anv, á ma ba a.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yiimi go esamahr Herod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Eji Pailet wuku ano, á kehm bahbe, joare Jisos nne a Galili wo. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Á kahne kan a re á lohng go ejahbe ji ntul a Herod kpꞌfili,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 3:1</char></note> á kehm-e tumu tv Herod ji jolo go Jeusalem ngare nyio.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Eji Herod nyehne Jisos, atahng yeb-e sehng. Tibre á bomo elsebe wuku wuku re á nyehn-e, tib eji á wuku bada ne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 9:9</char></note> Á jo tob sebe re á nyehn nkpokosi nyindiki nyi á bahke limi. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Owo Herod kehm bahbe Jisos abahbe tvv, jol Jisos we tikem faange.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:6</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Atubesi abalimajom, a atꞌtibi ba atahm tob jolo ona fvfo. Owo bo jo ka-e ebi gbalee. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Herod, a nsoja enye bum Jisos daange daange daange, fere jo nyok-e, kehm-e kake ekpawobo ji nno a nno, ji jo nyane go amahr, kehm-e tumu tv Pailet. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Efung bio bi, Herod abola Pailet, bo fere jol go etem, tibre wuku wuku bo jolo go ekv.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo lame elam kimi re bo bahke wulu Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mak 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jon 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pailet kehm lungu atubesi abalimajom, a atubesi ane, a ane bako, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />kehm tongo bo re, “Ń ko nne noa ba kak-m go ebo, no ḿ bungu re á kpi ane rannge. Eji m bahb-e abahbe go egahne esamahr, n nyehnem ebi ajehng ajehng ji á limi no, ji wahnge ń kp-e kake ebi. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Ano wo fvfo tob jol goji Herod, tib eji á feere a ne ba ka-m. Nne noa limem ejumjum ji fuumu re bo wul-e. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Owo wahnge m bahke tongo, bo dv-e, n fere yak-e, á song.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 3:13</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Elkak Pasova anehng anehng Pailet jo yehke nne a ngbekobo awohng ka bo.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ellong ane bao kpee kehm rabe nnyo nnyo amehng re, “Song a nne noo, wo song wul-e, wo yake Barabas ka-r.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 3:14</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Barabas, bo kak-e ngbekobo tib eji á jo jokko ejahbe, fere wul nne.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pailet jo sebe re á yehke Jisos yake, owo á kehm kpe bung a bo.<verse eid="LUK 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Bo kpe rabe na re, “Kum-e go ekros! Kum-e go ekros!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Owo Pailet kehm kpe bahb bo go nkpel era re, “Anv, jen ji wahnge? Ebi aji á limi no? N nyehnem ebi ajehng ajehng ji á limi no, ji fuumu re bo wul-e. M bahke tongo bo dv-e, n fere yehk-e yake.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Bo kehm kpe nyꞌnyennge na, jo rabe wahre wahre wahre re bo kum-e go ekros.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 21:36</char></note> Esꞌkohro elrabe ni bo jo gohro rabe kehm gake Pailet.<verse eid="LUK 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Owo á kehm kimi elam ana bo jo seb, <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />fere yehke nne no bo sebe no yake, no bo kak-e ngbekobo tib eji á jo jokko ejahbe, fere wul nne, kehm fere yehke Jisos ka, bo lim-e ana koro bo.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo kumu Jisos go ekros</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mak 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jon 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Eji bo ko Jisos, jo tahm a ne, bo kehm song wane nne awohng no bo jo lung-e re Saimon, ji jolo nne a Sirin. Á lohngo go mmojahbe noko kpꞌtahme go Jeusalem. Bo kehm-e bobo, kun-e ekros re á sol, jo toono Jisos go njahm. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Ellong ane gbalee ba jo toono Jisos, a anebkal ba jo ling-e ndon ndon.<verse eid="LUK 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Owo Jisos kehm keebe, kehm tongo bo re, “Anebkal ba Jeusalem, ka ma wahn kpe ling! Lingen elnahne, wahn ling abon ebahne! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Tibre ngare kpꞌbake nyi bo bahke bungu re, ‘Elfuulu li ka agum anebkal, ba kala jꞌjel, bo ji kala yꞌyabe abon.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 21:23</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Owo bo bahke kehme elbungu tong awong re, ‘Gboon bul-r!’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 6:16; 9:6</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Esowo lꞌlim eti mbir mbir ano, lꞌlim renan, á lꞌkꞌtob lim ekpakv eti ano?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 4:17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Ane abal bako ba jolo abi ane, bo tob ko bo tahm a bo re bo tob song wul bo a Jisos.<verse eid="LUK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Eji bo song rehng go edi ji bo jo lung re edi nkpakesi, owo bo kehm kumu Jisos go ekros, a abi ane bao fvfo, noko go ege ejang eboblum, noko go ege ejang ebobkal.<verse eid="LUK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Nsoo, tahm ka bo, tibre bo nehme kahn ji bo kpꞌlimi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 3:17; 7:60</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Bo kehm tubu elfaange, eji bo lꞌkahn ana bo bahke baange nsol ebjing enye.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Ane yiimi ona, jo nyehn, eji atubesi Jus jo nyok-e re, “Á kpo tahre ane bako, nong, á tob tahre elne, joare ye wo li Kraist ji Esowo ma yehke.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 4:23</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Nsoja tꞌtob nyok-e fvfo, owo bo kehm bake re bo ba ka-e amahm, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />fere bung re, “Lꞌjol re wo wo li ntul no Jus, tahre elna!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Bo tob nyono nwer lake kohlo go ege esi. Nwer nyio bo nyono go Grik, Latin, a Hibru re,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:38">“<char style="sc">A WO LI NTUL NO JUS</char> .”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Ebi nne ajehng ji tob kpaake go ekros kohlo Jisos, kehm-e suku re, “Wo sang li Mesayaa? Tahre elna, wo tob tahr-r me!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Noko kehm-e nyame re, “Anv, a nehme fahl Esowoa, eji bo ma tob kimi elam re bo wul-aa? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Wahr kpꞌnyehne erem bia go nseenge. Tibre e kpꞌbele eltuuru enahre ni fuumu re wahr bel go nsol nyi e limi no. Wo, nne noa, jol ebi ajehng ajehng á limem.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Owo á kehm bungu tong Jisos re, “Buum-m, a lꞌba ji go ega eti etul.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Etingitingi, n kp-a tongo re, Lela a bahke jolo a name go ejahbetul Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:8</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpo no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mak 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jon 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Jolo ejum nkaranka ewubbal nyi efin, nyi ejannge gbo no ejahbe jio kpee, ji tete rehng nkaranka era nyi elgung. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Njul kpeem ya. Ekpiki ji tokko go etahk Esowo kehm yange ejang ebbal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 6:19; 9:3; 10:20</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Owo Jisos kehm rabe wahre wahre wahre re, “Nsoo, me n yake etohko ejame kak go ega ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 7:59</char></note>” Eji á ma bung ano mal, á soro kpo.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ntubesi a nsoja nyehne kan ji ma lim, á kehm kehme Esowo tehk, fere bung re, “Etingitingi, nne noa lohko jol etingi nne.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Ellong ane ba kame ba rur re bo ba nyehn ana bo bahke wulu Jisos, eji bo nyehne ji ma lim, bo kehm feere ebo kehnge ndon ndon. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ane kpee ba kahne Jisos, a anebkal ba lohngo go Galili toon-e ba rehng o, bo yiimi ebo fee, jo nyehn nsol nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 8:1-3</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo kake Jisos go elahm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Nne awohng jolo go, no bo jo lung-e re Josef ji lohng go ejahbe Jus ji bo jo lung re Arimatia. Á jolo nnooba nne, no jolo go etingitingi, fere jol ntul esub. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Á jo siki etul bi Esowo bi kpꞌbake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 2:25-38</char></note> Owo wahnge á ki taame tv ntoobo ebo nyi bo toobo no, fere lim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 3:6; 14:64</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Á kehm tahme song bahb Pailet, joare á bahke taame, á song fono ekv ji Jisos tahm a ji. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Owo á kehm song fono ekv ji Jisos, fere kpennge ekpowo, rod song kak go elahm bi á rahme go ekpartal, bi bo kala kꞌkak nne awohng awohng. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Jolo efung bi bo jo toobo ebjing bi Esabat yahke rehng.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Anebkal ba lohngo go Galili jo toono Jisos kehm tob ba nyehn elahm, fere nyehn ana bo kak-e no. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Owo bo kehm feere, ba toobo anyane, fere toobo akehng bum. Efung Esabat bo kehm jehke, re ekv, ana ntahm bungu no.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos nyahme go elkv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mak 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jon 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ngbokambang efung go erahde, efungfu atv atv, bo kehm rodo anyane nya bo toobo no, tahm a nya go elahm. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Eji bo rehnge go, bo kehm song nyehn eltal nio ma bannge go nnyo elahm, noongo go nkpe. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Owo bo kehm maade yel, jol ekv ji Ntul a Jisos bo nyehnem.<verse eid="LUK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Eji bo yim o, ma bil bo amahr, bo kehm soro nyehn ane abal yim kohlo bo, ba kake nsol nyi jo nyane. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Eji anebkal bao jo fahl, fere kohk asamahr go ndi, ane bao na abal kehm soro kehme elbungu a bo re, “Jen ji wahng ń kpꞌsebe nne a mbir mbir go ellong akvne? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ana á limm. Yebnyahme. Buumen ana á tong-n no ngare nyi á kpeke li go Galili re, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Mmon no nne, bo bahk-e yake, kak abi ane go ebo, bo kum-e go ekros, lꞌkang nfung era, á nyahme go elkv.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 17:22-23</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Owo anebkal bao kehm soro buumu alum enye, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />kehm lohngo go elahm feere, song tooro nsol nyio tong abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu a nne awohng, fere tob tong erik ane bako fvfo. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Anebkal ba tongo abatiingetib nsol nyia jolo Meri ji lohng go Magdala, Joanna, Meri nnyehn Jems, a anebkal bako ba tob jol a bo fvfo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 8:2-3</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Abatiingetib, alum nya anebkal bao tongo bo jolo bo ana emongo. Bo taamem tv bo.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Pita kehm tahme, be song rehng go elahm, kehm song reme fahng, nyehn akpowo nya nya nong no. Owo á kehm feere kehnge, fere jo tir bade ji ma lim.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana abatꞌtoono Jisos na abal jo tahm go Emmaus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mak 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Efung bꞌnehm ona ane abal ba woomo go bo ellong lohngo jo tahm go ejahbe ji bo kpo lung re Emmaus ji jolo ejum mmal esehma, a lꞌtahm go Jeusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Bo jo tubu eka atemtem bada nsol nyia kpee nyi ma lim.<verse eid="LUK 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Eji bo kpi mbungu mbungu atemtem, fere jo tiiri, yefono Jisos kehm lohngo ba kpiri bo, jo jen a bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ngare nyio amahr ebo ka lennge, owo bo ki-e liingi. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Á kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji ń kpꞌbungu tong atemtem, eji ń kpꞌjene asongo ndon ndon?”<verse eid="LUK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Owo nne awohng no bo jo lung-e re Kleopas kehm-e faange re, “Anv, wo ntahngtahng wo ga li njenne nyi li go Jerusalema, nyi kil kahne nsol nyi ma lim a afung nyaa?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Á kehm bahbe bo re, “Nsol anyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Owo bo kehm-e faange re, “Nsol nyi ma lim Jisos ji Nasaret,” ji jolo nnyehnamahr no jo bung alum nya kpi nsahm, fere jo lim agburu akpokosi go esamahr Esowo, a esamahr bi ane kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 21:11</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Atubesi abalimajom ebahre, a atubesi ebahre ba yak-e no ka re bo kimi elam ji bo bahk-e wulu. Owo bo kehm-e kumu go ekros. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Wahr jo kunu ekpu re, ye wo bahke fake Israel yake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 1:6</char></note> Gana yebkpo! Lela nfung era nyi a, nyi nsol nyia limi no.<verse eid="LUK 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />“Fvfo, ji ma-r kpe kpꞌkpo esi, anebkal bandiki ba wob go egahre ellong fungu efungfu atv atv, je go elahm,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 24:1-10</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ekv eje bo nyehnem. Bo kehm feere ba, ba bung re, bobnyehn nkpokosi ejum, eji bo nyehne enjel nyi tongo bo re, á noa go elkpin. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Egom jindiki ji woomo go egahre ellong kehm jeke go elahm, lohko song nyehn jang jang ana anebkal bao bungu no, sehngem yefono wo bo ki-e nyehn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 20:3-10</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Owo Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Wahn agboolo ane baa, jen ji wahnge kpo riid-n go eltaame ejum ajehng ajehng ji anyehnamahr nyono no? <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Tiki li re, Mesaya gbo mbang nyehn erem bia kpee, kehm yele go ege ellub.”<verse eid="LUK 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Owo Jisos kehm lennge adi nwer Esowo kpee nya bungu bada ne tong bo, bomo go awer nya Moses, a awer nya anyehnamahr kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:45</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Bo kehm kabbe ejahbe ji bo fi no. Jo jolo are Jisos yahke sehng asongo. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Bo kehm-e gboongo re, “Ba kang a nahre, tibre elgung ebba, gana ejannge ebkehme elgboko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:29">Owo á kehm song yel ekpꞌkpa re á song kang goji bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Eji á ji ekpꞌkuru, jo li nsol a bo, owo á kehm rodo ebred, kak Esowo saam, bakke, ka bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:19</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Owo amahr ebo kehm soro lennge, bo kehm-e soro liingi. Á kehm soro lamme.<verse eid="LUK 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Owo bo kehm kehme elbungu, jo tong atemtem re, “Ano wo wahnge alum enye jo yall-r, eji á jo bung a nahre go mbang, fere jo lennge nwer Esowo tong-r.”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Owo bo kehm soro mehl tvtv, feere go Jeusalem, ba nyehn abatꞌtoono Jisos, ewubu a nne awohng ma ba kono edi ajehng, a ane ba tob jol a bo o fvfo, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />ba jo bung re, “Ntul a Jisos eblohko nyahme go etingitingi. Saimon m-e nyehn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:5</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Owo ane abal bao kehm tob tooro ana ji limi go mbang tong bo, ana bo liing-e no ngare nyi á bakke ebred.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos ba kpiri abatꞌtoono ebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jon 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Elt 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Eji bo kpi mbungu mbungu, yefono Jisos kehm soro ba lohng go bo elka, kehm bungu tong bo re, “Elkoono jol a nahne!”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Kehm mennge bo, bo kehm kehme elfahle, fere jo tir re, etohko ji bo kpꞌnyehne a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 14:26</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Owo á kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji wahnge eko ma-n tan ana? Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌfaabe go egahna ntim? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Nyehnen abo enyame, wahn nyehn akpade enyame fvfo, eji ń lꞌkahn re mefono antahng wo. Dam-m wahn, wahn nyehn. Tibre etohko, ngubjing kpimm, ana ḿ ma-m nyehn, n kpi no.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Á bungu kan ano mal, á kehm tibi bo abo enye, a akpade akpade. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Eji bo kala tiki taame tib go eyebatahng ji bo bele no, a esi ji jo kpo bo, owo Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Anv, ń kpꞌkpi ejum ajehng ajehng a, ji ellehka?”<verse eid="LUK 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bo kehm-e kake ekv nsahre ji bo ma lam. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Owo á kehm taare li go bo esamahr. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Á kehm tongo bo re, “Alum enyame nya ana, nya n jo bung a nahne ngare nyi n kpeke li a nahne re, Ejum ajehng ajehng ji bo nyono bada name go atahm nya Moses, fere nyon go awer nya abanyehnamahr, a nwer a Saams bahke lohko jol go etingitingi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 24:27</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Owo á kehm lennge ntim ebo, eji bo lꞌkahn nwer Esowo, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />fere tong bo re, “Ana wo bo nyono re, Mesaya bahke nyehne erem, lꞌkang nfung era, á nyahme go elkv, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />bo fere tiingi ane kpee ba li go njini etib bi egbokondon, a bi eltahmeka go abiafem. Go Jeusalem wo, bo bahke bomo etib bio go eltiingi go ege a mbing. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Wahn ba li atianse go nsol nyia. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />M bahke tumu ji nsoo nyame no tv-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 15:26; Elt 1:4-5; 2:1-4</char></note> Jolen ejahbe jia a, tete nsahm nyi bahke lohngo go ero, lohng ba tob-n.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos tahme go ejahbetul Esowo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mak 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Elt 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Owo á kehm rodo bo, tahm abo song rehng go Betani. Owo á kehm tabe abo enye wahre, fuulu bo.<verse eid="LUK 24:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Eji á jo fuulu bo, á kehm soro tahm bo sa. Nsahm nyi Esowo rod-e tahm a ne go ejahbetul Esowo.<verse eid="LUK 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Bo kehm feere go Jeusalem, a egburu eyebatahng. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Bo jo jolo go etahk Esowo ngare anyehng anyehng, jo tehk Esowo, fere jo kak-e saam.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>